<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUKA - Bodjenga</book>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwako Mopele ma Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mwako Mopele imakoma</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Eingeli</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku ɛ Luka na Mikɔ ma ba Apotele idii oko buku emɔti. Luka ona ɔdaka pɛpɛ oda Moyuda, akomea Teofile buku djia susu ibae (Luk 1, 1; Mik 1, 1) tina ɛ ba Gɛlɛke. Ngɔngɔ dja ohomba odjeba odii ba temo ibadaka ko ibaenɛ midjɔ misusu imakɔɔmɔ donga ibange, Luka akoma Mwako Mopele muu bɛngɛɛ Teofile adjebe sooti esusu ɛ bileho ibadiha yo diko la mohelo ma Yesu (1, 1-4) ko na midjɔ imakɔɔmɔ ngɔngɔ dja ogwa ba nde. Aenɛmɛdjaka Yesu elengɛɛ moto ko Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, ona oluma na bwɛli ko na molema motitake odii bato ba bwɛmbu na bia ibadii onɔngɔmɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku ikina dja lotɔndɔkɔ boo Luka adaka monganga ɔ ikɔkɔ la Gɛlɛke ko Poolo adaka mwanango ɔ mosala. Akɛɛ engbanga nɔbɔ Poolo mbunoko Loma (Kls 4, 14; Pilm 24; 2Tim 4, 11). Malɛi madii boo edii oho ta Loma esika ɛkoma yo Mwako Mopele muu ta mbua ɔ 62 mbunoko 65 (ngɔngɔ dja Yesu).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Tina ɛ buku ɛ Luka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Bato bike bameka okoma midjɔ imakokedja Ndjambe ta ndanda ɛ booso. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Balodjebedja moda imalotɔndɔɔ bato bia iba mienɛ na miso donga ibange la mu ko ibadiha elomu ɛ oleha ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ta tina hee mbai koko ngɔngɔ dja ohomba sooti ɛ midjɔ mii misusu moda manɔɔ mo donga ibange eenɛmi opele odii mbai boo naokomee wɛ Teofili moto ɔ gala, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />bɛngɛ boo odjebe sooti ɛ bileho bia ibadiha wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndi adjebedjai obotama ba Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Ta ehole ɛdaka Elode kumu ɔ Yuda, omɔti ɔ nganga ɔ Ndjambe ona obeaka bo Djakalia, adaka ta mbota ɛ banganga ba Ndjambe ba Abia. Mwali ɔ nde Elisabɛti adaka ɔ ibota la Alona. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ibo basusu babae badaka bato ba odjoo boso ba Ndjambe, ko bakokedjaka na pɛpɛ opɛli mibeko ma Kumu na bilomu ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Endolo baidaka na mwana, tina ɛ boo Elisabɛti adaka motete, ko ibo basusu babae baimeaka basuku.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Busa bomɔti, Djakalia adaka ta Tepelo tina ɛ okokedja bilomu ba nde ba onganga ba Ndjambe, tina ɛ boo ɛdaka ngala ɛ mbota ɛ nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Okokana na okɔkɔ ba onganga ba Ndjambe, ahɔɔmɔ na djonga boo aingee ta ndako esɛnɔke ɛ Kumu bɛngɛ boo atumbe mbeka. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Ehole ɛdaka Djakalia atumba paka ɛ so epele bato bike badaka osokolu ta miongɔɔnɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Obwɛndi ɔ Kumu asaenɛmɛdja na Djakalia, aemi diko dɔngɔ la ebɔ ɛ baami ɛ kinda ena ɔtumbaka bo paka ɛ so epele. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Ɔmoenɛ Djakalia, ayeketana ko aluma na bɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Endolo Obwɛndi abala na nde boo: «Djakalia pɛpɛ obanga oko, tina ɛ boo Ndjambe aoki miɔngɔɔnɔ ma wɛ: Elisabɛti mwali ɔ wɛ aobotealea mwa moomi ona olalea wɛ kombe ɛ Yoani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Osepalea obuke mɛɛnɛ ko bato banɛnɛ basepalea tina ɛ obotama ba nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Tina ɛ boo adabi monɛnɛ boso ba Kumu. Amwɛtebi vino, noko na makina mana mapipo. Alumabi na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke donga sɔpɔ dja nango <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />ko asɔmbɛdjabi bato bike ba Isalaele odii Kumu Ndjambe ɔ bobo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Adalabi boso ba nde na mwembo ko na ngulu ɛ Elia tina ɛ osɔmbɛdja bwela pakasa ɛ batata na bana ba bobo. Ahekodjabi milema ma bato ba opokotoi boo badihe owɛi ba bato ba odjoo; ko abɔngɛdjabi tina ɛ Kumu bato baboani okɔ midjɔ mipele.» <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Djakalia abala na obwɛndi boo: «Nadjebalea boo modjɔ muu modii sooti moda nda? Tina ɛ boo naimei mobange, ko mwali ɔ mbai koko aimei mosuku.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Obwɛndi amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Mbai, nadii Gabiɛlɛ ona okaemae boso ba Ndjambe tina ɛ omosalea; nalomami tina ɛ otɔndɔɔ na olwɛɛ gala hee epele. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Endolo odhimiti bibaeli ba mbai, ibikokedjamalea ta ehole ɛ bu; ta tina hee oimealea emimi, ohɔnetelea obala mbunoko iswi ilikokedjamabi midjɔ mii.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ta ehole ena, bato badaka ta yambo ɛ Djakalia, ko bakamoa moda manɛngɛdja yo ekoka ta esika esɛnɔke. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ɔimana yo, aihɔnɔ obala na bu ko bato badjeba boo aenɛ modjɔ ma okamoa imadonga odii Ndjambe ta esika esɛnɔke. Abalaka na bu oko na bimbete ko adikaa emimi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ɔkoka maswi ma Djakalia ma mosala ta tepelo, asɔmbɔ ta ndako ɛ nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ngɔngɔ dja maswi, mwali ɔ nde Elisabɛti alwa deemi, ko asabomba ta ndako songe batano. Asabalea boo: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Hokea modjɔ mokɔi Kumu tina ɛ mbai: ta ehole eeni yo opele boo adongedjɛni muu imapakani sɔni ta boso ba bato basusu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odjebedjama ba obotama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 1:18-23">Mat 1, 18-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ta songe ɔ basamano ɔ deemi la Elisabɛti, Ndjambe aloma Obwɛndi Gabiɛlɛ ta ibonga imɔti la Galilai kombe ɛ lu Nasaleta, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />odii mwana mwali ɔ pɛpɛ odjebana na baami ona oboanedjamaka boo abale moomi omɔti ɔ kombe ɛ Yosepu ɔ ibota la Davidi; kombe ɛ mwana mwali ona ɛdaka Malia. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Obwɛndi aingea odii yo ko abala na nde boo: «Sepa! Kumu ona oenɛmɛdjai bwela ba nde bonɛnɛ, adii na wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Malia ayeketana na bibaeli bia, asahɔdja tina ɛ ndese ena ɛmopa yo. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Obwɛndi abala na nde boo: «Pɛpɛ obanga, Malia, tina ɛ boo, Ndjambe aoinedjai bwela ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Hokea: olwalea deemi, obotalea mwana moomi ona olalea wɛ kombe ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Adabi moto monɛnɛ ko abeamabi Mwana ɔ Ndjambe Oonɔi Diko, ko Kumu Ndjambe amopabi ngbɛndɛ ɛ taata nde Davidi, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />ko ekumu ɛ nde diko la bato ba Isalaele edɛtebi na suka.» <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia abala na obwɛndi boo: «Modjɔ mua mokɔmɔlea moda nda, tina ɛ boo napakita djebana na moomi?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Obwɛndi amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Mwembo Mosɛnɔke adualea diko la wɛ ko ngulu ɛ Ndjambe Oonɔi Diko eohualea na esii ɛ nde. Ta tina hee mwana ona obotamalea adalea mosɛnɔke, bamobealea Mwana ɔ Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Elisabɛti, ona odii ta ibota la wɛ, noko ɔnɔdjai yo ehole ɛ obota; bamobeaka motete adii hadɛdi na deemi la mwana moomi songe basamano. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Tina ɛ boo odii Ndjambe pɛpɛ modjɔ mokadae pɛpɛ okokedjama!» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Bea Malia amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nadii mobuli ɔ Kumu; kina boo misusu makɔɔme na mbai oko bea omiwɛ bala.» Ko obwɛndi amokina.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malia akɛi aindja Elisabɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ngɔngɔ dja maswi, Malia aema ko akɛɛ pɛpɛlɛ ta ibonga imɔti la Yuda ilidii ta ngomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Aingea ta ndako ɛ Djakalia ko aisea Elisabɛti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Omioka Elisabɛti ndese ɛ Malia, mwana ɔdaka ta sɔpɔ dja nde akumana. Elisabɛti aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />ko abala na ngulu boo: «Ɔdjongoama na Ndjambe onɔ bali basusu, ko edjongoli ɛ nde ɛdae diko la mwana ona odii ta sɔpɔ dja wɛ! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Mbai ndani boo nɛngɛ Kumu ɔ mbai adoe odii mbai? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Tina ɛ bo, oeni, ta ehole emii mbai oka ndese ɛ wɛ, mwana akumani na sepi ta sɔpɔ dja mbai. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Odjongoami na Kumu: ɔɔdhima boo Kumu akokedjalea mbuno ɛodjebedja yo!»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yembo ɛ Malia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Na bea Malia abala boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Molimo ma mbai kumedja</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">Kumu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />molema ma mbai molumi na sepi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47">Tina ɛ Ndjambe adii moheledja ɔ mbai;<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />tina ɛ boo aenɛ opele oindja mbai</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">mosali ɔ nde ɔ pɛpɛ gala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Sooti, donga hadɛdi mbunoko bihole bisusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">nabeamalea na bato basusu mwali ona odjongoami<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />tina ɛ boo Ndjambe Onɔi Ngulu akɔi tina ɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">mbai midjɔ minɔi na onɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Kombe ɛ nde edii esɛnɔke,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />aluma na bwela bihole bisusu ta tina ɛ bato ibakamosume.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Aenɛmedja ngulu ɛnde esusu, ananganedja bato ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Malɛi ma molumba,<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />aatitedja bato ba ngulu nase dja ngbɛndɛ dja bobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">ko aihwedja bato ba pɛpɛ ngulu.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Alumedja bato ba ndja na leka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">ko ayanedja badiheli mabɔ bwase.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Adoa akɔmedja mobuli ɔ nde Isalɛlɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">Aibosa oinedja opele ba nde<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Moda imabunedjaka yo bataatasu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">odii Abalayama na mbota dja nde bihole bisusu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia anɛngɛdja nɔbɔ Elisabɛti mbuti na songe basato, ngɔngɔ djia asɔmbɔ odii yo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obotama ba Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ɔkoka ehole ɛ obota, Elisabɛti abota mwana moomi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bato ibadaka mbuti na nde ko na denga la nde baoka boo Kumu amokɔi mongandi monɛnɛ ko basepa na nde engbanga emɔti. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ɔkoka maswi mwambe ngɔngɔ dja obotama, badua tina ɛ olena mwana epole, bapalaka omobea na kombe ɛ sango Djakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Endolo nango abatɔndɔɔ boo: «Pɛpɛ, abeamalea Yoani.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Babala na nde boo: «Endolo, pɛpɛ moto omɔti ɔ ibota la wɛ odii na kombe ena!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Bea, na ndjia ɛ bimbete bahɔdja sango, kombe ndani epali yo bo apɛ na mwana ɔ nde <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Djakalia ahɔdja maa yale ɔ ibaya ko akoma ena boo: «Kombe ɛ nde wɛte Yoani.» Bea, bato basusu bakamoa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Oko ena Djakalia asɔmbɔ koko obala: abanga okumedja Ndjambe na moholi mopipo. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Bea, bato basusu iba mbuti badaka na bɔɔ, na bia ibadaka ta bisika bisusu ba ngomba dja Yuda, basoolaka diko la midjɔ mia. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bia basusu ibaoka midjɔ mia mabalama badaka bamilɛdja ko basahɔdja boo: «Mwana ona adabi moda nda?» Na bea ngulu ɛ Kumu ɛdaka na nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yembo ɛ Djakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Djakalia, sɛngɛ mwana, aluma na Mwembo mosɛnɔke; abanga otɛlɛ na bibaeli bii:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Kumama Kumu, Ndjambe ɔ Isalɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Adoi akɔmɛdja ko asikoa bato ba nde!<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Alopi mosikoi monɛnɛ ta ndako ɛ Davidi mosali ɔ nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Oko moda mamaa yo bala donga ehele na ndjia ɛ batɛli ba nde basɛnɔke:<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Alobunedja boo losikoamabi odii baloni ba boso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">Ko ta kpati ɛ bato basusu ibakaloine.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ainedja ndjokwa ɛnde odii bataatasu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">Ko aibosa edhimaneli ɛ nde esɛnɔke.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Ndjambe asimba ndai na taatasu Abalayama,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />olodongedja ta mabɔ ma baloni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">Bɛngɛ bo lamosalee na pɛpɛ obanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Bo ladae basɛnɔke na odjoo boso ba nde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">Maswi masusu ma mohelo ma booso.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ko wɛ, mwana ɔ mbai, odalea motɛli ɔ Ndjambe ona Oonɔi Diko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Odalalea boso ba Kumu tinaɛ obongɛdja ndjia ɛ nde,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Bɛngɛ bato ba nde badjebe boo adoi abaheledja</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">Na obayɛɛ ta mabunga ma bobo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ndjambe ɔ booso aluma na bwɛli ko na opele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Angɛngɛdjabi diko la booso ohuu ba diko, elengɛ bua iba diso la busa ikaimana sɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Tina ɛ opa ohuu odii bia ibadaka ta modidi ko ta esii ɛ ogwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">tina ɛ odaledja mako ma booso ta ndjia ɛ ogoo.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana akandoaka ko mwembo ma nde mapingedjamaka. Adaka ta bisika ba bisobe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 80 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esobe edii esika edii bato pɛpɛ oda.</char></note> mbunoko iswi lasaenɛmɛdja yo ohuu boso ba Isalaele.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Obotama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1, 18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ta ehole ena, Kaisala Ogisito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaisala Ogisito adaka kumu ta Loma donga mbua ɔ 29 boso ba Yesu mbunoko mbua ɔ 14 ngɔngɔ dja Yesu.</char></note>, apa mobeko ma pisi tina ɛ odjeba motwuia ma bato basusu ibadaka nase dja okumu ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Pisi ena, ɛ boso, ɛkɔɔmɔ ta ehole ɛdaka Kuluneli gupunɛlɛ ɔ Sulia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Moto mosusu akɛkɛ akomedja kombe, moto na moto ta ibonga la nde mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosepu koko adonga ta Nasalɛta, ibonga la Galilai, tina ɛ okɛ ta Yuda, ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ta esika ɛbotama Davidi; tina ɛ boo Davidi adaka taata nde, <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />bɛngɛ boo asakomedjae engbanga na Malia ona ɔboanedjamaka boo amobale, ona ɔdaka na deemi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ta ehole ena ɛdaka bo ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, iswi la nde la obota lakoka. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Ko abota mwana ɔ nde moomi ɔ boso. Amodinga na bisendja ko amosambea ta esika ɛ eyakeli ɛ bingbɛndɛ, tina ɛ bo esika ɛtaka tina ɛ bobo ta ndako ɛ bakɛndɛli.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndi aenɛmi odii babanei ba bingbɛndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Ta mbuti mbuti na Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, babanei ba bingbɛndɛ badaka ta gue na bulu tina ɛ obanea mela ma bobo ma bingbɛndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Obwɛndi ɔ Kumu asaenɛmɛdja na bu ko ekumu ɛ Kumu ebahua na ohuu. Bea badaa na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Endolo Obwɛndi abala na bu boo: «Pɛpɛ obangani, tina ɛ boo, naolwɛini gala epele esepedjalea bato basusu: <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />ta bulu buu ta ibonga la Davidi, tina ɛ boono Moheledja abotami; yo Klisto, Kumu! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ko hokeani embete emodjebalea na nu: otanealeani mwana mopu ahuami na bisendja ko asambi ta eyakeli ɛ tito.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Oko ena, bakina babwɛndi bike ba busa bakatana na obwɛndi ona ɔduaka boso bakumedja Ndjambe boo:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Ekumu odii Ndjambe ta bisika Binɔi Diko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">ko ogoo ta ngondo odii bato ibakapale yo!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babanei ba tito bakɛi ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ehole ɛsɔmbɔ babwɛndi ta busa, babanei ba tito basabaleana boo: «Na bea lakɛɛ mbunoko ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ: eboani na su boo laenɛ mua mosakɔɔmɔ oho, imolodjebedjai Kumu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bakɛɛ pɛpɛlɛ ko batanea Malia na Yosepu na mwana mopu asambi ta eyeeli ɛ tito. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ɔenɛ bo mwana, badjebedja midjɔ misusu imabala obwɛndi ta tina ɛ nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bato basusu ibaoka midjɔ mia ta minɔkɔ ma babanei ba tito bakamoa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Malia abanea midjɔ mia misusu ta molema, ko amilɛdjanaka obuke. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ngɔngɔ djia babanei ba tito basɔmbɔ. Badaka bakumedjae onɛnɛ ba Ndjambe tina ɛ midjɔ mia misusu maoka bo ko maenɛ bo, moda imabatɔndɔɔ obwɛndi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babakei Yesu kombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Iswi la mwambe ngɔngɔ dja obotama, ehole ɛ omolena epole ɛimea, bamobakea kombe ɛ Yesu, kombe ɛbadjebedja obwɛndi boso boo nango alwae deemi la nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Badoi na Yesu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ngɔngɔ djia ehole ɛimea tina ɛ Yosepu na Malia okokedja bibongɛdjɛli ba osɛnodjama, okimana na mobeko ma Mose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lewi 12,3.6</char></note>. Bakɛɛ na mwana ta tepelo ɛ Yelusalɛmɛ ta tina ɛ omobudjea odii Kumu, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />tina ɛkomama ta mobeko ma Kumu boo: «Sɔmi moomi mosusu adii obudjeama tina ɛ Kumu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oim 13,2.12</char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Okokana na mobeko mua, badaka na elomu ɛ Kumu opaa koko tina ɛ mbeka bidoa babae mwali na moomi kaoko bana ba bimbenga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lewi 12,8</char></note> babae. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Bea ta Yelusalɛmɛ ɛdaka na moomi omɔti kombe ɛ nde Simeona. Adaka moto ɔ odjoo ko na isuma, adaka ta yambo ɛonɛ ona ɔboanaka osikoa Isalaɛlɛ. Mwembo Mosɛnoke madaka na nde <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />ko mamodjebedja boo atagwa boso ba oenɛ Klisto ona olomama na Kumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Mwembo Mosɛnoke malɔndɔ Simeona ta tepelo, ta ehole ena ɛdoa baboti ba Yesu nande tina ɛ okokedja eka eboanedja mobeko, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeona amotomba ta mabɔ ma nde ko asakoa Ndjambe na bibaeli bii:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Hadɛdi, Kumu, okokedjai mbuno ɛwɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">oboani okina mosali ɔ wɛ agwɛ na ogoo.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Tina ɛ boo naeni na miso ma mbai mɛɛnɛ, moheledja,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />mohelo mua imabɔngedja wɛ boso ba bato basusu:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />edii ohuu bua bokɔlea boo ɔdjebame ta mabota ma ngondo esusu ko ibua bodalea ekumu ɛ Isalɛlɛ bato ba wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 42,6; 49,6; 52,10</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Sango nɔbɔ nango badaka bakamoa ta midjɔ mia imidaka Simeona abala diko la nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeona abadjongoa ko abala na nango Malia boo: «Ndjambe ahɔɔ mwana hoo tina ɛ ɔdumba kaoko ongangodja bato banɛnɛ ba Isalɛlɛ. Adalea embete ɛ Ndjambe ena etakedjalea ookana odii bato, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />ko malɛi imabombamaka ta milema ma bato banɛnɛ madjebamabi. Ko wɛ, Malia, ookalea saya oko elengɛɛ saya ɛ mopata okatobanemo molimo ma moto.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana, motɛli mwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ɛdaka koko na motɛli mwali, ɔ kombɛ Ana, ona odaka mwa mwali ɔ Penuɛlɛ, ɔ ekomi ɛ Asele. Adaka mobange mɛɛnɛ. Anɛngɛdja mbua saambo yo nɔbɔ moomi ɔ nde ona obalana na nde donga bwɛngɛ ba nde, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />na bea, anɛngɛdja mwali ɔ ogwa na moomi mbua tuku mwambe na banɛi. Adaka seko ta tepelo, asaleaka Ndjambe bulu na moi: na osabekea ko na miɔngɔɔnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Aimea oko ta ehole ena ko asɔmbɛdja misakoa odii Ndjambe. Ko abala tina ɛ mwana odii bato basusu ibaombaka isiko la Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyane ta Nasalɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ɔsidja baboti ba Yesu okokedja misusu moda imahɔdjaka mobeko ma Kumu, bayana na nde ta Galilai, ta ibonga la bobo la Nasalɛtɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana akandoaka ko asapingedjaka. Aluma na owɛi ko ndjokwa ɛ Ndjambe edaka diko la nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Baboti ba Yesu, bakɛkɛ tu mbua ta Yelusalɛmɛ tina ɛ tɛkɛ ɛ Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ɔkokedja Yesu mbua doomi na babae, bakɛɛ na nde engbanga okimana na okɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oim 12,1-27; Det 16,1-8: odi Bayuda, mbua 12 edi mbua ɔ oenɛmɛkɛ bo moto apingi tina ɛdjebeli ɛ midjɔ ma Ndjambe.</char></note> ba bobo. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ɔsia tɛkɛ, bayana, endolo mwana Yesu adika ta Yelusalɛmɛ pɛpɛ baboti ba nde odjeba. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Balɛdjaka boo Yesu adaka engbanga emɔti na bato ibadaleanaka na bu ta mwɛngɔ ena bamakɔɔ iswi imɔti la mɔndɔ. Bamohomba ta ndanda ɛ bato ba ibota na badjebaneli ba bobo, <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />endolo baimodiha. Basɔmbɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta ihombi la nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ta iswi la basato, bamotanea ta tepelo: adii na mobondo ndanda ɛ bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko, abahokamedja ko abahɔdja mahɔdja. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bato basusu iba mohokamedjaka badaka bakamoa na owɛi ba nde ko na misɔmbedja imapaka yo. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ta ehole ɛmoenɛ baboti ba nde, bakamoa obuke ko nango abala na nde boo: «Mwana ɔ mbai, tina elokɔi wɛ bea nda? Mbai nɔsɔ sangwao, losatungei obuke mɛɛnɛ ta ihombi la wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Tina ɛhombakanini na nu nda? Otadjebakani boo eboani na mbai oda ta ndako ɛ Tata?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Endolo baisipoa tina ɛ midjɔ mabalaka yo na bu. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu ayana koko na bu ta Nasalɛtɛ. Abasumaka. Nango abaneaka midjɔ mia misusu ta molema. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu akandoaka, na oyai, na owɛi ko asepedjaka Ndjambe ko na bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Sam 2,26; Mkl 4,3</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho ɛ Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mal 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:6-8">Yoa 1, 6-8</ref>. <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ɛdaka ta mbua ɔ doomi na batano ta okumu ba Kaisala Tibɛlɛ; Pɔsi Pilato adaka gupunɛlɛ ɔ Yuda, Elode ta Galilai ko mwanango Pilipo ta Itule na Talakonitide, Lisania ta Abilɛne, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ana nɔbɔ Kaifa badaka banganga ba Ndjambe ibanɛnɛ. Ta ehole ena, ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe ɛpama odii Yoani mwana ɔ Djakalia, ta esobe. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yoani akɛɛ ta mikenge ma ngando misusu ima mbuti na dua ɛ Yolodane. Alehaka boo: «Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni moda ma bono, inamani ko Ndjambe aoyɛleani ta masumu ma boono.» <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ɛkokedjama oko moda makoma motɛli Isaya ta buku ɛnde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Moholi ma moto ona odii ogama ta esobe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Bɔngɛdjani ndjia ɛ Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">ninodjani migase ma nde!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Lumedjani mimbɔndɔ misusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ngomba esusu na ikoli isusu lobukeamabi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ndjia dja makumba djininodjamabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ndjia dja mikulubɔndu ibongɛdjamabi,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Ko moto mosusu aenɛbi mohelo imapama na Ndjambe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 40,3-5 </char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Bato bike baduaka odii Yoani bɛngɛ bo abaine. Abalaka na bu boo: «Mbota dja mabate, ona olakini boo otieni kɛlɛ ɛ Ndjambe ena edii mbuti nda? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Inedjani na ndjia ɛ mikɔ ma boono boo osɔmbɔtɔnini mida ko kinani osabaleani boo: “Abalayama adii taata su<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoa 8,33.37.39 </char></note>” Ta tina hee naodjebedjakani ihuu boo Ndjambe aboani ohekodja ndeke djii boo djaimee bana ba Abalayama! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Epondo edii mɛɛnɛ mbuti tina ɛ olena nginga dja mele: mole muu imodii pɛpɛ obota mbuma ipele modii olenama ko otumbama ta mosa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Bibole ba bato bamohɔdja boo: «Bea oboani so okɔ enao?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ona odii na bisendja bibae, apɛ emɔti odii ona otakaka, ko ona oopeli eka ɛ oyaka ayekaane.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Baputedjɛli ba puti badoa bɛngɛɛ boo bainame ko bahɔdja Yoani boo: «Molehi, eboani so okɔ nde?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ oputedjani eka ɛ onɔ diko la mua imaoinedjani bo.» <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Basoda koko bamohɔdja boo: «Ko iso, eboani so okɔ nde?» Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ okatoani falanga odii moto na ngulu kaoko okosa na moto midjɔ, endolo sepani na iputi la boono.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Elengɛɛ ɔdaka bato basusu na elɛndɛ enɛnɛ: moto na moto alɛdjaka boo Yoani ahɔni oda Masia. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Bea Yoani abala na ibo asusu boo: «Mbai, nadii oinani na madiba; endolo ona odoake anoini na ngulu: naboaniti noko olodja mikulu ma sapato dja nde. Yo, ainaleani na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na mosa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Ta ebɔ ɛ nde apeli inyongela tina ɛ obɔtɔdja mbuma dja ndongo na ndjani. Aboleabi mbuma dja ndongo ta ebombelo ɛ nde, endolo atumbabi ndjani ta mosa ma pɛpɛ odimea.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yoani atɔndɔkɔ Mwako Mopele odii bato na obapingedja ta midjɔ mikina minɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Noko bea, Yoani apɛlɛ Elode, ona odaka gupunɛlɛ ɔ Galilai, tina ɛ boo aosɔ Elodiade, mwali ɔ mwanango, ko akɔɔ mikina midjɔ mibe mike. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Na bea, Elode akɔɔ mokina modjɔ mobe ma onɔ: aisa Yoani ta bɔlɔko.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obatisama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mal 1, 9-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:32-34">Yoa 1, 32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ngɔngɔ dja oinama ba bato basusu, Yesu koko ainama. Ehole ɛdaka yo aongɔɔnɔ, busa basadipoa, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />ko Mwembo Mosɛnɛke matita diko la nde elengɛɛ embenga. Ko kɔpɛ eokama donga ta busa boo: «Odii Mwana ɔ mbai ɔ epaeli; nadii na sepi enɛnɛ na wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakɔkɔ ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1, 1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu adaka na mbua okimana tuku isato ehole ɛbanga yo elomu ɛ nde. Bato baledjaka bo adaka mwana ɔ Yosepu, ona odaka mwana ɔ Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />mwana ɔ Matati, mwana ɔ Lewi, mwana ɔ Meleki, mwana ɔ Yanai, mwana ɔ Yosepu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />mwana ɔ Matatiasi, mwana ɔ Amosa, mwana ɔ Naume, mwana ɔ Esile, mwana ɔ Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />mwana ɔ Maati, mwana ɔ Matatiasi, mwana ɔ Semeine, mwana ɔ Yosɛkɛ, mwana ɔ Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />mwana ɔ Yoanana, mwana ɔ Lesa, mwana ɔ Yolobabɛlɛ, mwana ɔ Sealatiele, mwana ɔ Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwana ɔ Mɛlɛki, mwana ɔ Adi, mwana ɔ Kosamɛ, mwana ɔ Elimadama, mwana ɔ Elɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />mwana ɔ Yesu, mwana ɔ Eliezɛlɛ, mwana ɔ Yolime, mwana ɔ Matati, mwana ɔ Lewi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />mwana ɔ Simeona, mwana ɔ Yuda, mwana ɔ Yosepu, mwana ɔ Yoname, mwana ɔ Eliakimi, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />mwana ɔ Melea, mwana ɔ Mena, mwana ɔ Matata, mwana ɔ Natana, mwana ɔ Davidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />mwana ɔ Yese, mwana ɔ Obede, mwana ɔ Boaza, mwana ɔ Sala, mwana ɔ Nasona, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />mwana ɔ Aminadaba, mwana ɔ Adimini, mwana ɔ Alani. Mwana ɔ Helesone, mwana ɔ Pelese, mwana ɔ Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />mwana ɔ Yakobo, mwana ɔ Isaka, mwana ɔ Abalayama, mwana ɔ Tela, mwana ɔ Naholo, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />mwana ɔ Selugu, mwana ɔ Leu, mwana ɔ Pelege, mwana ɔ Ebele, mwana ɔ Sela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwana ɔ Kenane, mwana ɔ Alapasade, mwana ɔ Sɛmɛ, mwana ɔ Noa, mwana ɔ Lɛmɛkɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />mwana ɔ Metusaleme, mwana ɔ Enoka, mwana ɔ Yelede, mwana ɔ Malaleele, mwana ɔ Kenane, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />mwana ɔ Enosi, mwana ɔ Seti, mwana ɔ Adama, mwana ɔ Ndjambe.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Omekama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mal 1, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu, aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, adonga ta Yolodane ko alɔndɔmɔ na Mwembo ta esobe. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Amekama na djabulu maswi tuku inei. Aiya eka ta maswi mia ko, ngɔngɔ djia aoka ndja. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Bea djabulu abala na nde boo: «Ekada boo odii Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, bala na mondeke muu boo maimee ipa.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɛkomama boo: “Moto atahela etoko na ipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Det 8,3</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Djabulu akɛɛ na nde ta esika enɔi diko, amoinedja mbala emɔti makumu masusu ma ngondo <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />ko abala na nde boo: «Naopalea kpati hee esusu ko odiheli ba makumu mia: tina ɛ bo ɛpama odii mbai, ko nahɔni opa odii ona odii mbai opala boo namopɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Okakwa magunda boso ba mbai, losusu lodalea la wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɛkomama boo: “Okumedjabi Kumu Ndjambe ɔ wɛ ko omosakoabi oko yo buki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Det 6,13</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ngɔngɔ djia djabulu amolɔndɔ koko ta Yelusalema, amobakea odiko la tepelo ko abala na nde boo: «Okada Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, sadumba donga haa mbunoko onase; <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />tina ɛkomama boo: “Alomabi babwɛndi ba nde bɛngɛɛ ba obanyee.” <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Na koko boo: “Baokaabi ta mabɔ ma bobo na bɔɔ ba bo egbota ɛ wɛ etataa mondeke momɔti.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu amosɔmbedja boo: «Ɛkomama boo: “Pɛpɛ omeka Kumu Ndjambe ɔ wɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ɔsidja yo omeka Yesu na mida misusu, djabulu asasua ohali na nde ta yambo ɛ ehole ekina.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abangi elomu ɛ nde ta Galilai</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mal 1, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu asɔmbɔ ta Galilai, molumake na ngulu ɛ Mwembo Mosɛnɛke. Gala ɛ nde enangana ta ekenge ena ɛ ngando esusu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Alehaka ta ndako dja miongɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda ko moto mosusu amokumedjaka.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alonama ta Nasaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mal 6, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu akɛɛ ta Nasalɛta, ta esika ɛbɔkɔmɔ yo. Ta iswi la sabata, aingea ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda moda madjebeana yo okɔ. Aema tina ɛ olanga Makomi <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />ko bamopa buku ɛ motɛli Isaya. Adipoa ta ekenge hee ɛkomama boo:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Mwembo ma Kumu modii diko la mbai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ahɛngɛni tina ɛ otɔndɔɔ Mwako Mopele odii bakwali.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Alomani tina ɛ odjebedja isiko la bato ba ibuli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ko odii ibagwa miso boo baenɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">tina ɛ osɔmi odii bia ibadii onɔngɔmɔ,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />tina ɛ odjebedja mbua ɔ ndjokwa ɛ Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 61,1-2</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Bea Yesu adipa buku, ayesɔmbɛdja odii mosali ko adaa na manɔkɔ. Bato basusu ibadaka otei ba ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda batingia miso ma bobo odii yo. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Na bea abanga obala na bu boo: «Busabu, ebaeli hee ɛ Ikomi ekokedjami tina ɛ ino ibaokakani.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bato basusu basepa na Yesu, ko bakamoa na bibaeli bipele ibahulake yo abala. Babala boo: «Hoo titi mwana ɔ Yosepu?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu abala na bu ohuu boo: «Obalaleani na mbai sooti mɛɛnɛ indjɛ dii boo: “Monganga, saheledja wɛ mɛɛnɛ.” Obalaleani na mbai koko boo: “Laoka misusu imakɔ wɛ ta Kapalanauma, kokedja koko midjɔ mia misusu haa ta ibonga la wɛ mɛɛnɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ko abakea boo: «Nabali na nu sooti: pɛpɛ motɛli omɔti ɔɔsɔmɔ opele ta ibonga labotama yo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Naikina, nahɔni odjebedjani sooti boo bali ba ogwa na baami badaka bike ta Isalɛlɛ ta ehole ɛ Elia, ehole ɛ pɛpɛ mbua okwa mbua basato na ekenge ko ndja enɛnɛ ɛkwa ta ngando esusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Bak 17,1</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Noko bea Ndjambe ailoma Elia odii mwali ɔ ogwa na moomi omɔti ta ndanda ɛ bobo, endolo oko odii mwali ɔ ogwa na moomi ta Salepeta, ibonga imɔti la Sidona. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Ɛdaka koko na bato bike ba mabha ta Isalɛlɛ ta ehole ɛ motɛli Elisa; noko bea pɛpɛ omɔti ɔhela na mabha ma nde dongedjaka oko Namana, moto ɔ Sulia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Bak 5,1-14 </char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bato basusu ibadaka ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda, baluma na kɛlɛ ehole ɛoka bo midjɔ mia. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Baema, basuala Yesu osokolu ba ibonga ko bakɛɛ na nde ta sɔngɔ ɛ ikoli ta esika epika bo Nasalɛta, bɛngɛ bo bamohilingoanedjae ta esika ɛ pɛpɛ osaika. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Endolo anɔɔ ta ndanda ɛ bobo ko akɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto ɔtungeamaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mal 1, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yesu akɛɛ ta Kapalanauma, ibonga la Galilai, ko alehaka ena maswi masusu ma sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabata edi busa ba iheme odi Bayuda</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Bato bike bakamoaka na moda ma nde ma oleha, tina ɛ boo abalaka na kpati. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda, ɛdaka na moto omɔti ona ɔtungeamaka na mwembo mobe. Agama na moholi mopipo boo: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Aa! Yesu ɔ Nasalɛta, modjɔ ma boso na wɛ nda? Edoi wɛ alobeedja? Naodjebi opele: odii Mosɛnɔke ɔ Ndjambe!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu abala na mwembo mobe na kɛndjɔ boo: «Daa ogoo ko imana odii moto hoo!» Mwembo mobe mamodumba ta kpɔtɔ boso ba bato basusu ko maimana pɛpɛ omokɔ obe. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bato basusu bakamɔa obuke ko basahɔdja boo: «Muu mondumba ma kɔpɛ nda? Adii obengana na kpati ko na ngulu miembo mibe ko maimanaka!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ko gala ɛ Yesu enangana ta bisika bisusu ba ekenge ɛ ngando ena.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai bato ba ipeko bike</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mal 1, 29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu aimana ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda ko akɛɛ ta ndako ɛ Simo. Okio ba Simo o mwali adaka na mosa mopipo ta mokuku ko bahɔdja Yesu bo akoe maa modjɔ tina ɛ nde <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu asunama odii yo ko, agamea mokuku mosa na ngulu mɛɛnɛ. Mokuku mosa mamokina, oko ena aema ko abanga obakɔmɛdja.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ɔtita busa, bato ibadaka na bato ba bipeko mindumba na mindumba baduaka na bu odii Yesu. Abakeaka mabo diko la omɔti na omɔti ko abaheledjaka. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Miembo mibe maimanaka odii bato ba bipeko bike magamaka boo: «Odii Mwana ɔ Ndjambe!» Endolo Yesu abala na bu na opipo ko ababenda matoi boo batabala, tina ɛ ibo badjebaka boo adii Masiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alehi ta ndako dja miɔngɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4, 23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mal 1, 35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ɔya busa, Yesu aimana ta ibonga ko akɛɛ ta esobe. Bato bike babanga omohomba ko ehole ɛimea bo ta esika ɛdaka yo, bapalaka onɛngɛdja na nde bɛngɛɛ asakabakina. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Endolo Yesu abala na bu boo: «Eboani na mbai otɔndɔɔ Mwako Mopele ma Okumu ba Ndjambe ta mabonga makina koko, tina ɛlomama na mbai iyena.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ko alehaka ta ndako dja miɔngɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda dja ngando ena.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Batingami ba boso</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4, 18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mal 1, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:35-51">Yoa 1, 35-51</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:1-11">21, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu adaka aemi ta ibongu la ibeke inɛnɛ la Genesaleta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Genesaleta edi kombe ekina ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ la Galilai</char></note> ko bato bike basweanaka bamohike bɛngɛɛ bo baoke ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Aenɛ mato mabae mbuti na ibongu: balubi ba swi baduboa ta mu tina ɛ ososa bihea ba bobo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu atitea ta bwato bomɔti ba mato mia, ibadaka ba Simo, ko amohɔdja boo asasue maa osinɛ na ibongu. Yesu adaa na manɔkɔ ta otei ba bwato ko abanga oleha bato.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ehole ɛbɛtɛ yo obala, abala na Simo boo: «Linda bwato ta madiba ma mbɛngɛ, ko maani bihea ba boono ta madiba tina ɛ oluba.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simo amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Molehi, lonɔngi bulu bosusu lodihiti eka. Endolo ta diko la ebaeli ɛ wɛ, namalea bihea.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Bea bamaa bihea ko batɛdja swi bike mɛɛnɛ, bihea ba bobo babanga okalea. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bapupea bamina bu mabɔ ibadaka ta bwato bokina boo badoe abakɔmɛdja. Badoa ko, engbanga, balumedja mato mia mabae na swi otɔɔ mbuti na odinda. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ehole ɛenɛ Simo Piɛlɛ bea, akwa magunda boso ba Yesu ko abala na nde boo: «Kumu, sasua mbuti na mbai, tina ɛ bo nadii moto ɔ masumu!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simo engbanga na bato ibadaka na nde, babanga tina ɛ swi bike ibatɛdja bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Edaka moda momɔti na Djake na Yoani, bana ba Djebedai, ibadaka engbanga na Simo. Endolo Yesu abala na Simo boo: «Pɛpɛ obanga; donga busabu odalea molubi ɔ bato. <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Basɛmɛɛ mato ta ibongu ko bakina leka la bobo losusu tina ɛ okimana Yesu.»<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔ mabha</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mal 1, 40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu adaka ta ibonga imɔti, moto ɔluma na mabha aimea. Oeni yo Yesu, asadumba odii yo boso bosuni ta kpɔtɔ ko amongɔɔnɔ boo: «Kumu, okapala, oboani osɛnɔdjani!» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu aninodja ebɔ, amobinga ko abala boo: «Napali, sɛnɔdjama!» Oko ena, mabha mamokina. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Bea Yesu amosia boo: «Pɛpɛ otɔndɔɔ modjɔ muu odii moto. Endolo kɛɛ asainedjae odii nganga ɔ Ndjambe, ko pa ikabo la mbeka moda makoma Mose, bɛngɛɛ bato basusu badhime boo oheli.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Noko bea, gala ɛ Yesu ɛnangana onɔ; bato bike baputoanaka tina ɛ omohokamedja ko oheledjama na bipeko ba bobo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Endolo Yesu asatwaka ta bisobe ko aongɔɔnɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai etumbɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mal 2, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu adaka aleha. Bafalusai na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko badaka ena; badongaka ta ngando isusu dja Galilai na Yuda, ko dja Yelusalema. Ngulu ɛ Kumu edaka na Yesu ko aheledjaka na yu bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Bato baimea, badoa baasonge moto ɔ etumbɛ ta bwanga; bahombaka baingee na nde ta ndako bɛngɛɛ bamosambee boso ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Tina ɛ boo bato badaka bike, baidiha esika ɛ oingea na nde, baihwea na nde ta diko la etondo, batubea iposi ta itɛlɔ ko bamotitedja na bwanga ta iposi latɔɔ bo ndanda ɛ bato boso ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ɔenɛ Yesu edhimeli ɛ bobo, abala na mokɔni boo: «Mwaninga, masumu ma wɛ mayɛɛmi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai basahɔdja boo: «Moto hoo adii nda ona odii otuka Ndjambe? Ona oboani oyɛɛ masumu nda, dongedja oko Ndjambe yo mɛɛnɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu atɔngɔlɔ malɛi ma bobo ko abala na bu boo: «Odini na malɛi mondumba mua ta milema ma boono tina nda? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Enɔi na opɛtɛpɛtɛ ta obala: “Masumu ma wɛ mayɛɛmi”, kaoko obala boo: “Emaa ko dala”? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Na bea, napalaka ɔdjebeni boo: Mwana ɔ moto adii na kpati ta ngondo tina ɛ oyɛɛ masumu.» Bea abala na etumbɛ boo: «Nabali na wɛ, emaa, tomba bwanga ba wɛ ko yana ta ndako ɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Oko ta ehole ena, moto ona aemaa boso ba bato basusu, atomba bwanga ibadaka yo asambi ko ayana odii yo ena asakoe Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bato basusu bakamoa. Basakoa Ndjambe, baluma na bɔɔ, ko babala boo: «Loeni busabu midjɔ ma okamoa mɛɛnɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mal 2, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu aimana ko aenɛ moputedjɛli ɔ puti, ɔ kombe ɛ Lewi, adii ta bilo ɛ baputedjɛli ba puti ko abala na nde boo: «Kimanani!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lewi akina losusu, aemaa, ko amokimana. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Bea Lewi abongɛdja tɛkɛ enɛnɛ tina ɛ Yesu ta ndako ɛ nde, ko badaka ena ta mesa baputedjɛli ba puti bike na bato bakina. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Bafalusai ko bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko bamɛmɛsɛnɛ, ko babala na batingami ba nde boo: «Tina ndani odii ɔyakani ko ɔmwa engbanga na baputedjɛli ba puti ko na bato ba masumu?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Editi bato ba mikuku mipele ibadii na posa ɛ monganga, endolo bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Naidua abea bato ba odjoo, endolo bato ba masumu tina ɛ osɔmbɔtɔnɔ mida ma bobo.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abali diko la osabekea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mal 2, 18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bafalusai babala na Yesu boo: «Batingami ba Yoani na iba bafalusai bakasabekee bihole bisusu ko bakaongɔɔne; endolo ibawɛ bakayake ko bakamwɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ohɔnini okɔ boo badjebani ba moomi ɔ moki basabekee ta ehole edii moomi ɔ moki engbanga na bu? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Endolo maswi maduake imabakatoabi bo moomi ɔ bobo ɔ moki; bea basabekeabi ta maswi mia.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu abala na bu koko na indjɛ dii: «Moto ataola mopɛpɛ ma esendja ɛ tɛtɛli tina ɛ obɔngɛdja na esendja eeyou; emiti daa bea, esendja ɛ tɛtɛli eolealea oko ngasa tina ɛ boo mopɛpɛ ma tɛtɛli motabɔngɔ okatana na esendja eeyou. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Ko moto ataisa vino ɛ tɛtɛli ta mbola ndjou; emiti daa bea, vino ɛ tɛtɛli ehɔni oola mbola: esopei, ko mbola inami, <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />endolo eboani oisa vino ɛ tɛtɛli ta mbola dja tɛtɛli! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ko pɛpɛ moto, ngɔngɔ dja omwa vino eeyou, apaletelea vino ɛ yanie, tina ɛ abalalea boo: “Eeyou enɔi na opele.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mal 2, 23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Busa bomɔti ba sabata, Yesu akatisaka gue ɛ ndongo. Batingami ba nde babuka mingbɔndu ma ndongo, baminɛlɛkɛkɛ na mabɔ ko ena baya mbuma. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bakina Bafalusai babala na bu boo: «Tina ndani ɔkɔkɔni modjɔ imasia mobeko ma booso boo motakɔɔmɔ ta iswi la sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɔilangani mua imakɔɔ Davidi busa bomɔti ta ehole ɛdaka yo na ndja yo mɛɛnɛ ko na bato ibadalaka na nde? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Aingea ta ndako ɛ Ndjambe, atomba mapa imabudjeama tina ɛ Ndjambe, amayaka ko amapa na bato ibadalaka na nde, noko mobeko ma booso mokapɛ enɔli oko odii banganga ba Ndjambe boo bamayake.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu abala koko na bu boo: «Mwana ɔ moto adii moswa sabata.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto ɔgwa ebɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mal 3, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Busa bokina ba sabata, Yesu aingea ta ndako ɛ miongɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda ko abanga oleha. Moto omɔti ɔgwa ebɔ ɛ baami adaka ena. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai batingea Yesu miso, bɛngɛɛ baenɛ kaoko aboani oheledja moto ta iswi la sabata, bɛngɛɛ badihe modjɔ ma omopunda. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Endolo Yesu adjeba malɛi ma bobo. Na bea abala na moto ɔ ebɔ ɛgwa boo: «Emaa ko dua haa, boso ba bato basusu.» Aemaa ko adika diko. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Naohɔdjakani: enɔli elopi mobeko ma boso nda? Okɔ opele kaoko obe ta busa ba sabata? Oheledja moto kaoko omobungedja?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Abahokea ibo basusu, abala na moto ona boo: «Ninodja ebɔ!» Akɔɔ oko bea, ko ebɔ ɛ nde ɛhela. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Endolo bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai baluma na kɛlɛ ko babaleana ta ndanda ɛ bobo diko la modjɔ moboani bo okɔ na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahɔɔ baapotele doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mal 3, 13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ta maswi mia, Yesu aihwea ta ngomba tina ɛ oongɔɔnɔ ko anɔdja bulu bosusu aongɔɔnɔ Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ɔya busa, abea batingami ba nde ko ahɔɔ ta ndanda ɛ bobo doomi na babae ibapa yo kombe ɛ baapotele: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simo, ona ɔɔpa yo koko kombe ɛ Piɛlɛ na mwanango Andele, Djake na Yoani, Pilipo na Batelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matie na Toma, Djake mwana ɔ Alefe, Simo ona osweaka ngando, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yude mwana ɔ Djake na Yudasi Isikalioti ɔimea mokabi ɔ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi ko aheledjai bato</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 4:24-25">Mat 4, 24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-13">Mal 3, 7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu atita ta ngomba na baapotele ko aema ta esika ɛ tandabanu, ena ɔdaka batingami ba nde bike, ko bato bike badaka koko ena: ibadonga mɔngɔ masusu ma Yuda, na Yelusalema ko na mabonga ma ekulu ɛ ibeke ilinɛnɛ, Tule na Sidona; <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />baduaka tina ɛ omooka na osaheledja ta bipeko ba bobo. Bato ibatungeamaka na miembo mibe bahela. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Moto mosusu ahombaka amobinge, tina ɛ boo ngulu ɛ Ndjambe ɛimanaka odii yo ko ɛbaheledjaka ibo basusu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibɔngɛ na ndjokwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Na bea Yesu ahokea batingami ba nde ko abala na bu boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Sepi, ino ibadii bakwali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">tina ɛ boo Okumu ba Ndjambe bodii ba boono!»<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Sepi, ino ibadii na ndja hadɛdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">tina ɛ boo odihabini mia mike!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Sepi, ino ibayeaka bie hadɛdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">tina ɛ boo osɛkɛbini!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />«Sepi ɛ boono ekadaa boo bato ba oinini, baodumbini, baosingani ko bakabala obe tina ɛ boono, tina ɛ Mwana ɔ moto. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Mokakɔmɔbi bea na nu, pimbwani na sepi, tina ɛ boo ndese enɛnɛ ɛombakani ta busa. Edii bea moda manɔngɛdjaka bataatabu batɛli.»<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />«Endolo ndjokwa odii ino badiheli, tina ɛ boo odihani ibɔngɛ la boono ehele!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ndjokwa odii ino ibadii na mia mike hadɛdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">tina ɛ boo omatakabini!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ndjokwa odii ino ibasɛkɛkɛ hadɛdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">tina ɛ boo odabini na ndjokwa ko oyeabini!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ndjokwa odii ino ekadaa boo bato basusu babalaka na nu opele, tina ɛ boo bataata bu bakɔkɔ bea na batɛli ba epulu!»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwela tina ɛ baloni</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5, 38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7, 12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Endolo nabali na nu, ibaokakani: palani baloni ba boono, kɔɔni opele odii bii ibakaoloneni, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />djongoani ibakaolakedjɛni ko ongɔɔnɔni tina ɛ bia ibakaonɔngedjɛni. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ekadaa boo moto aobomi epataka ta mobanga momɔti, molɛkɛɛ koko mokina; ekadaa boo moto atombi mokoto ma wɛ, pɛpɛ omosia boo atombe koko simisi ɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Pa odii ona ɔsɛngɛkɛ, ko ekadaa boo moto ndani aotombei eka ɛ wɛ pɛpɛ owa mohɔdja yo. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Kɔɔni odii bato bakina misusu imapalaka no boo bakɔe tina ɛ boono. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Ekadaa boo ɔpalakani oko bia ibakaopaleni, tina ndani eboani no oomba sakola ɛ onɔ? Noko na bato ba masumu bakapale koko bia ibakabapale! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ekadaa boo ɔkɔkɔni opele oko odii bia ibakaokɔmɛɛni opele, tina ndani eboani no oomba sakola ɛ onɔ? Noko na bato ba masumu bakakɔe onɔ! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ekadaa boo obekedjɛni falanga oko odii bia ibalɛndɛkɛ no boo baosɔmbɛdjɛni, tina ndani eboani no oomba sakola ɛ onɔ? Noko na bato ba masumu bakabekedjae koko falanga odii bato ba masumu bɛngɛɛ boo babasɔmbɛdjae motwuia mua momɔti! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Endolo palani baloni ba boono, bakɔmɛɛni opele ko babekedjani na pɛpɛ olɛndɛ oosɔ eka ɛ osɔmbɛdja. Na bea odihabini ndese enɛnɛ, ko odabini bana ba Ndjambe Oonɔi Diko, tina ɛ boo yo, adii mopele odii bato bakadae pɛpɛ odjeba opele bokabakɔe bo ko na bato ba mikɔ mibe. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Lumani na bwela elengɛɛ Sangwanu ona odii molumake na bwela.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛpɛ osambedjani moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Pɛpɛ osambedjani moto ko Ndjambe aosambɛdjetebini; pɛpɛ odumbani moto na ikambo ko Ndjambe aodumbetebini na ikambo; yɛɛni ko Ndjambe aoyɛɛbini. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Pani ko Ndjambe aopabini: ibenga inɛnɛ la esendja ɛ wɛ ilumabi na mwɛngi moboani, imbambamabi, ihɛhɛmɛbi ko mwɛngi monɔbi; tina ɛ boo baoedjɛbini oko na mwɛngi modii no oedjɛ bakina.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu abala koko na bu na indjɛ boo: «Moto ɔgwa miso aboani olɔndɔ minande okina ɔɔgwa miso? Pɛpɛ! Ibo asusu babae bakwalea ta mombɔndɔ! <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Pɛpɛ moikoi omɔti onɔi molehi ɔ nde, endolo moikoi mosusu olehami opele mɛɛnɛ adalea oko elengɛɛ molehi ɔ nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Tina ndani odii osisimodja oko mondjani mokɛkɛ modii ta diso la mwangwao, ko oditi oenɛ yaale ɛ ibaya edii ta diso la wɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Moda ndani mohɔni wɛ obala na mwangwao boo: “Mwaninga, kina naodongedjae mondjani mokɛkɛ modii ta diso la wɛ”, wɛ ona odii pɛpɛ oenɛ yaale ɛ ibaya idii ta diso la wɛ? Moto ɔ epulu, dongedja boso mɛɛnɛ yaale ɛ ibaya ilidii ta diso la wɛ na bea oenɛlea ohuu tina ɛ odongedja mondjani mokɛkɛ imodii ta diso la mwangwao.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mole mokadjebame na mbuma dja mu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12, 33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Pɛpɛ mole mopele imokabote mbuma ebe, na mole mobe imokabote mbuma epele. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Tina ɛ boo eengi mole na mole mokadjebame na mbuma ɛ yu mɛɛnɛ. Tebatswɛ mbuma dja mole ma figi diko la ndjubɛ ko tebabuke mbuma dja vino diko la ndjubɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Moto mopele akaimusedjae midjɔ mipele imilumi ta ebombelo epele ɛ molema ma nde; moto mobe akaimusedjae midjɔ mibe imilumi ta molema ma nde, tina ɛ monɔko ma moto mokaimusedjae midjɔ imilumi ta molema ma nde.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndako ibae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7, 24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Tina ndani okabeenini “Kumu, Kumu”, ko tokɔeni eka ekabale mbai na nu? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Napalaka boo naoinedjaeni ndani okoani na moto odoi odii mbai, ɔɔkaka mibalo ma mbai ko amikokedjaka: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />adii elengɛɛ moto ona ɔpika ndako; alonga mombɔndɔ ma mbɛngɛ ko abakei moboko diko la mondeke. Ehole edua pela, madiba ma dua mala ndako na ngulu, endolo maihɔnɔ oyebuka, tina ɛ boo ɛpikama opele. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Endolo moto ona okaoke bibaeli ba mbai ko pɛpɛ obikokedja adii elengɛ moto hoo ɔpika ndako ɛ nde diko la mokpɔtɔ, pɛpɛ miboko. Ehole ɛla madiba ma dua ndako na ngulu, ebukea pɛpɛlɛ: ekwa esusu mɛɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja mosali ɔ kumu ɔ basoda ɔ baloma</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8, 5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:46-54">Yoa 4, 46-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ɔsidja Yesu obala midjɔ mia misusu odii bato bike ibadaka bamooka akɛɛ ta Kapalanauma. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ehoo, kumu omɔti ɔ basoda ɔ baloma adaka na mosali ɔ nde ona ɔpalaka yo obuke. Mosali ona adaka na epeko mbuti na ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Kumu ɔ basoda ɔɔka yo bato babala ta tina ɛ Yesu, amolomea ekenge ɛ basuku ba Bayuda boo bamohɔdjae bɛngɛ adoe aheledja mosali ɔ nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ɔimea bo mbuti na Yesu, bamoongɔɔnɔ na lokamo na bibaeli bii boo: «Moto ona abɔngi boo adihe ekɔmɛdjɛli ɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Apali bato ba boso ko edii yo moto ɔlopikia ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Bea Yesu akɛɛ na bu engbanga. Ɔimea yo mbuti na ndako, ehole ɛloma kumu ɔ basoda badjebaneli ba nde tina ɛ obala na Yesu boo: «Kumu, pɛpɛ osatungea. Nabɔngiti boo oingee ta ndako ɛ mbai; <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />ta tina hee ebɔngiti boo nadoe mbai mɛɛnɛ odii wɛ. Endolo bala etoko kɔpɛ emɔti bɛngɛɛ mosali ɔ mbai ahele. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Mbai mɛɛnɛ nadii na bakumu ibakasume mbai ko nadii na basoda ibakasumeni. Nakabala na omɔti boo: “Kɛɛ!”, akɛi; nakabala na okina boo: “Doa!”, adoi; ko nakabala na mosali ɔ mbai boo: “Kɔɔ boo!”, adii okɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ehole ɛoka Yesu bibeli bia, asepa obuke na kumu ɔ basoda. Ahombana odii bato ibamokimanaka: «Nabali na nu ohuu boo: napakita tanea mondumba ma edhimeli hee, noko ta Isalɛlɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ehole ɛyana bato ibalomaka kumu ɔ basoda ta ndako, batanea mosali aheli.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɔmbɛdja mohelo odii mwa moomi ɔ mwali ɔgwedja moomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu akɛɛ ta ibonga ilabeamaka Naina; batingami ba nde ko na bato bakina bike bakɛɛ na nde engbanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ehole eimea yo mbuti na edipako ɛ ibonga, asaka na bato bakɛɛ ta ikila akunda ebembe ɛ mwana moomi ɔ ikinda ɔ mwali ɔgwedja moomi. Bato bike ba ibonga dia badaka na nde engbanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ehole ɛenɛ Kumu mwali ona ɔgwedja moomi, aluma na ndjokwa tina ɛ nde ko abala na nde boo: «Pɛpɛ oyea!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Bea Yesu asabatea ko abinga epomba; bato ibadaka bayesonge baema. Yesu abala boo: «Mwenga moomi, nabali na wɛ, emaa!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Moto mogo adaa ko abanga obala. Yesu amosɔmbɛdja odii nango. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bato basusu babanga; bakumedja Ndjambe ko babala boo: «Motɛli monɛnɛ aimani ta ndanda ɛ boso!» Koko boo: «Ndjambe adoi akɔmɛdja bato ba nde!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Gala ɛ modjɔ imakɔɔ Yesu ɛnangana ta Yuda esusu ko ta mikenge ma ngando ma mbuti na Yuda.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato ibaloma Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11, 2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Batingami ba Yoani badjebedja midjɔ mia misusu odii molehi ɔ bobo. Yoani abea babae ta ndanda ɛ bobo <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />ko abaloma odii Kumu bɛngɛ bamohɔdjae boo: «Edii wɛ Masia ona oboani odoa kaoko loboani oomba moto okina?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Ehole eimea bo odii Yesu, babala na nde boo: «Yoani Mobatisi alolomi odii wɛ bɛngɛ laohɔdjae boo: “Edii wɛ Masia ona oboani odoa kaoko loboani oomba moto okina?”» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Oko ta ehole ena, Yesu aheledja bato bike na bigo ba bobo, na biɛmɛ ba bobo ko na miembo mibe ko asɔmbɛdja ndjɛni odii bato bike ibagwa miso. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Bea asɔmbɛdja odii bato ibaloma Yoani boo: «Kɛɛ atɔndɔeni Yoani midjɔ imieni no ko imioki no: bato ibagwa miso baeni, bato ba mitɛngu badali, bato ba mabha baheli, bato ba ohoka baoki, bago basɔmbi ta mohelo, mwako mopele modjebedjami odii bakwali. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Sepi odii ona odii pɛpɛ okina edhimeli ɛ nde tina ɛ mbai!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ngɔngɔ dja iyane la bato ibaloma Yoani, Yesu abala na emumu ɛ bato ta tina ɛ Yoani boo: «Ekɛki no aindja ta esobe ye? Mososongo imakumanaka na epoipoi? Pɛpɛ! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Na bea, ekɛki no aindja ye? Moto olwali bisendja ba gala? Endolo, bato ibakalwae bisendja ba motwuia monɛnɛ ko bakahelame ta ibɔngi bakataneame ta ndako dja bakumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Okɛki no aindja nda? Motɛli? Edii bea, mbai nabali na nu, ko anɔi noko motɛli. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Tina ɛ boo Yoani adii ona odii Makomi obala ohuu boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Hokea, nalomalea molomami ɔ mbai boso ba wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">tina ɛ obongɛdja ndjia boso ba wɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu abakea boo, nabali na nu ohuu boo, ta bato ibabotama na mwali pɛpɛ onɔi Yoani na onɛnɛ; endolo, ona onɔi na okɛkɛ ta okumu ba Ndjambe amonɔi na onɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bato basusu ko baputedjeli ba puti ibaoka Yoani, badjeba boo Ndjambe adii odjoo ko babatisama na nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Endolo Bafalusai na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko batiola olulea ba Ndjambe tina ɛ bobo ko balona oinama na Yoani.»<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu abala naikina boo: «Na ndani naboani okoanedja bato ba ehole hee? Bakoani na nda? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bakoani na bana ibadii na manɔkɔ ta esika ɛ masaka ma bato bike, badii ogama omɔti odii okina boo: “lobomeini piololo ko obuitini! Loembi biembo ba kɔndɔ ko oyeitini!” <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Tina ɛ boo, Yoani Mobatisi adua, aiyaaka ipa ko aimwaka vino, ko obalani boo: “Adii na mwɛmbo mobe!” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana ɔ moto adua, ayaka ko amwaka ko ɔbalani boo: “Hokea moto hoo adii etoko na posa ɛ oya ko omwa vino, ona odii modjebaneli ɔ baputedjɛli ba puti ko na bato ba masumu!” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Endolo owɛi ba Ndjambe badjebama elengɛɛ odjoo odii ibia ibakamosume.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta ndako ɛ Simo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mal 14, 3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mofalusai omɔti abea Yesu ayaka nɔbɔ nde. Yesu aingɛa odii mofalusai ko adaa ta mesa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Oko ta ehole ena, mwali omɔti ɔ gala ebe ɔ ibonga dia aimea. Ɔoka yo boo Yesu adaka ta ndako ɛ mofalusai, adoa na molangi ma alabate molumake na malasi <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />ko aema mbuti na bigbota ba Yesu. Ayea ko apodjaa bigbota ba Yesu na mbisoli dja nde. Ngɔngɔ djia, abihakoa na swee dja nde, abibumea ko asopa malasi diko la bu. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ɔenɛ mofalusai ona ɔ moosɔ ta ndako ɛ nde bea, asabalea yo mɛɛnɛ boo: «Ekadaa boo moto hoo adaki sooti mɛɛnɛ motɛli, eke adjebi mwali hoo omobingi boo adii mwali ɔ gala ebe.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu abala na mofalusai boo: «Simo, nadii na modjɔ ma ɔdjebedja.» Simo amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Molehi, bala.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu abala boo: «Moto omɔti adepedja baami babae falanga. Omɔti adaka na nyongo pata mikama mitano ko okina pata tuku itano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ena ɔtaka bo eka ɛ omosɔmbɛdja, abakinei ibo basusu babae nyongo djia. Ta ndanda ɛ ibo babae omopalalea onɔ nda?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simo amosɔmbɛjda boo: «Nalɛdjaka boo edii ona ɔdaka na nyongo enɛnɛ.» Yesu abala na nde boo: «Olongi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Na bea ahekoa odii mwali ko abala na Simo boo: «Oeni mwali hoo? Naingei ta ndako ɛ wɛ ko opitini madiba tina ɛ bigbota ba mbai; endolo yo asosi bigbota ba mbai na mbisoli dja nde ko abihakoi na swee dja nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Obumeitini ehole eosini wɛ, endolo yo akiniti obumeani bigbota donga oingei mbai ta ndako ɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Osopeitini mosola diko la molo ma mbai; endolo yo asopeini malasi ta diko la bigbota ba mbai. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Na tina hee, nabali na wɛ ohuu boo: masumu ma nde mike mayɛɛmi ta tina ɛ epaeli ɛ nde enɛnɛ enemɛdjai yo. Endolo odii moto ona oyɛi bo na okɛkɛ aenɛmɛdjalea oko epaeli ekɛkɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Bea Yesu abala na mwali boo: «Masumu ma wɛ mayɛɛmi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bato ibadaka na nde ta mesa basabaleana ibo mɛɛnɛ boo: «Muu mondumba ma moto nda ona ohɔni oyɛɛ noko na masumu?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Endolo Yesu abala na mwali ona boo: «Edhimeli ɛ wɛ eoheledjai: kɛɛ na ogoo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bali ibadalaka na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu akɛɛ ta ibonga na ibonga ko ta ngando na ngando tina ɛ oleha ko otɔndɔɔ mwako mopele ma okumu ba Ndjambe. Batingami doomi na babae badaka na nde engbanga, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na pongono bali bakina ibahela na miembo mibe ko na bigo: Malia – ona obeaka bo Malia ɔ Magadala –, ona ɔhela na miembo mibe saambo; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yoana, mwali ɔ Suza, ona odaka mobaneli ɔ leka la Elode. Susani ko na bali bakina bike ibakɔmɛdjaka Yesu na batingami ba nde na odiheli ba bobo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mooni</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mal 4, 1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bato bike badoaka mbuti na Yesu odonga ta mabonga ndengɛ na ndengɛ. Bea Yesu abala indjɛ dii: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Moto omɔti akɛɛ ta gue ɛ nde tina ɛ oona kona. Ena odaka yo aona, ekenge ekina ɛ kona ɛkwa ta mopkɛngɔ ma ndjia: bato bayeminakaka ko mbulu ba diko bayekomakaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ndambo ekina ɛkwa ta diko la kpɔtɔ dja ndeke: ɔtɔɔ kona, djahɔlɔngɔnɔ tina ɛ boo djataka madiba. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Kona ikina djakwa ta mele ma ndjubɛ djakandoana na dju engbanga ko ndjubɛ dja djikamamedja. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Endolo, ndambo ekina ɛ kona ɛkwa ta kpɔtɔ djipele; djakandoa ko kona emɔti na emɔti ɛbota mbuma mokama.» Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu abakea boo: «Ona odii na matoi ma ooka, aoke!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina ɛbalaka Yesu na mandjɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mal 4, 10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Batingami ba Yesu bamohɔdja tingo ɛ indjɛ dia. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɛpama na nu edjebeli ɛ mabombami ma okumu ba Ndjambe; endolo odii bakina, badii ooka oko na mandjɛ. Na bea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">“Bahokeaka opele, endolo bataenɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">Baokaka opele, endolo batasipoa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 6,9-10</char></note>.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodjai indjɛ la mooni</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mal 4, 13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Hokeani tingo ɛ indjɛ dii: kona ɛ oona, edii ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Ibadii ta mokpɛngɔ ma ndjia, edii bia ibaoki Ebaeli, endolo Djabulu adoi ko ayedongedjai ta milema ma bobo, tina ɛ obasia boo basakadhima ko basakahela. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Bakina badii elengɛɛ mokpɔtɔ ma ndeke: baoki Ebaeli ko bayeosi na sepi. Endolo badihiti nginga, badhimi oko tina ɛ ehole ekɛkɛ ko basundoli edhimeli ta ehole ɛ lomeko. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Kona ɛkwa ta ndanda ɛ mele ma ndjubɛ edii bato bia ibaoki Ebaeli; endolo bakamamai na ndjia tina ɛ makɛsɛli, madiheli ko na sepi dja mohelo, ko tedjibote mikɔ mipele. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Kona hee ɛkwa ta mokpɔtɔ mopele edii elengɛ bato bia baoki Ebaeli, bayebanyɛi opele ta milema ko baboti mikɔ mipele tina ɛ ingbangba la bobo.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la moinda</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mal 4, 21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Moto atayodja moinda tina ɛ omokunda na poke kaoko omoisa ta tina dja bwako. Endolo, amobakealea diko la mesa, bɛngɛɛ bato ibadii oingea baɛnɛ ohuu. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Mbombi isusu djienɛmɛbi ohuu, ko misusu ma pɛpɛ odjebama midjebamabi ko mi imanabi ta ohuu. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Toangatanani na moda modii no ooka! Tina ɛ moto ona odii na eka adihabi onɔ; endolo ona odii pɛpɛ eka, bamokatoabi noko okɛkɛ bua balɛdjaka yo boo apeli.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɛngɛ Yesu na banaanango</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mal 3, 31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nɛngɛ Yesu na banaanango badua odii yo, endolo baidiha enɔli ɛ oenɛnɛ na nde tina ɛ embamba ɛ bato bike. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Badjebedja Yesu boo: «Ngwao na banaangwao badii osokolu ko bapalaka boo baoɛnɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Endolo Yesu abala na bato basusu boo: «Nɛngɛ mbai ko banainga, edii bato ibadii ooka ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe ko badii oyekokedja.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asii lungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mal 4, 35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu atitea ta bwato na batingami ba nde ko abala na bu boo: «Lakɛɛni ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke inɛnɛ.» Ko bakɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Ta ehole edaka bo baduke, Yesu ahwɛɛ. Mbala emɔti, lungu ɛtɔmbɛdjai ibeke; bwato baluma na madiba mbuti na odinda ko baimea ta embamba. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Batingami basabatea mbuti na Yesu ko bamoongɔdja bapela gama boo: «Molehi, Molehi, lodoi agwa!» Ɔongɔ Yesu, agamea lungu na mula ko la pɔpɔnɔ. Bogoo bonɛnɛ badaa. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Edhimeli ɛ boono odii yo hɔ?» Badaka na bɔɔ ko baluma na okamoa, ko basabaleana boo: «Moto hoo adii nda, adii ogamea noko lungu na madiba ko lodii omosuma!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔ miembo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mal 5, 1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu na batingami ba nde basɛmɛɛ ta mopkɔtɔ ma Gelasɛnɛ ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke iliyɛlɛni na Galilai. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ta ehole ɛduboa Yesu o ngondo, moto omɔti ɔ ibonga, ɔdaka na miembo mibe, adoa asaka na nde. Ehole eyai ailwaka bisendja ko aidaka ta ndako noko emɔti, endolo ta makila. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ɔenɛ yo Yesu, agama, akwa magunda boso ba nde ko abala na ngulu boo: «Ma mbai nɔsɔ wɛ nda, Yesu, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe Oonɔi Diko? Naongɔnɔkɔ, pɛpɛ otungeani oko!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Yesu abala na kpati odii mwembo mobe boo maimwane odii yo. Mwembo mua mobe mamokondjaka mbala djike; banangaka mabɔ na mako na minyɔɔlɔ tina ɛ omobanea, endolo adaka seko omikanyola ko mwembo madaka mamokola oko ta bisobe. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu amohɔdja boo: «Kombe ɛ wɛ nda?» – «Kombe ɛ mbai edii “Bike”», asɔmbɛdja bea. Tina ɛ boo, miembo mibe mike maingeaka odii yo. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ko miembo mia mibe maongɔɔnɔ Yesu boo atamiloma ta mombɔndɔ ma mbɛngɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Bea, ena mbuti, bwela ba ngulu bonɛnɛ badaka bahombe mia ma oyaka diko la ngomba. Miembo mibe maongɔɔnɔ Yesu boo abapɛ enɔli ɛ oingea ta bwela bua ba ngulu. Yesu abapa enɔli. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Miembo mibe maimana odii moto ona ko maingea odii ngulu. Bwela bua ba ngulu badonga diko la ngomba bahilingoana ko badinda ta ibeke. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Babanei ba ngulu ɔɛnɛ bo modjɔ mua imanɔɔ, batia ko bananganedja gala ta ibonga na ta ngando ikɛkɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bato baimana tina ɛ oɛnɛ moda imanɔɔ modjɔ mua. Baimea mbuti na Yesu ko batanea moto oimusedjama miembo mibe: adii ta mako ma Yesu, alwali bisendja, ko yongi ɛ nde ɛɛsɔmbɔ. Ko badaka na bɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bato basusu ibaenɛ midjɔ mia batɔndɔ moda mahela moto ɔdaka na miembo mibe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Na bea bato basusu ba ekenge ena ɛ mokpɔtɔ ma ba Gelasɛnɛ bahɔdja Yesu boo adonge odii bo, tina ɛ boo badaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. Yesu atitea ta bwato boo akɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Boso ba boo Yesu adonge na batingami ba nde, moto ona oimwanedja Yesu miembo mibe amongɔɔnɔ boo adikame odii yo. Endolo Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Yana odii wɛ ko djebedja misusu miokɔmɛi Ndjambe.» Moto ona akɛɛ adjebedja ta ibonga isusu mua imamokɔmɛ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa mwali ɔ Yailo ko mwali ona ɔbinga esendja ɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mal 5, 21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Ta ihule la Yesu ta ngambo ekina ɛ ibeke, aosɔmɔ na bato bike, tina ɛ boo bamoombaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ta ehole ena, moomi omɔti ɔ komb'ɛ Yailo aimea. Adaka kumu ɔ ndako ɛ miongɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda. Akwa magunda ta mako ma Yesu ko amongɔɔnɔ bo akɛɛ ta ndako ɛ nde, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />tina ɛ boo adaka na mwa mwali oko omɔti, ɔ mbua mbuti na doomi na babae, adaka mbuti na ogwa. Ehole ɛdaka Yesu akɛɛ oho, bato bike bamombambamedjaka mɔngɔ masusu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mwali omɔti adaka ena na epeko ɛ itanga la makia mbua doomi na babae. Abungedja odiheli ba nde bosusu odii minganga, endolo moto omɔti aihɔnɔ omoheledja. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Asabatea na Yesu osangɔngɔ ko abinga sɔngɔ ɛ esendja ɛ nde. Oko ena ambuku, makia makina otanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu ahɔdja boo: «Obingini nda?» Bato basusu baingana ko Piɛlɛ abala boo: «Molehi, bato bike baohiki ko baombambamedjai mɔngɔ masusu.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Endolo Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Moto omɔti abingini, tina ɛ boo naoki ngulu ɛ Ndjambe eimani odii mbai.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mwali aenɛ boo bamotɔngɔli. Na bea akɛɛ na mongongoma mosusu, akwa magunda boso ba Yesu. Amodjebedja boso ba bato basusu tina ɛ mobinga na nde ko moda mahela na nde ambuku. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Mwa mbai mwali, edhimeli ɛ wɛ eoheledjai. Kɛɛ na ogoo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Oko Yesu apeli abala, moto omɔti adonga ta ndako ɛ kumu ɔ ndako ɛ miongɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda ko abala na Yailo boo: «Mwa wɛ o mwali agwi. Pɛpɛ otungea molehi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Endolo Yesu amooka ko abala na Yailo boo: «Pɛpɛ obanga, dhima oko odhima, mwa wɛ mwali ahelalea.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ehole eimea yo ta ndako, aidhima boo moto omɔti aingee engbanga na nde, dongedja oko Piɛlɛ, Yoani, Djake, ko na sango na nɛngɛ mwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bato basusu bayeaka ko basayeanaka ta tina ɛ mwana. Bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Pɛpɛ oyeani. Agwiti, ahwɛli hiɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bamosɛkɛ, tina ɛ boo badjeba boo mwana agwi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Endolo, Yesu apea mwana ta ebɔ ko abala na moholi mopipo boo: «Mwa mbai mwali, emaa!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Asɔmbɔ ta mohelo ko aema ambuku. Yesu abala na bu boo bamopɛ mia ma oyaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Baboti ba nde baluma na okamoa, endolo Yesu abala na bu boo batadjebedja moto omɔti modjɔ muu mosakɔɔmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Olomama ba batingami doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:1-14">Mat 10, 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mal 6, 7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu asanganedja batingami doomi na babae ko abapa ngulu na kpati ɛ obengana miembo mibe misusu ko oheledja bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Bea, abaloma tina ɛ otɔndɔ okumu ba Ndjambe ko na oheledja bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Abala na bu boo: «Pɛpɛ otombani eka ta tina ɛ mwɛngo, pɛpɛ pango, pɛpɛ tɔmbi, pɛpɛ ipa, pɛpɛ falanga, ko engi moto adae oko na esendja emɔti. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Esika esusu eosɔleani bo, dani oko ta ndako ena mbunoko okadongani ena. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Esika esusu elonalea bo oosɔni, dongani ta ibonga la bobo ko pupolani mbumbu dja mako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Opupola mbumbu dja mako etingodjai bo oditi na modjɔ okɔ na bato ba ngando ena ibaloni oosɔ Mwako Mopele ma Ndjambe. Obadikei ibo mɛnɛ mbumbu dja bobo, edi embete ɛ bo Ndjambe abapalea etumbu.</char></note> ma boono: edalea ekebedjɛli tina ɛ bobo.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Batingami bakɛɛ; banɔɔnɔ ta ngando isusu, batɔndɔkɔ mwako mopele ko baheledjaka bato ba bipeko mɔngɔ masusu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okɛsɛli ba Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mat 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Mal 6, 14-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Bea, Elode, kumu ɔ Galilai aoka midjɔ mia misusu imanɔkɔ. Aidjeba modjɔ ma okɔ, tina ɛ bakina babalaka boo: «Yoani Mobatisi apusoi ta ndanda ɛ bato bago.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bakina babalaka boo: «Edii Elia aenɛmi.» Bakina koko babalaka boo: «Omɔti ɔ batɛli ibayou apusoi ta ogwa!» <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Endolo Elode abala ohuu boo: «Mbai moto ɔkɛsɛdja molo ma Yoani. Ona moto ndani ɔkaka mbai babala midjɔ mia misusu ta tina ɛ nde?» Ko ahombaka aenɛ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayakedja bato koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mal 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-15">Yoa 6, 1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Ta ihule la ba Apotele, badjebedja Yesu midjɔ misusu imakɔɔ boo. Abatomba ko asasua na bu mbuti na ibonga ilabeaka bo Betesaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Bimumu ba bato baoka ko babakimana. Yesu abaosɔ, abala na bu tina ɛ okumu ba Ndjambe ko aheledja bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ɔtita busa, batingami doomi na babae basabatea mbuti na Yesu ko babala na nde boo: «Yanedja bato bii basusu bɛngɛɛ bakɛɛ ta ngando ko ta ndako dja mbuti. Oho, badihalea bisika ba ohwɛ na mia ma oyaka, tina ɛ boo lodii ha wɛte ta esobe.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Endolo Yesu abala na bu boo: «Bapani ino mɛɛnɛ mia ma oyaka!» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Lodii oko na mapa matano na swi babae, na bea ɛpalaka wɛ boo iso mɛɛnɛ lakɛɛ asomba mia ma oyaka tina ɛ bato bii basusu?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Badaka ena baami mbuti na koto itano. Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Badedjani na bibole ba tuku itano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Batingami basuma ko babadedja ibo basusu. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu atomba mapa matano na swi babae, aihwedja miso o diko ko asakoa Ndjambe. Na bea abuka mapa na swi ko apa odii batingami bɛngɛɛ boo bakaane na bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Ibo asusu bayaka ko bagola. Batuta tikaika olumedja mapole doomi na mabae.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ abali ohuu boo Yesu adii Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16, 13-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mal 8, 27-30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:67-71">Yoa 6, 67-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu asasua tina ɛ miongɔɔnɔ ko batingami ba nde badaka engbanga na nde. Yo abahɔdja boo: «Bato babalaka boo mbai nadii nda?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Bakina babalaka boo odii Yoani Mobatisi, bakina odii Elia, ko bakina koko odii omɔti ɔ batɛli ibayou ona ɔpusoa ta ogwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />«Yesu abahɔdja boo bea ino odini obala boo mbai nadii nda?» Piɛlɛ amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Wɛ odii Masiya ɔ Ndjambe.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai ogwa na opusoa ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 16:20-24">Mat 16, 20-24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-33">Mal 8, 30-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu abasia na ngulu mɛɛnɛ boo batatɔndɔɔ noko moto omɔti, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />ko abakea boo: «Eboani boo Mwana ɔ moto anɔngɔme obuke; adumbame na basuku, banganga ba Ndjambe ibanɛnɛ ko bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko, aowamabi ko ta iswi la basato apuswabi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moda ma okimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Mat 16, 24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Mal 8, 34-9, 1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Bea, Yesu abala na ibo asusu boo: «Ekadaa boo moto apali okimanani, asalone yo mɛɛnɛ, alwae ekulusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olwa ekulusu etingodjai bo moto andimi minyɔkɔ kaoko ogwa tina ɛ Yesu.</char></note> ɛ nde tu busa ko atingame na mbai. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Na tina hee, ona opali oheledja mohelo ma nde amobungedjabi; endolo ona obungedjabi mohelo ma nde tina ɛ mbai amoheledjabi. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ekadaa boo moto akondji madiheli ma ngondo esusu, edihalea yo nde akabungedja mohelo ma nde kaoko akasabedja yo mɛɛnɛ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Na bea, moto ookeabini sɔni ko na bibaeli ba mbai, Mwana ɔ moto amokeabi koko yo sɔni, ta ehole eduabi yo ta ekumu ɛ nde ko ta ekumu ɛ Sango na babwɛndi basɛnɔke. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nabali na nu edii sooti: bakina badii haa, batagwa boso ba oenɛ okumu ba Ndjambe.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose, Elia na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 17:1-9">Mat 17, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-10">Mal 9, 2-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Mbuti na maswi mwambe ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, Yesu atomba Piɛlɛ, Yoani na Djake ko aihwea na bu ta ngomba tina ɛ ongɔɔnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ta ehole ɛdaka yo aongɔɔnɔ, mbanda ɛ nde ɛ ngɛngɛ ko bisendja ba nde bangɛngɛ koko na ipɛɛ la pɛpɛ obɔngɔ ohokea. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Sasimo, bato babae badaka ena basoola na Yesu: ɛdaka Mose nɔbɔ Elia, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />ibangɛngɛkɛ na ekumu. Basoolaka na Yesu moda imosukealea elomu ɛ nde na ogwa ta Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Piɛlɛ na baminande bahwɛ hiɔ ipipo; endolo ɔtolima bo, baenɛ ekumu ɛ Yesu ko baami babae baemi na nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Ta ehole ɛhɔmbaka baami bia bakina Yesu, Piɛlɛ abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, edii opele ladae haa! Lapike bitondo bisato, emɔti tina ɛ wɛ, emɔti tina ɛ Mose ko emɔti tina ɛ Elia.» Piɛlɛ aitakanaka mua imabalaka yo. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Oko adii abala bea, itute lidoi ko libahwui na esii ɛ lu. Batingami babanga oenɛ boo itute labahwua. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Kɔpɛ eokama ta itute boo: «Hoo adii mwana ɔ mbai, ona ɔhɔɔ mbai, mookani!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ehole esukea kɔpɛ obalama, Yesu adika yo mɛɛnɛ. Batingami bapɔpɔnɔ ko, ta maswi mia baitɔndɔɔ noko moto omɔti mia misusu imaenɛ bo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja mwana ɔ daka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17, 14-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mal 9, 14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ɔya busa, batita ta ngomba ko emumu ɛ bato ɛdoa asaka na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ta ndanda ɛ emumu ɛ bato, moomi omɔti agamaka boo: «Molehi, naongɔɔni, hokeani mwana moomi hoo ɔ mbai, tina ɛ boo adii ikinda! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mwembo mobe mokamopee, mokamogamedjae ambuku, mokamodumbakake na ngulu ko mokamoimusedjae mapuli ta monɔkɔ; mokamonɔngɛdjae ko temomokine pɛpɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Naongɔɔnɔ batingami ba wɛ boo bamobengane, endolo baihɔnɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Yangola ebe ɛ taka ɛ edhimeli! Mbunoko ehole ndani naboani odikama na nu ko nalwalea muna ma boono? Dua na mwana ɔ wɛ haa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Ta ehole ɛ batama mwana, mwembo mobe mamodumba ta kpɔtɔ ko mamopukusa na ngulu mɛɛnɛ. Endolo Yesu agamea mwembo mobe, aheledja mwana ko amosɔmbɛdja odii sango. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ko bato basusu bakamoa ta oenɛ ngulu enɛnɛ ɛ Ndjambe.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu adjebedjai naikina ogwa ba nde</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mal 9, 30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ena ɔdaka moto omɔti na omɔti akamoa ta misusu imakɔkɔ Yesu, abala na batingami ba nde boo: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Baneani opele modjɔ muu mapalaka mbai naodjebedjaeni hadɛdi: Mwana ɔ moto akabamalea ta mabɔ ma bato.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Endolo batingami baisipoaka ebaeli ena: tingo ɛ yu ebombama odii bo bɛngɛɛ boo batayesipoa ko babangaka ohɔdja Yesu ta tina ɛ yu.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto ɔ boso ta ndanda ɛ batingami</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mal 9, 33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Batingami babanga osweana: ndani ta ndanda ɛ bobo ɔboanaka oda moto ɔ boso. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu adjeba modjɔ imabatungeaka. Bea atomba mwana mokɛkɛ ko amoemea mbuti na nde, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ko abala na bu boo: «Moto ona oosi mwana mokɛkɛ elengɛɛ hoo ta kombe ɛ mbai, aosini; ko moto oosini; aosi ona ɔlomani. Tina ɛ boo ona odii moto ɔ suka ta ndanda ɛ boono, edii yo ona odii moto ɔ boso.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ona odii pɛpɛ olonani adii ɔ boono</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 9:38-41">Mal 9, 38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yoani abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, laenɛ moto omɔti ona ɔbenganaka miembo mibe ta kombe ɛ wɛ ko lapalaka omosia, tina ɛ boo aditi ɔ engbanga ɛ boso.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ omosia, tina ɛ boo moto ona odii pɛpɛ olonani adii ɔ boono.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngando emɔti ɛ Samalia eloni oosɔ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ɔbatama ehole ɛ Yesu boo akine ngondo hee, adiha malɛi mapipo boo akɛɛ ta Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Aloma bato boso ba nde, bakɛɛ ko baingea ta ngando emɔti ɛ Samalia tina ɛ obɔngedja esika ɛ ohwee. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Endolo bato ba ngando ena balona omosɔ, tina ɛ badjebaka boo akeke wɛte ta Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Ehole ɛoka Djake nɔbɔ Yoani bea babala boo: «Kumu, opali boo labee mosa matite donga busa tina ɛ obabeedja ibo asusu?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Endolo Yesu ahombana odii bo ko abaosa dosa. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ko bakɛɛ ta ngando ekina.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibadii opala okimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8, 19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ehole edaka Yesu na batingami ba nde badale na ndjia, moto omɔti abala na Yesu boo: «Mbai naokimanalea ngise isusu ikɛlea wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Bibanga badii na maposi ko mbulu ba diko badii na moopu, endolo Mwana ɔ moto, aditi na esika ɛ osambea molo ma nde.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu abala na moto okina boo: «Kimanani.» Endolo moto ona amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, pani enɔli napete kɛɛ boso apusea tata.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Kina bago bapusee bago ba bobo; endolo wɛ, kɛɛ alehe okumu ba Ndjambe.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Okina koko abala na Yesu boo: «Kumu, naokimanalea, endolo pani enɔli nakɛɛ nakabɔtɔnɔ na denga la mbai.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Moto ona obangi opusola mopkɔtɔ ma gue na epɛsɛ bo aone ena ahokea osangɔngɔ aboaniti na okumu ba Ndjambe.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu alomi batingami tuku saambo na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:7-16">Mat 10, 7-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Kumu ahɔɔ batingami bakina tuku saambo na babae ko abaloma babae na babae boso ba nde ta mabonga masusu ko na bisika bisusu baboanaka boo yo mɛɛnɛ akɛɛ <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Abala na bu boo: «Mosala ma obuka mbuma modii monɛnɛ, endolo basali badii bakɛkɛ. Na bea ongɔɔnɔni moswa gue alome basali ta obuka mbuma dja nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Kɛɛni! Naolomini elengɛ bana ba bhata ta ndanda ɛ swa. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Pɛpɛ otombani na falanga, na tɔmbi, na ipapa, ko pɛpɛ oemani na ndjia tina ɛ oisea noko moto omɔti. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Ta ndako esusu eingialea no, balani boso boo: “Yɛɛ Ndjambe apɛ ogoo ta ndako ena.” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ekada boo moto ɔ bogoo adii ena, bogoo ba boono bodalea odii yo; emiti daa bea, bogoo ba boono bosɔmbɔlea odii no. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Yeyoani ta ndako ena, yakani ko mwani lua lopaleani bo ena, tina ɛ boo mosali abɔngi na iputi la nde. Pɛpɛ okinani ndako ena boo oingeeni ta ekina. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Ta ibonga isusu ilingialea no ko bakaosɔleani, yakani losusu loopaleani bo; <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />heledjani bato ba bipeko ibatanealea no ena ko balani na bu boo: “okumu ba Ndjambe bodii mbuti na nu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Endolo ibonga isusu ilingealea no ko bamiti osɔɔni ena, kɛɛni ta matilinga ma ndjia ko balani boo: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Noko mobumbu ma ibonga la boono imokatimeaki ta bigbota ba booso lomopupoli tina ɛ okiniani mo. Endolo djebani boo okumu ba Ndjambe bodii mbuti na nu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nabali na nu sooti boo: ta busa ba esambi ɛ Ndjambe bato ba ibonga dia badabi na etumbu epipo onɔdja bato ba Sodɔmɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabonga imalona odima</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 11:21-23">Mat 11, 21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Ndjokwa ɛ wɛ, Kolazine! Ndjokwa ɛ wɛ, Betesaida! Tina ekadaa boo bimbete baokamoa ibakɔmɔkɔ odii no bakɔmɔ ta Tula na Sidona, bato ba ngando djii bakɔkɔ sɔmbɔtɔnɔ mida ma bobo donga ehele, eke bainɛdja na olwa ngɔtɔ ko osahua na mihulu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ta tina hee, ta busa ba esambi ɛ Ndjambe etumbu ɛ boono edabi epipo onɔ Tula na Sidona. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Ko wɛ, Kapalanauma, ɔlɛdjaka boo Ndjambe oihwedjabi mbunoko ta busa? Pɛpɛ, odumbamabi mbunoko ta esika ɛ bago.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Abala koko na batingami ba nde boo: «Moto ona ɔɔkakani aokini; ona odumbini adumbini; ko ona odumbini, adumbi ona ɔlomani.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule la batingami tuku saambo na babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ehole ehula batingami tuku saambo na babae badaka na sepi enɛnɛ ko babala boo: «Kumu, noko miembo mibe milosumi na kombe ɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Naenɛki Satana okwa donga busa elengɛ mokaikai. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Okani! Naopani kpati ɛ odala diko la ndjɔ na koto ko obedja na osusu ngulu ɛ moloni, ko pɛpɛ eka ehɔni okɔɔni obe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Na bea, pɛpɛ osepani tina ɛ boo miembo mibe miosumini; sepani tina ɛ boo Ndjambe akoma kombe dja boono ta busa.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sepi ɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11, 25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13, 16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Oko ta ehole ena, Yesu aluma na sepi na ndjia ɛ Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. Abala boo: «Tata, Kumu ɔ busa na kpɔtɔ, naokumedjai tina ɛ oenɛmɛdja wɛ odii bana bakɛkɛ midjɔ imabombea wɛ bato ba owɛi na ba esipoli. Edii bea, Tata, ɔpala bea. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Tata apani midjɔ misusu. Moto omɔti atadjeba kaoko Mwana adii ndani dongedja oko Tata, ko moto omɔti atadjeba kaoko Tata adii ndani dongedja oko Mwana, ko odii ona opali Mwana boo amoinɛdjae Tata ɔ nde.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Bea Yesu ahombana odii batingami ba nde ko abala oko na bu mɛɛnɛ boo: «Odini bato ba sepi oenɛ midjɔ midii no oenɛ! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Sooti, nabali na nu boo, batɛli bike na bakumu badaka na posa oenɛ midjɔ mii maenɛkɛ no, endolo baimienɛ, baoke midjɔ mii maokaka no, endolo baimioka.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la Mosamalia mopele</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22, 34-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mal 12, 28-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Bea, moto ɔ edjebeli ɛ mibeko aema ko abala na Yesu tina ɛ omomeka: «Molehi, eboani mbai okɔ ye tina ɛ odiha mohelo ma kɔbili?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɛkomama ta Mobeko ma boso ye? Ekalange wɛ ena nde?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Amosɔmbɛdja boo: «“Opalalea Kumu Ndjambe ɔ wɛ, na molema ma wɛ mosusu, na omoto ba wɛ bosusu, na ngulu ɛ wɛ esusu ko na malɛi ma wɛ masusu.” Koko boo: “Pala mina wɛ elengɛɛ okasapale wɛ mɛɛnɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Bea Yesu abala na nde boo: «Osɔmbɛdjai opele. Kɔɔ oko bea ko ohelalea.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Endolo moto ona ɔ edjebeli ɛ mibeko apalaka asalongedjae. Bea ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Ko odii mina mbai nda?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu amosɔmbɛjda boo: «Moto omɔti adonga ta Yelusalema ko akɛkɛ ta Yeliko, asaka na bapundji, baona na nde, bamokatoa leka losusu ladaka na nde, bamoboma, bakɛɛ ko bamokina mbuti na ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Nganga ɔ Ndjambe omɔti anɔkɔ ta ndjia ena, amoeni ko amobambea ta dɔngɔ ikina la ndjia ko asasua ohali na nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Moda momɔti, molewi aiemea ta esika ena, aeni moto ona ɔbena pola, amobambea, apenda dɔngɔ ikina la ndjia ko asasua na nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Endolo Mosamalia ona ɔdaka na mwɛngo oko ta ndjia ena aimea mbuti na moto ona ɔbenedja bo. Ɔmoenɛ yo, amookea ndjokwa enɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Abatama mbuti na nde mɛɛnɛ, asopa munɛ na vino diko la pola dja nde ko adjidinga na bisendja. Ngɔngɔ djia amobakea ta diko la punda ɔ nde mɛɛnɛ ko akɛɛ na nde ta ndako ɛ bakɛndɛli ko amosaboa opele. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ngɔngɔ dja iswi imɔti, aihwi falanga djike, adjipi odii mobanei ɔ ndako ɛ bakendeli ko abala na nde boo: “Mokɔmɛdja opele; ta ihule la mbai, naosɔmbɛdjalea makondja imabakelea wɛ diko la mii masaopa mbai.”»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesu abakea boo: «Ta ndanda ɛ ibo basato, oboanaki oda mina nde nda?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Moto ɔ edjebeli ɛ mibeko asɔmbejda boo: «Edii ona ɔmokea ndjokwa.» Ko Yesu abala na nde boo: «Wɛ kɛɛ akɔɔ bea.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aosɔmɔ odii Malata nɔbɔ Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Ehole ɛdaka Yesu na batingami ba nde badale ta ndjia, aingea ta ngando emɔti, ko mwali omɔti, kombe ɛ nde Malata, amosɔ ta ndako ɛ nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Malata adaka na ngɛnɛ ɔ nde mwali, kombe ɛ nde Malia, adaa ta mako ma Kumu ko ahokamedjaka ebaeli ɛ nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Malata, asatungea obuke na mosala ma okalea mia. Adoa odii Yesu ko abala na nde boo: «Kumu, oditi oenɛ obe boo ngɛnɛ ɔ mbai mwali akineini mosala mosusu? Bala na nde boo adoe akɔmɛdjani.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Kumu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Malata, Malata, odii osatungea diko la midjɔ mia misusu, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />endolo modjɔ momɔti monɔi na kito. Malia ahɔi ibondo ipele, likatoametebi odii yo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi moda ma oongɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7, 7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu aongɔɔnɔkɔ ta esika emɔti. Ehole ɛbɛtɛ yo oongɔɔnɔ, omɔti ɔ batingami ba nde amohɔdja boo: «Kumu, lolaka oongɔɔnɔ, moda malaka Yoani Mobatisi batingami ba nde.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ehole edii no oongɔɔnɔ, balani boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">yɛɛ boo kombe ɛ wɛ ɛdae esɛnɔke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">yɛɛ okumu ba wɛ badoe!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Lopa engi busa mia madi na su posa.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Loyɛɛ iso masumu ma booso, tina ɛ boo iso mɛɛnɛ lokayɛɛ ibia bakalokɔmɛɛ obe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Ko pɛpɛ olokina boo lakwae ta omekama.”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ingbangba ta miɔngɔɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">Mat 7, 7-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:1-8">Luk 18, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:22-28">Mat 15, 22-28</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:5-7">Djak 1, 5-7</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:14-15">1Yoa 5, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: «Eka daa bo omɔti ɔ boono adii na mopalani ɔ nde ona okɛlea yo na bulu mɛɛnɛ tina ɛ obala na nde boo: “Mopalani ɔ mbai, bekedjani mapa masato. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Omɔti ɔ bapalani ba mbai ona odii ta mwɛngɔ asataneani oko hadedi ko naditi na eka ɛ omopa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Ekada bo ta otei ba ndako mopalani ɔ nde amosɔmbɛdjai boo: “Kina otungeani! Edipako edipami ehele, na mbai na bana ba mbai losaami; nataboana oongɔɔ bɛngɛ naopɛ mapa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Na bea, nabali na nu boo: noko na amiti oongɔɔ ta omopa tina ɛ boo adii mopalani ɔ nde, aongɔɔlea tina ɛ ingbangba la nde ko akokedjalea mua imakambaka na nde. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Ko mbai, nabali na nu boo: Yeyoani osɛngɛ baopaleani; yeyoani ohomba odihaleani; yeyoani oboma ekukɛ baodipoaleani. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Tina ɛ boo moto ndani ona osɛngɛkɛ adii oosɔ, ona ɔhombaka adii odiha ko badii odipoa ekukɛ odii ona ɔbomaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ona sɛngɛmoto ndani ta ndanda ɛ boono, oboani opa mokpakola odii mwana ɔ nde moomi ekada boo amosɛngi moswi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Kaoko amopalea gbangaikɔlɔ ekada boo amosɛngi itɔ? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ino ibadii babe, odjebini opa leka lopele odii bana ba boono. Na onɔ Sɛngɛmoto ona odii o diko apɛtelea Mwembo Mosɛnɔke odii bia ibadii omosɛngɛ mo!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abengani mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12, 22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mal 3, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu abengana mwembo mobe imaimedja moto emimi. Ena oimwana mwembo mobe, emimi abanda obala ko emumu ɛ bato ɛkamoa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Endolo, bakina babala boo: «Edii Bɛlɛzebulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛlɛzebulu edi kombe ekina ɛ Satana.</char></note>, kumu ɔ miembo mibe, ona omopi kpati ɛ obengana miembo mia mibe!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bakina tina ɛ omotɛdja ibaku: bahombaka badihe odii yo embete ɛ okamoa oenɛmɛdja boo alomama na Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Endolo Yesu adjeba malɛi ma bobo; bea abala na bu boo: «Ekada boo okumu bokabani ko bato ba bu baoni bitumba ibo mɛɛnɛ, okumu bua bosukealea na obeha, ndako dja bu djibukeanalea djikina diko la djikina. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ekadaa bea boo Satana asakabani yo mɛɛnɛ, moda ndani okumu ba nde boyeyoalea? Obalini bea boo, nadii obengana miembo mibe tina ɛ boo Bɛlɛzebulu apini kpati. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nakababengana na moda mua, ona okapɛ ibadii imbati na nu kpati ɛ obengana nda? Ibadii na imbati na nu ibo mɛɛnɛ baenɛmɛdjaka boo okwini na ikambo! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Endolo ekada boo nabenganaka miembo mibe na ngulu ɛ Ndjambe, edii boo okumu ba Ndjambe bodoi mbunoko odii no. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Ekada moto ɔ ngulu ko odii na bipeko ba bila abanei ndako ɛ nde, leka la nde losusu lobaneamalea opele. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Endolo ekada boo moto omonɔi na ngulu amoimanei ko amolongi, amokatolalea bipeko ba bila ibikaisee yo molema ko aboani okabana leka losusu lomokatoi yo. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Ona odii pɛpɛ oda na mbai, adii moloni ɔ mbai; ko ona odii pɛpɛ osanganedja, adii onanganedja.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osɔmbɔ ba mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Ehole edii mwembo mobe oimana odii moto, modii olebaleba ta bisika ba bisobe ko modii ohomba iheme. Otaki yo esika ɛ iheme, mosabalei boo: “Nasɔmbɔlea ta ndako ɛ mbai, ena ɛkina mbai.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Mosɔmbi ko motanei ndako eombɔmoke, ebɔngɛdjamake. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Bea mwembo mua mobe mokɛi atomba miembo mikina mibe saambo iminɔi na obila, baingei ta ndako ko badai ena. Na bea, moda ma moto ona monɔlea obe onɔdja moda ma nde ma mbangi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibɔngi la sooti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ehole ɛbala Yesu bea, mwali omɔti ta emumu ɛ bato abala na nde boo: «Sepi odii mwali ona olwa deemi la wɛ ko ona ɔɔnungea!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Endolo Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Sepi ɛ onɔ edii wɛte odii bia ibakaoke ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe ko bakayesume!»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Embete ɛ Yona na Mwana ɔ moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Bimumu ba bato badoa abolama mbuti na Yesu, abanga obala na bu boo: «Yangola hee edii yangola ebe; edii ohɔdja embete, endolo embete emɔti epametelea dongedja oko embete ɛkɔɔmɔ odii Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Tina ɛ boo, moda madaa Yona embete tina ɛ bato ba Niniwe, moda momɔti Mwana ɔ moto adalea embete tina ɛ yangola hee. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Ta busa ba esambi, kumu mwali ɔ Saba aemabi boso ba yangola hee ko ayedumbabi na ikambo, tina ɛ boo adua donga bisika ba ohali bɛngɛ aoke bibaeli ba Solomo ibaluma na owɛi! Endolo, ona oonɔi Solomo adii haa! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Ta busa ba esambi, bato ba Niniwe baemabi boso ba yangola hee ko bayedumbabi na ikambo, tina ɛ boo bato ba Niniwe ɔɔka bo bileho ba Yona bahekodja milema. Endolo ona oonɔi Yona adii haa!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ohela ta ohuu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5, 15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6, 22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Moto tayodjae moinda tina ɛ omobomba kaoko omoisa nase dja poke; endolo adii omobakea diko la mesa ɛ mwinda, bɛngɛ boo bato ibaingeaka ta ndako baenɛ ohuu. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Diso la wɛ lidii moinda ma mokuku: diso la wɛ likada laenɛ opele, mokuku ma wɛ mosusu koko modii oenɛmɛ ohuu; endolo diso la wɛ likadaa na epeko, mokuku ma wɛ koko modii ta modidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Bea, tomadinga boo ohuu bodii ta tei ɛ wɛ bosaka imea modidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ekadaa boo mokuku ma wɛ mosusu modii ta tei ɛ ohuu, pɛpɛ yale ekina ta modidi, modalea mosusu ta ohuu mɛɛnɛ, oko moda modii moinda ohoodja na ohuu ba mu ba ongɛngɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu apundi bafalusai na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mal 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Ehole ɛbɛtɛ Yesu obala, mofalusai omɔti amobea ayaka odii yo. Yesu aingea ko adaa ta mesa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mofalusai akamoa ena oenɛ yo boo Yesu aisosa mabɔ boso ba oyaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kumu abala na nde boo: «Ino Bafalusai: odini opuedja sokolu ɛ kɔbɔ na saani, endolo otei ba milema olumini na posa ɛ iba ko obila. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Otasipoakani eka! Ndjambe ona ɔ kɔɔ sokulu editi oko yo moto ɔkɔɔ otei? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Endolo pani odii bakwali ena edii ta otei ba kɔbɔ na saani dja boono, na moda mua misusu midalea osɛnɔɔ tina ɛ boono.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Ndjokwa ɛ boono, Bafalusai! Odii opaani odii Ndjambe ibondo la doomi la kona dja mokonda na dja ngando, ijikape ikɛmɔ ta mia, endolo otsiolini odjoo na bato ko na epaeli ɛ Ndjambe: ena edii modjɔ mobɔngɔkino okɔ, na pɛpɛ otsio la mikina.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Ndjokwa ɛ boono, Bafalusai! Okapaleni bigboto ba boso ta ndako dja miɔngɔɔnɔ ma Bayuda ko okapaleni baoisiakeni ta bisika ba masaka ma bato bike. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ boono! Odini elengɛɛ makila imadii pɛpɛ oenɛmɛ ko bato badii odala diko la mu pɛpɛ odjeba!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Omɔti ɔ bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, odii wɛ obala bea, odii olosinga iso koko!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ndjokwa odii no koko, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko! Odini obakea ta mikɔngɔ ma bato mina minɔi na mandi ta olwa, ko oditini obinga mina mia noko na sɔngɔ ɛ mosapi tina ɛ obakɔmɛdja ta omilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ boono! Odii opikani makila ma omwenga tina ɛ batɛli, batɛli bia ibaowa bataatanu! <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Oinedjaini bea boo ɔdhimakani mikɔ ma batatanu, tina ɛ boo baowa batɛli, ko ino, opikini makila ma bobo! <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Na tina hee Ndjambe, ta owɛi ba nde, abala ohuu boo: “Nabalomeabi batɛli na ba apotele; baowabi bakina ta ndanda ɛ bobo ko banyɔkolabi bakina.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Bɛngɛ boo yangola hee ɛlwae lindo ɛ makia ma batɛli imasopea donga oyoama ba ngondo, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />donga owama ba Abɛlɛ mbunoko owama ba Zakalia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Odi Bayuda, buku ɛ Ibange edi ɛ boso ko Koloniki edi ɛ suka. Tina ena Luka alangi Abɛlɛ nɔbɔ Zakalia</char></note>, ona ɔowa bo si etumbelo ɛ mbeka na esika esɛnoke. Edii bea, nabali na nu ohuu, yangola hee elwalea lindo ɛ magwa mia masusu!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Ndjokwa ndani tina ɛ boono, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko! Otombini fungola edii opaa enɔli ɛ odipoa edipako ɛ edjebeli: ino mɛɛnɛ otaingeakani ko ɔsiini ibia ibadii opala oingea.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ehole ɛ imana Yesu ta ndako ena, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai bamooka kɛlɛ ko bamohɔdja mahɔdja mida misusu: <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />bamopekeaka nduka bɛngɛ boo bamotɛdjae diko la bibaeli ba nde mɛɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Oangatana na owɛi bobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10, 26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ta ehole ena, bato basangana nkoto na nkoto, mbuti na osaminakaka na mako. Yesu abala boso mɛɛnɛ na batingami ba nde boo: «Angatanani na nɛngɛ mapa ma Bafalusai, edii wɛte owɛi ba bobo bobe. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Misusu imikundi mienɛmɛbi ohuu, ko misusu ma mbombi midjebamabi. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Na tina hee misusu mibalabi no ta modidi miokamabi ta ihuu la busa, ko imihɔlɔkɔnɔbi no ta matoi bato bakina ta ekenge ɛ ndako edipamake mibalamabi na moholi mopipo diko la bitondo.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ona oboani obangama</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Nabali na nu, odii no bapalani ba mbai: pɛpɛ obangani ibia ibadii owa mokuku endolo bia, ngɔngɔ, batahɔnɔ okɔ imonɔi. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Napalaka naoinedjaeni ona oboani no obanga: bangani Ndjambe ona ɔ boo, ngɔngɔ dja ogwa, adii na kpati tina ɛ odumbani ta ipelu. Sooti, nabali na nu, edii yo ona oboani no obanga! <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Te batɛkɛ basoketele batano na baa falanga bakɛkɛ? Endolo, Ndjambe tabosae noko omɔti ɔ bobo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ko noko na swee dja molo ma wɛ idii ilangamake. Bea pɛpɛ odani na bɔɔ: ino onɔini basoketele bike na motwuia!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tati epele tina ɛ Yesu kaoko omoingana</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10, 32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12, 32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10, 19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />«Nabali na nu boo: ona obalabi ohuu boso ba bato boo: adii ɔ mbai, Mwana ɔ moto abalabi koko ohuu boo: adii ɔ mbai boso ba babwɛndi ba Ndjambe; <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />endolo ona oinganabini boso ba bato boo: tadjebeni, Mwana ɔ moto adimabi koko boso ba babwɛndi ba Ndjambe boo: tamodjebe. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Ona obalabi ebaeli ebe tina ɛ Mwana ɔ moto, ayɛɛmɛbi; endolo ona osingabi Mwembo Mosɛnoke, ayɛɛmetebi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Bakakɛɛbi na nu tina ɛ osambedjani ta ndako dja miɔngɔɔnɔ ma Bayuda, kaoko boso ba bakumu, pɛpɛ okɛsɛlɛni na moda mosambalea no kaoko modjɔ mobalalea no, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />tina ɛ boo Mwembo Mosɛnɔke aodjebedjabini ta ehole ena eka eboani no obala.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la modiheli ɔ ondanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Moto omɔti ta emumu ɛ bato abala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, bala na mwaninga akaane na mbai ikwa la boso.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Mopalani ɔ mbai, oimedjaini judji ɔ osambedja midjɔ ma boono kaoko okabana leka la boono nda?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ngɔngɔ djia abali na ibo basusu boo: «Tomangatanani! Sabaneani na epaeli ɛ odiheli, tina ɛ bo mohelo ma moto motingiti na leka ilodii na nde, noko akada modiheli monɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Bea abala na bu indjɛ imɔti bo: «Modiheli omɔti adaka na kpɔtɔ idjamoboteaka mbuma ipele inɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Alɛdjanaka ko asahɔdjaka boo: “Eboani mbai okɔ ye? Naditi na esika ekoki ɛ obolea mbuma dja mbai isusu.” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Bea abakea boo: “Hokea moda mokɔlea mbai: nabukalea bibombelo ba mbai ibiyou bisusu, napikalea ibinɔi na onɛnɛ, nabolealea mbuma dja mbai djisusu dja elengɛ lɔsɔ na leka la mbai lokina. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ngɔngɔ djia, nasabalealea mbai mɛɛnɛ boo: Molimo ma mbai, odii na leka lonɛnɛ ta mbombi tina ɛ mbua bike; hema, yaka, mwa ko sepa na mohelo.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Endolo Ndjambe abala na nde boo: “Endanga! Oko ta bulu bu mɛɛnɛ ogwalea. Ko na bea, leka lua losusu lobolei wɛ, lodalea la nda?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu abakea boo: «Na bea edii moda momɔti na moto ona ɔboleaka madiheli tina ɛ nde mɛɛnɛ, endolo aditi modiheli ta miso ma Ndjambe.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oisa molema odii Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6, 25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Hokeani tina ebali mbai na nu boo: pɛpɛ osatungeani tina ɛ mohelo ma boono, diko la eka eyakaleano ko tina ɛ mokuku ma boono, diko la eka elwaleano. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Tina ɛ boo mohelo monɔi mia ko mokuku monɔi bisendja. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Hokeani baanganga: tebaone ko tebabuke mbuma, baditi na esika ɛ obomba leka la oyaka, endolo Ndjambe akabayakedjae! Ino onɔini mbulu na motwuia monɛnɛ mɛɛnɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ona ndani ta ndanda ɛ boono ohɔni ta tina ɛ osatungea ba nde okandodja maswi ma mohelo ma nde? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ekada boo otahɔnɔni noko osinɛɛ mua imodii mokɛkɛ, tina ndani odini osatungea diko la mia imidikai? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Hokeani moda mokatɔe fulɛlɛ dja gue: te djisale ko te djiyoe bisendja. Ekahia, nabali na nu, noko na Sɔlɔmɔ, ta ekumu ɛ nde esusu, aidiha bisendja ba omwenga onɔ fulɛlɛ emɔti ɛ gue. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ekada boo Ndjambe alwɛdjai mondjani modi ta gue busabu ko puma modumbamalea ta mosa: na onɔ aolwɛdjɛteleani, ino bato ba edhimeli ekɛkɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Na bea pɛpɛ osatungeani ehole esusu ohomba eka eyakalea no ko emwalea no. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Edii bato ba pɛpɛ odjeba Ndjambe badii ohomba na pɛpɛ iheme mia misusu. Endolo ino, odini na Sɛngɛ ɛ moto ona ɔdjebaka imatakaka no. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Hombani boso okumu ba Ndjambe ko Ndjambe aopaleani koko mia imidikai.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Madiheli ta busa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Ino ibadi elengɛ bwela ba ingbɛndɛ bokɛkɛ, pɛpɛ obangani! Tina ɛ boo Sangwanu asepa boo aopɛni Okumu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Tɛkɛni leka la boono ko pani falanga odii bakwali. Tombani tɔmbi idja pɛpɛ obeha, boleani madiheli ta busa, oho ta esika edabi mo pɛpɛ odimoa: esika edabi baibi pɛpɛ obatama na sɛɛ obeedja. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Tina ɛ bo esika edi odiheli bawe, edii oko ena esika edalea molema ma wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basali ibakasɛndjɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Saboanedjani tina ɛ osala, mosenge monangamake ta bongo ko miinda ma boono miyodjamake. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Daani elengɛ basali ibadii ta yambo ɛ moswa bu ta ehole ehulalea yo ta tɛkɛ ɛ moki, bɛngɛ bamodipoe edipako ena oimealea yo ko obomalea yo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Sepi ɛ basali ibatanealea moswa bu, ta oimea ba nde, mɔsu! Nabali na nu ohuu, edii sooti: alwalea bisendja ba mosala, abadedjalea ta mesa ko adualea abakaanea mia. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Sepi odii bo ekada boo aimei ta ndanda ɛ bulu kaoko ta eyɛ ɛ busa, abatanei mɔsu!<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:43-51">Mat 24, 43-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Sipoani opele modjɔ muu: ekada boo moswa ndako akadjeba ehole eboani moibi odoa, ata mopa enɔli oingea ta ndako ɛ nde. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Ino koko, sɛndjɛlɛni, tina ɛ boo Mwana ɔ moto adualea ta ehole edii no pɛpɛ olɛdja.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosali oobɔngi na ɔ pɛpɛ obɔngɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24, 45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Bea Piɛlɛ ahɔdja boo: «Kumu, ebali wɛ indjɛ dii oko tina ɛ boso kaoko tina ɛ bato basusu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Kumu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ona mosali obɔngi obakea molema ko na owɛi nda? Edii ona ɔkapɛ moswa nde mandi ma ɔbanea ndako ko opa odii basali bakina mabondo ma bobo ma mia na ehole eboani. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Sepi odii mosali ona ekada ta ihule la moswa nde amotanei oko ta mosala mua. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Nabali na nu ohuu, edii sooti: Moswa nde amopalea mandi ma obanea leka la nde losusu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Endolo mosali akasabalea boo: “Moswa mbai atahula hadɛdi”, ekada boo abangi oboma basali bakina baami ko na bali, oyaka, omwa ko olangoa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />moswa mosali hoo ahulalea iswi idii mosali pɛpɛ omolɛndɛ ko ta ehole ɛ nde ɛ pɛpɛ odjeba; abenganalea mosali ko amoisalea ta engbanga ɛ bato ibataki osuma Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Mosali odjebi eka ekapale moswa nde, endolo aditi mbuti tina ɛ oyekɔ, abomamalea obuke. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Endolo, mosali ona odii pɛpɛ odjeba olulea ba moswa nde ko akɔi midjɔ mikoki na etumbu, atabomama obuke. Odii ona opi bo obuke, ahɔdjamalea obuke; odii ona opami obuke onɔ, ahɔdjamalea koko obuke onɔ.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, inango la mabɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Nadoi aisa mosa ta ngondo ko posa ɛ mbai edii boo mayodjame! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Naboani onɔngɔmɔ ko na mbambami mbunoko okokedjama ba muu! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Olɛdjaini boo nadoi apa ogoo ta ngondo? Pɛpɛ, nabali na nu, endolo obɔtɔnɔ! <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Donga hadɛdi, ibota la bato batano libɔtɔlea, basato baokanalea ko babae baokanetelea na basato <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Sɛngɛmoto aokanetelea na mwana ɔ nde momi ko mwa moomi aokanetelea na sango, nɛngɛ moto abokanetelea na mwana ɔ nde mwali ko mwana mwali aokanetelea na nango, okio mwali aokanetelea na mwali ɔ mwana ɔ nde, ko mwali ɔ mwana aokanetelea na okio ba nde mwali.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odjeba ehole edii so</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu abala koko na emumu ɛ bato boo: «Ehole eeni no itute idongi ta dɔngɔ likahwɛ diso la busa, obalini ta mbuku bo: “Mbua akwalea”, ko edii okɔɔmɔ oko bea. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Ko ehole eoki no epoipoi edongi ta sudi, odi obala bo: “Edjungu edalea”, edii oda oko bea. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Bato ba owɛi bobe! Ɔdjebakani otikoanedja bimbete ba kpɔtɔ na ba busa; bea, tina ndani oditi odjebani otikoanedja midjo imidii onɔ ehole hee edii so hadɛdi?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ookana na moloni ɔ wɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5, 25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Tina ndani oditini odjeba ino mɛɛnɛ moda mopele ma okɔ? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Okada na modjɔ ma osamba na moto ko okɛini engbanga ta esika ɛ esambi, kɔɔ na ngulu ɔɔkaneni nɔnɔ nde ena ɔdalake no na ndjia. Olonalea boo moto odii na wɛ na ikambo ata oimedja boso ba djudji, boo djudji asaka opa ta mabɔ ma pɔlisi ko pɔlisi asaka omaa ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nabali na wɛ boo, oimwanetelea ena mbunoko okaputa nyongo esusu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Osɔmbɔtɔnɔ ba mohelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ta ehole ena, bato bakɛɛ atɔndɔ Yesu moda imaowa Pilato Bagalilai ta ehole ɛnɔdjaka bo mbeka odii Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɔlɛdjakani bo Bagalilai bia baowama bea tina ɛ boo badaka bato ba masumu manɛnɛ onɔ Bagalilai bakina basusu? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Titi bea, nabali na nu; endolo ino omiti sɔmbɔtɔnɔni moda ogwaleani ino basusu elengɛ ibo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Kaoko bato bii doomi na mwambe ibagwa ehole ɛbukeana ko ɛkwa ndako eyai ɛ Siloe, olɛdjaini boo badaka babe onɔ bato basusu ba Yelusalɛme? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Titi bea, nabali na nu; endolo omiti sɔmbɔtɔnɔni moda, ogwaleani ino basusu oko elengɛ ibo!»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mole ma figi imataka mbuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Ko Yesu abala na bu indjɛ dii boo: «Moto omɔti aona mole ma figi ta gue ɛ nde ɛ vino. Akɛɛ ahomba mbuma dja figi, endolo aidjitanea. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Bea abala na mosali ɔ nde boo: “Hokea: enɔi mbua basato nakadoe ahomba mbuma ta mole muu ma figi ko tedjidihe. Na bea, mokwɛlɛ! Tina ndani modii olumedja mokpɔtɔ oko ngasa?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Endolo mosali ɔ nde amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Kumu, peta mokina koko ta mbua hoo; nalongealea kpɔtɔ mbuti mbuti ko nadumbalea dusa. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Na bea, ehole ekina, mobotalea mbuma ta mbua ɔ ngɔngɔ; emiti daa bea, mokekamalea.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai mwali ɔ etumbɛ ta busa ba sabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Busa bomɔti ba sabata, Yesu adaka aleha ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mwali omɔti ɔ epeko adaka ena, anɛngɛdja mbua doomi na mwambe, mwembo mobe momɔti mamoyeyodja mokɔngɔ moimbi ko aihɔnɔkɔ noko osinɛɛ osaninodja. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Ehole ɛenɛ Yesu mwali ona, amobea ko abala na nde boo: «Mwali, oheli na epeko ɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Amobakea mabɔ ko, oko ena ambuku, asaninodja ko abanga okumedja Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Endolo kumu ɔ ndako ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda, aoka obe ɛlɔkɛ boo Yesu aheledja mwali ona ta busa ba sabata. Na bea abala na emumu ɛ bato boo: «Lodii na maswi masamano maboani na osala; duani ko saheledjani ta maswi mia endolo titi ta busa ba sabata!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ino bato ba owɛi bobe! Ta busa ba sabata, moto na moto akatingoe ngɔmbɛ ɔ nde ta esika ɛ nde ɛ oyaka kaoko punda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Punda ho edi wete punda ona okalwae mina ta ehole ɛ mwɛngɔ</char></note> ɔ nde okɛ amomusa madiba, editi bea? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ko mwali hoo, ɔ mbota ɛ Abalayama, ona ɔnanga Satana mbua doomi na mwambe, eboanakiti omolena mbɔti ta busa ba sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Esɔmbɛdjɛli ɛ Yesu ɛpa sɔni enɛnɛ odii baloni ba nde; endolo emumu ɛ bato bike basepa tina ɛ misala minɛnɛ mipele makɔkɔ yo.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mbuma ɛ sinapi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mal 4, 30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu abala boo: «Ekoani na Okumu ba Ndjambe nde, ko nabokokanedjalea na eka nda? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Bodii elengɛ mbuma ekɛkɛ ɛ sinapi ena ɛtomba moto omɔti ko ayooni ta gue ɛ nde: etɔi, eimei mole ko mbulu bayoi moopu ta bitape ba mu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la nɛngɛ mapa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13, 33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu abala koko boo: «Nakokanedjae Okumu ba Ndjambe na ye? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Bokoani na nɛngɛ mapa ɛtomba mwali omɔti ko ayenyɔmi esika emɔti na falini enɛnɛ, mbunoko ohalodja pɔtɔpɔtɔ esusu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edipako ekɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7, 13-14</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Ta ikɛ la Yesu ta Yelusalema, alehaka ta mabonga na ngando. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Moto omɔti amohɔdja boo: «Kumu, editi oko bato bakɛkɛ bahelabi?» Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Kɔɔni na ngulu esusu tina ɛ oingea ta edipako ekɛkɛ; tina ɛ boo, nabali na nu ohuu boo, bike bamekabi boo baingee ko bahɔnetebi.»<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Ehole eemalea moswa ndako ko akadipalea edipako, otaneamaleani sokolu, obomaleani ekukɛ ko na obala boo: “Kumu, lodipoa!” Aosɔmbɛdjaleani boo: “Nataodjebakani!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Bea, obalaleani na nde boo: “Layaka ko lamwaka na wɛ, ɔleha ta ndjia dja mabonga ma boso.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Abalabi naikina na bu bo: “Nataodjebakani! Sasuani na mbai, ino bato ba mikɔ mibe!” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Oho edii esika eyeabi no bie ko ekpɛkɛnɛbi no mino, ta ehole enɛbi no Abalayama, Isaka, Yakobo ko batɛli basusu ta Okumu ba Ndjambe ko ino odumbamabini sokolu! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bato badongabi dɔngɔ likaimane diso la busa na likahwɛ lo, ta nɔlɔ ko sudi ko badabi ta mesa ɛ Okumu ba Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Ko na bea, bakina ibadi hadɛdi bato ba ngɔngɔ baimeabi bato ba boso ko bakina ibadi hadɛdi bato ba boso baimeabi bato ba ngɔngɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23, 37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ta ehole ena, Bafalusai bakina babatama na Yesu ko babala na nde boo: «Donga haa, kɛɛ dɔngɔ ikina, tina ɛ boo Elode apalaka aowoe.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Kɛɛni adjebedjɛni ebanga ona boo: “Nabenganaka miembo mibe ko nakokedjaka mosala ma oheledja bato ba bipeko busabu na puma, ko busa ba basato nasukedjalea elomu ɛ mbai.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Endolo eboani boo nakokedjae mɔndɔ ma mbai busabu, puma na puma sɛnɛ, tina ɛ eboani boo motɛli aowame oko ta Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Yelusalema, Yelusalema, wɛ ona okaowoe batɛli ko ona okaowoe na ndeke balomami ba Ndjambe! Mbala djeka napalaka boo naputoanedjae bana bawɛ mbuti na mbai, moda mokaputoanedjae kɔkɔ bana ba nde nase dja mapapulapu ma nde, endolo oipala! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Na bea, ndako ɛ bono esundolamalea. Nabali na nu: owetelea enɛnini koko mbunoko ta ehole ebalalea no boo: “Yɛɛ boo Ndjambe adjongoe ona odoi ta kombe ɛ Kumu!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔ epeko busa ba sabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Busa bomɔti ba sabata, Yesu akɛɛ ta ndako ɛ omɔti ɔ bakumu ba Bafalusai tina ɛ oyaka. Bato ibadaka ena batingea Yesu miso. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Moto omɔti ona ɔhuula mokuku na epeko adoa aema boso ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu abala ko ahɔdja bato ba edjebeli ɛ mobeko na bafalusai boo: «Mobeko ma boso modii opa enɔli kaoko pɛpɛ oheledja moto ta busa ba sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Endolo bapɔpɔnɔ. Bea Yesu abinga moto ɔ epeko, amoheledja ko amoyanedja. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Na bea abala na bu boo: «Ekada omɔti ɔ boono adii na mwana ɔ nde moomi kaoko ngɔmbɛ ona okwi ta mombɔndɔ, atamodubodja ambuku, noko ta busa ba sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Baidiha eka ɛ omosɔmbɛdja.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ohɔ edie ɛ sangɔngɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu aenɛkɛ bato iba beamaka ta tɛkɛ bahɔɔ bisika ba oda ba boso. Abala na bu indjɛ dii: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Ekada moto omɔti aobei ayaka ta tɛkɛ ɛ moki, pɛpɛ ohomba oda ta esika ɛ boso, ta bɔɔ ba boo moto onɔi wɛ na gala abeami koko ta tɛkɛ ena ɛ moki, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />ko ona obeini na yo na wɛ adoe abala na wɛ boo: “Mokinia yo esika hee.” Bea odalea na sɔni ta osɔmbɔ ada o sangɔngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Endolo, ekada boo baobei, kɛɛ adae o sangɔngɔ, tina ehole edoalea ona obei ta tɛkɛ, abala na wɛ boo: “Mopalani ɔ mbai, ihwea ta esika ɛ gala.” Edalea tina ɛ wɛ ekumu enɛnɛ boso ba bato ibadalea na wɛ ta mesa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Na bea, moto ona oodii osaihwedja atitedjamabi, ko ona oodii osatitedja aihwedjamabi.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abala na ona ɔmobea boo: «Ehole ebongedjai wɛ mia ma oyaka ma ndanda ɛ busa kaoko ma mokomoko, pɛpɛ obea bapalani ba wɛ, bana ba ngwao, bato ba ibota, badiheli iba mbuti na wɛ; ta bɔɔ ba boo basaka sɔmbedja mbea ɛ wɛ nabea edalea elengɛ iputi la bobo odii wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Endolo ekada boo oboanedjai mia ma tɛkɛ, bea bakwali, bitumbɛ, bato ba mitɛngu na bato ba miso mago. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Odalea na sepi, tina ɛ boo bahɔnetelea osɔmbɛdja. Ndjambe aosɔmbɛdjabi ta opusoama ba bato ba mikɔ mipele.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la tɛkɛ enɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 22:1-14">Mat 22, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ngɔngɔ dja ooka bibaeli bia, omɔti ɔ bato ibadaka ta mesa abala na Yesu boo: «Sepi odii ona oyakabi ta Okumu ba Ndjambe!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu abala na nde indjɛ dii: «Moto omɔti aboanedja tɛkɛ enɛnɛ ena ebea yo bato bike. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ta ehole ɛ mbuti na oyaka, aloma mobuli ɔ nde adjebedja bato ibabea yo boo: “Duani, tina ɛ bo hadɛdi mia madii mbuti.” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Endolo ibo basusu, omɔti na omɔti, asɛngɛ amoyɛɛ. Mobeami ɔ boso abala na mobuli boo: “Nasombi gue ko eboani boo nakɛɛ aye indja naongɔni boo ɔyɛɛni”. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Okina abala na nde boo: “Nasombi ngɔmbɛ doomi ko nakɛi abameka; naongɔɔni boo ɔyɛɛni.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Okina koko abala na nde boo: “Nahulake abala mwali ta tina hee, nitahɔnɔ odoa.” <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Oyana mobuli odii moswa nde amotɔndɔɔ misɔmbɛdja mia misusu. Moswa ndako alemoa ko abala na mobuli ɔ nde boo: “Kɛɛ pɛpɛlɛ ta bisika ba masanga ma bato bike ko ta ndjia dja ibonga, ko dua haa na bakwali, na bitumbɛ, na bato ba miso mago ko na bato ba mitɛngu.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ngɔngɔ dja ma ehole mokɛkɛ, mobuli ahula ko abala na moswa nde boo: “Moswa mbai, nakodjai elomu ɛ wɛ, endolo bisika ba bwase bidii oko.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Bea moswa ndako abala na mobuli ɔ nde boo: “Kɛɛ ta ndjia dja gue, ta mikpɛngo ma mapango, ko kama bato boo badoe bengɛ ndako ɛ mbai ɛlumɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Nabali na nu boo: pɛpɛ noko moto omɔti ɔ bia ibabeama oyakalea mia ma mbai!”»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olona misusu tina ɛ okimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10, 37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Bato bike badaka badale engbanga na Yesu. Ahombana ko abala na ibo basusu boo: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Ekada moto adoi odii mbai ko aloniti sango, nango, mwali ɔ nde, bana ba nde, banaanango bali na baami, ko noko na mohelo ma nde mɛɛnɛ ahɔniti oda motingami ɔ mbai. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Ona odii pɛpɛ olwa ekulusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea koko Luka 9,23.</char></note> ɛ nde tina ɛ okimanani atahɔnɔ oda motingami ɔ mbai. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Ekadaa boo moto adii na posa ɛ opika ndako eyai, adalea boso mɛɛnɛ tina ɛ odjeba motwuia mobungedjelea yo ko oenɛ kaoko adii na makondja tina ɛ obɛtɛ mosala. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Akaisa miboko pɛpɛ obɛtɛ mosala ma ndako ena, bato basusu ibaenɛbi boo esiti bamosɛkɛbi <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />bapela bala boo: “Hokeanike hoo ɔbanga opika ndako ko aihɔnɔ obɛtɛ mosala!” <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Moda momɔti, ekada boo kumu omɔti akɛi aonedja okina kumu, adalea boso tina ɛ oindja kaoko, na basoda koto doomi, aboani oona na ona odii na basoda koto tuku ibae. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Amiti hɔnɔ, alomalea bato odii kumu okina ena odii yo oko ohali tina ɛ ookana bɛngɛ badae na ogoo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Na bea, Yesu abakea boo, pɛpɛ moto oboani oda motingami ɔ mbai amiti sundola losusu lopeli yo.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mokwa mokasia ngɛngɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5, 13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mal 9, 50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />«Mokwa modii eka epele. Endolo ekada boo mosi ngɛngɛ ɛ mu, moda ndani moboani bo oyesɔmbɛdja? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Moditi mopele na ta tina ɛ mokpɔtɔ, na ta tina ɛ dusa; bamodumbalea osokolu. Ona odii na matoi maoka, aoke!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la bhata ɔbunga ko ɔboloa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18, 12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Baputedjɛli ba puti na bato ba gala ebe basabatea ibo basusu odii Yesu tina ɛ omooka. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bafalusai na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mobeko bakotoa Yesu ena babala boo: «Moto hoo adii oosɔ opele bato ba gala ebe na oyaka na bu esika emɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balondi ba Bayuda baenɛkɛ bato ba masumu ibayaka na Yesu elengɛ bato ba mbindo, na moto ona odi oyaka, omwa kaoko oda na bu esika emɔti.</char></note>!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Na bea Yesu abala na bu indjɛ dii boo: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Ekada boo moto omɔti ta ndanda ɛ boono adii na bhata mokama ko abungedjai omɔti ta ndanda ɛ bobo, akinetelea bia bakina tuku ibua na ibua ta eyakea ɛ bobo tina ɛ okɛ ta ihombi la ona obungi mbunoko akamobolodja? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Ko ehole emobolodjalea yo, asepalea obuke mɛɛnɛ: amobakei ta malokuloku ma nde, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />ayani odii yo, na bea abei baminande na bato bakadae mbuti na nde ko abali na bu boo: “Sepani na mbai tina ɛ boo nadihi bhata ɔ mbai, ona obungaki!” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Oko moda momɔti, nabali na nu boo, edabi na sepi enɛnɛ ta busa tina ɛ moto ɔ masumu omɔti ona ohekodjai moda onɔdja bato tuku iboa na iboa ba mikɔ mipele ibadii pɛpɛ posa ɛ ohekodja moda na osusu.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Falanga ɛɛbunga ko ɛboloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Kaoko mwali ndani ekada boo adii na falanga dja bibende doomi ko emɔti ebungi na nde, ayodjaetelea moinda, aombɔtelea ndako ko ahombetelea na molema motitake, mbunoko akayebolodja? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ko ta ehole eyebolodjai yo, abei baminande bali na bia iba mbuti na nde ko abali na bu boo: “Sepani na mbai, tina ɛ boo nadihi falanga ɛ mbai ɛ ebende ɛbungedjaka mbai!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Oko moda mua, nabali na nu, edii na sepi ta ndanda ɛ babwɛndi ba Ndjambe tina ɛ moto omɔti ɔ masumu ona obangi mohelo ma yeenie.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mwana ɔbunga ko ɔboloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu abali na ikina bo: «Moto omɔti adaka na bana ba nde baami babae. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />O yɛngɛ abali na sango boo: “Tata, pani la mbai ibondo la odiheli ba boso.” Bea sɛngɛmoto akaana leka la nde na bana bia ba nde baami babae. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ngɔngɔ dja maswi makɛkɛ, mwana o yɛngɛ atɛkɛ ibondo la odiheli ba nde ko akɛɛ na falanga dja nde ta ngando ɛ ohali. Oho, ahelama ta wusuwusu ko apundja leka losusu iladaka na nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ehole ɛ pundja yo odiheli ba nde bosusu, ndja enɛnɛ ekwa ta ngando ena, ko abanga otaka losusu iloboani na mohelo. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Asaimedja mosali ɔ moto omɔti ɔ ngando ena, ona omoloma ta gue dja nde tina ɛ obanea ngulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Adaka na posa ɛ osagoledja na mia imayaka ngulu, endolo pɛpɛ noko moto omɔti omopaka mo. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Na bea, abanga olɛdjana ta diko la mohelo ma nde ko asabalea boo: “Basali basusu ba tata badii na mapa mike, endolo mbai, haa, nagwaka na ndja! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Eboani boo nasɔmbɛ odii tata ko nabalalea na nde boo: Tata, nakɔmɛi Ndjambe obe ko na wɛ, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />naboaniti boo ɔbeeni mwana ɔ wɛ. Kɔɔ na mbai elengɛ omɔti ɔ basali ba wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ko asɔmbɔ odii sango.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Ena odaka yo oko ohali na ndako, sango omoenɛ ko aoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ: apeta ebango asaka na nde, asadumba ta dɔli la nde ko amobumea ehole eyai. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwana abala na nde boo: “Tata, nakɔmɛɛ Ndjambe obe ko na wɛ koko, naboaniti na ikina boo nabeame mwana ɔ wɛ…” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Endolo sango abali na basali ba nde boo: “Kɛɛni pɛpɛlɛ, doani na esendja enɔi na opele ko molwɛdjani yo; moisani mopɛtɛ ta mosapi ko sapato ta mako. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Doani na mwana ɔ ngɔmbɛ ɔ muta ko mo owani; lakɔe tɛkɛ ko lasepe, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />tina ɛ boo mwana hoo ɔ mbai oenɛkɛ no agwaka ko ahuli ta mohelo, abungaka ko na modihi.” Ko tɛkɛ ɛbanga.»<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Ta ehole ena, mwana ɔ nde ɔ sɔmi adaka ta gue. Ta ihule la nde, ehole ɛ batama yo mbuti na ndako, aoka kilingo ɛ midjiki ko na ngɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Abea omɔti ɔ basali ko amohɔdja modjɔ imodii onɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Mosali amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Mwangwao ahuli, ko sangwao aowodjai mwana ɔ ngɔmbɛ ɔ muta monɛnɛ, tina ɛ boo mwana ɔ nde ahuli na mokuku mopele.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Mwana ɔ sɔmi alemoa ko alona oingea ta ndako. Sango aimwana amoongɔɔnɔ boo aingee. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Endolo mwana asɔmbɛdja sango boo: “Hokamedjani, mbua banɛnɛ naosalea pɛpɛ obuka noko mobeko ma wɛ momɔti. Endolo, wɛ oipani noko mwana ɔ kambeli tina ɛ okɔ tɛkɛ na bamina mbai. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Endolo, ohuli mwana ɔ wɛ ona ɔpundja odiheli ba wɛ na bali ba ndumba, ta tina ɛ nde omowoi mwana ɔ ngɔmbɛ ɔ muta!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Sango amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Mwa mbai, odii na mbai maswi masusu haa, ko leka la mbai losusu lodii la wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Endolo eboanaki lakɔe tɛkɛ ko lasepe, tina ɛ boo mwangwao hoo oenɛkɛ wɛ adaka mogo ko ahuli ta mohelo, abungaka ko aboloi!”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mobanei ɔ leka ɔ kaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Moto omɔti modiheli adaka na mobanei ɔ leka la nde ko bato bike bamotɔndɔɔ boo apundjaka leka la nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Moswa leka amobea ko abala na nde boo: “Mɔdjɔ maokaka mbai diko la wɛ nda? Inedjani moda masala we mosala ma wɛ, tina ɛ boo owetelea daa koko mobanei ɔ leka la mbai.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Mobanei ɔ leka la nde asabelea yo mɛɛnɛ boo: “Moswa mbai, adoi adongedjani ta mosala. Ɔkɔkɔ mbai enao? Naditi na ngulu enɛnɛ tina ɛ olia gue ko nadalea na sɔni oimea moto ɔ esɛngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Nadjebi modjɔ mokolea mbai! Ko ta ehole ebungedjalea mbai esika ɛ mbai ɛ mosala, bato baosɔleani ta ndako dja bobo!” <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Na bea abea bato basusu ibadaka na nyongo dja moswa nde omɔti na omɔti. Abala na ɔ boso boo: “Odii na nyongo ɛ moswa mbai motwuia nda?” – <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Mimbonda ma minɛ mokama”. Mobanei ɔ leka abala na nde boo: “Hokea motwuia ma nyongo ɛ wɛ; daa haa pɛpɛlɛ; ko koma tuku itano.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Oko bea abali na okina boo: “Ko wɛ odii na nyongo motwuia nda?” Amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Ngɔtɔ dja mbuma dja elengɛɛ lɔso mokama”. Mobanei ɔ leka abali na nde boo: “Hokea nyongo ɛ wɛ; koma ngɔtɔ tuku mwambe.” <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Na bea, moswa leka asakoa mobanei ɔ leka ɔ owɛi bobe tina ɛ kaso ɛ nde ɛ obɔngedja midjɔ. Tina hee, bato ba ngondo hee badii na kaso ta ndanda ɛ bobo onɔdja bato ibadi bana ba ohuu.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu abakea boo: mbai nabali na nu, kɔɔni imbati na madiheli ma okosa ma ngondo hee, bɛngɛ boo ta ehole edimoabi mo tina ɛ boono baosɛni ta madie ma kɔbili. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Ona odii na isuma ta midjɔ mikɛkɛ, adii koko na isuma ta midjɔ minɛnɛ. Ona otaki isuma ta midjɔ mikɛkɛ ataki koko isuma ta midjɔ minɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ekadaa bea boo oditini na isuma diko la odiheli ba okosa ba ngondo hee, ona opabini madiheli ma sooti nda? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ko ekadaa boo otakini isuma ta obanea leka la bato bakina, ona oboani opani ila bono mɛɛnɛ nda? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Pɛpɛ mosali omɔti okoki osalea ba kumu babae: kaoko alonalea ɔ boso apalalea okina; kaoko akatanalea na ɔ boso kaoko aɛnɛlea okina ngasa. Otahɔnɔni osalea Ndjambe na ikondja koko.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bibaeli bikina ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mal 10, 11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Bafalusai, ibapalaka makondja, baokaka midjɔ mia misusu ko bataaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ino odini ibia basaenɛmɛdjaka bato ba mikɔ mipele ta miso ma bato, endolo Ndjambe adjebaka milema ma boono. Tina ɛ boo mua mokaenɛ bato modjɔ ma kito Ndjambe adii omoenɛ ngasa.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Mua imakomama ta mobeko ma Mose na buku dja Batɛli manɛngɛdja mbunoko Yoani Mobatisi. Donga ehole ena Mwako Mopele ma Okumu ba Ndjambe matɔndɔmɔ ko moto na moto akɔkɔ na ngulu bo aingee. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Busa na kpɔtɔ lohɔni odimoa na pɛpɛ embamba, endolo titi ikomi inɔi na okɛkɛ la Mobeko.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Ekadaa boo moto odongedjai mwali ɔ nde ko aosi okina akwi ta bɔɔli, ko ona oosi mwali odongedjami akwi koko ta bɔɔli.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la modiheli na Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Ɛdaka na moto omɔti modiheli ona olwaka bisendja ba yumu ko na motwuia monɛnɛ ko ona, engi busa, ayaaka opelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Edaka koko na moto okina ɔbiaka bo Ladjalo, mokwali, adaka asambi engi busa boso ba edipako ɛ ndako ɛ modiheli. Mokuku ma nde madaka molumake na pola. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Adaka na posa ɛ osagoledja na mbumbu dja mia idjakwaka ta nase dja mesa ɛ modiheli ehole ɛyaka yo. Noko na mva baduaka aombuta pola dja nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Mokwali agwa ko babwɛndi bakɛɛ na nde mbuti na Abalayama. Modiheli agwa koko ko bamopusea. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Anɔngɔmɔ obuke mɛɛnɛ ta ngondo ɛ bato bago; ɔngangodja yo miso, aɛnɛ ohali Abalayama ko Ladjalo mbuti na nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Na bea agama boo: “Tata Abalayama, okeani ndjokwa! Loma Ladjalo atupee sɔngɔ ɛ mosapi ma nde ta madiba tina ɛ otitimedjani elemi, tina ɛ boo naokaka saya enɛnɛ ɛ mosa muu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Abalayama amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Mwana ɔ mbai, lɛdjana mapele madiha wɛ ta ehole ɛdaka wɛ ta mohelo ma wɛ, endolo Ladjalo aenɛ saya enɛnɛ. Hadɛdi, Ladjalo ahemi, endolo wɛ odii ta saya. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Na onɔ, mombɔndɔ ma mbɛngɛ modii ta ndanda ɛ booso na nu; bea, bato ibapalaka openda donga haa odii so mbunoko oho odii no batahɔnɔ ko moto odii ono odii so atahɔnɔ noko osinɛ openda donga ono mbunoko ta esika edii wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Modiheli abala boo: “Naongɔɔni, tata, loma Ladjalo ta ndako ɛ tata, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />oho odii mbai na banainga baami batano. Akɛɛ abakebedja, bɛngɛ boo ibo koko basaka dua ta esika hee ɛ monɔngɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abalayama asɔmbɛdja boo: “Bana ba ngwao baami badii na Mose na Batɛli tina ɛ obakebedja: yɛɛ boo babaoke!” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Modiheli abala boo: “Pɛpɛ, eboaniti bea, tata Abalayama. Endolo ekadaa boo moto adongi odii ibagwa ko akɛi abatanea, bea basɔmbɔnɔtɔlea moda.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Endolo Abalayama amosɔmbɛdja boo: “Bamiti oka Mose na Batɛli, batadimea noko na mogo akapusoa.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Tin'ɛ mabaku</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18, 6-7</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mal 9, 42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Midjɔ ma okwedja moto ta masumu mitataka, endolo ndjokwa odii ona odii oko boo baminande bakwae ta masumu! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Enɔi na opele tina ɛ nde boo bamotingee mondeke monɛnɛ ta dɔli ko bamomae ta ibeke ilinɔi na onɛnɛ, ta esika ɛ boo akwedjae ta isumu omɔti ɔ bii ibakɛkɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Angatanani ta eloke ɛ boono mɛɛnɛ!</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 17:3">Oyɛɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 17:3">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18, 15</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Ekadaa mwangwao moomi akaokɔmɛɛ modjɔ mobe, mopɛlɛ na ngulu mɛɛnɛ. Ko ekada boo asapɛli ta ibunga la nde, moyɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ekadaa boo aokɔmei obe mbala saambo ta busa bomɔti ko engi mbala adoi abala na wɛ boo: “Naokɔmɛi obe”, omoyɛlea.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edhimeli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 17:19-20">Mat 17, 19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Busa bomɔti Bapotele babala na Kumu boo: «Kandodja edhimeli ɛ boso!» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Kumu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ekada bo odini na edhimeli elengɛ mombuma ma sinapi, obalaleani na mole mu boo: “Sabikoa ko kɛɛ asaone ta ibeke ilinoi na onɛnɛ”, ko mo osumalea.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elomu ɛ mosali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />«Ekadaa boo: omɔti ta ndanda ɛ boono adii na mosali ona okaone kaoko ona okabanee meela ma bingbɛndɛ. Akamoɛnɛ ahule ta gue, abalalea na nde boo: “Dua pɛpɛlɛ adae ta mesa?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Titi bea, abalalea na nde wɛte boo: “Bongɛdja mia ma mbai, ngɔngɔ djia sɔmbɔtɔnɔ bisendja ko dua abɔngedjae mesa tina ɛ mbai; ehole esidjalea mbai oya, wɛ koko, oyalea ko omwalea.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Aboaniti osɔmbɛdja misakoa odii mosali ɔ nde tina ɛ boo akokedjai imamohɔdja yo boo akɔe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Edii oko moda momɔti tina ɛ boono: ehole ekokedjalea no misusu imihɔdjami odii no, balani boo: “Lodii basali ba pɛpɛ gala; lokokedjai oko elomu ɛ booso.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai bato ba mabha doomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ta mwɛngo ma nde ta dɔngɔ la Yelusalema, Yesu anɔɔ ta mokpɛngɔ ma si Samalia na Galilai. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ehole ɛingea yo ta ngando emɔti bato ba mabha doomi badua asaka na nde. Baema ohali <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ko babanga ogama na ngulu boo: «Yesu, Molehi, lookea ndjokwa!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesu abaenɛ ko abala na bu boo: «Kɛɛni asainedjeni odii banganga ba Ndjambe.» Oko ta ehole ɛdaka bo bakɛɛ, basɛnɔdjama na mabha ma bobo. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Omɔti ta ndanda ɛ bobo, oenɛ yo boo aheli, asɔmbɔ ngɔngɔ ena asakoe Ndjambe na moholi diko. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Akwa magunda ta mako ma Yesu, mbanda esuni ta kpɔtɔ, ko amosakoa. Ena bea moto ona adaka Mosamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Bea Yesu abala na nde boo: «Bato ba mabha doomi basɛnɔdjamiti? Bakina ibwa bado? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Pɛpɛ noko moto omɔti osɔmbi asakoa Ndjambe? Omisɔmbɔ oko mokɛndɛli hoo?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Bea Yesu abala na nde: «Emaa ko kɛɛ; edhimeli ɛ wɛ eoheledjai.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odoa ba Okumu ba Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24, 23-28</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Busa bomɔti Bafalisai bahɔdja Yesu ehole ndani eduabi Okumu ba Ndjambe. Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Okumu ba Ndjambe botadoa na bimbete ba oenɛmɛ ohuu. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Babaletebi boo: “Hokea, bodii haa!” kaoko boo: “Bodii boo!” Tina ɛ boo, djebani, Okumu ba Ndjambe bodii ta ndanda ɛ boono.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Na bea abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Maswi maduake odabini na posa ɛ oenɛ noko iswi imɔti la Mwana ɔ moto, endolo olienɛtebini. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Babalabi na nu boo: “Hokeani boo!” kaoko boo: “Hokeani haa!” Endolo pɛpɛ okɛni, pɛpɛ opetani. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Elengɛ mokaikai okangɛngɛ mo ta ehole ekakatise mo dɔngɔ na dɔngɔ la busa, edabi moda mua ta maswi ma Mwana ɔ moto. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Endolo eboani boso mɛɛnɛ boo aoke saya enɛnɛ ko adumbame na yangola hee. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Moda imanɔmɔ ta ehole ɛ Noa monɔmɔbi oko moda mua ta maswi ma Mwana ɔ moto. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Ta ehole ena bato bayaaka ko bamwaka, baosɔnɔkɔ ko babaledjaka bana ba bobo mbunoko busa ibaingea Noa ta masua: na bea pela enɛnɛ edoa ko ɛ baowa ibo basusu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Edabi oko bea elengɛ ta ehole ɛ Lɔtɔ: bato bayaaka ko bamwaaka, basombaka ko batɛkɛkɛ, baonaka gue ko bapikaka ndako; <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />endolo busa ibakina Lɔtɔ, Sɔdɔmɔ, mbua ɔ mosa ko ɔ sufele akwa donga busa ona ɔbaowa ibo basusu. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Edabi moda momɔti ta busa iboenɛmɛbi Mwana ɔ moto.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Ta busa bua, ona odabi ta yoka ko odabi na leka la nde otei ba ndako ɛ nde, ataingea alotomba! Moda momɔti, odii ona odabi ta gue ɛ nde, atasɔmbɔ ta ndako ɛ nde! <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Lɛdjani mua imakɔmɔ na mwali ɔ Lɔtɔ! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Moto ona oohombabi abanee mohelo ma nde amobungedjabi, endolo ona oobungedjabi mohelo ma nde, amobaneabi. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nabali na nu ohuu boo, ta bulu bua, bato babae badabi basambi ta bwako bomɔti: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bali babae badabi bainda ndɔngɔ esika emɔti: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Baami babae badabi ta gue, omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi.]» <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Batingami bamohɔdja boo: «Kumu, mua onɔbi mo hɔ?» Ko asɔmbɛjda boo: «Esika edabi ndjemba, edii oko ena esika ebolamabi popo.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la djudji na mwali ɔgwedja momi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu abala na bu indjɛ dii tina ɛ obainedja boo eboani oongɔɔnɔ bihole bisusu na pɛpɛ oembɛ: <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />«Ɛdaka ta ibonga imɔti na djudji ɔ pɛpɛ obanga Ndjambe ko ailɛkɛ noko moto omɔti. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ɛdaka koko ena ta ibonga dia mwali ɔgwedja moomi ona oduaka bihole bisusu abala na nde boo: “Longedjani na ikambo odii moto ɔdihana na mbai!” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ehole eyai, djudji alona. Bea asabalea boo: “Sooti, tebange Ndjambe ko telɛɛ moto noko omɔti; <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />endolo ta elɔkɛ mwali hoo ɔgwedja momi aembɛdjɛni: namolongedjalea na ikambo, tina ɛ boo asaka sekoa atungeani.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Bea Kumu abakea boo: «Okani moda mabala djudji mobe! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ko Ndjambe alongedjaetelea bato ibahɔɔ yo ibadii omoongɔɔnɔ na ingbanbga bulu na moi? Ayeyoalea pɛpɛ obakɔmɛdja? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nabali na nu ohuu boo: Abalongedjalea pɛpɛlɛ mɛɛnɛ. Endolo Mwana ɔ moto akadoabi, ataneabi edhimeli ta ngondo?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mofalusai na moputedjɛli ɔ puti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu abala naikina indjɛ dii tina ɛ oinedja odii bia ibalɛdjaka boo bakɔkɔ olulea ba Ndjambe ko batitedjaka bakina: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Ɛdaka na «Bato babae bakɛɛ ta tepelo tina ɛ oongɔɔnɔ; omɔti adaka mofalusai, okina moputedjɛli ɔ puti. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mofalusai, aema diko, aongɔɔnɔkɔ bea ta tei ɛ nde mɛɛnɛ boo: “Ndjambe, ɔ mbai, naopi misakoa tina ɛ boo naditi elengɛ bia bakina basusu, ibadii baibi, bato bataka ɛ odjoo na bɔɔli; naopi misakoa tina ɛ boo naditi elengɛ moputedjeli hoo ɔ puti. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nakasabekee maswi mabae engi pɔsɛ ko nakaope ibondo la doomi la madiheli ma mbai masusu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Moputedjeli ɔ puti, yo, aemaa ohali ko aihɔnɔ noko ongangodja miso o diko, endolo abakea mabo ta bupa ko abalaka boo: “Ndjambe ɔ mbai, okeani ndjokwa nadii moto ɔ masumu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yesu abakea boo, nabali na nu, moto ona aenɛmɛ molongi ta miso ma Ndjambe ehole ɛyana yo ta ndako ɛ nde, endolo titi Mofalusai. Na tina hee, ona ɔsangangodjaka, atitedjamabi, endolo ona osatitedjaka, angangodjamabi.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjongoi bana bakɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mal 10, 13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bato badua na bana bakɛkɛ odii Yesu bo ababakee mabɔ. Batingami ba nde ɔenɛ bo bea, babanga obasia. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Endolo Yesu abea biɛngɛ ko abala boo: «Kinani bana bakɛkɛ badoe odii mbai! Pɛpɛ obasiani, tina ɛ boo Okumu ba Ndjambe bodii tina ɛ bia ibadi elengɛ ibo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nabali na nu sooti boo: Moto ona odii pɛpɛ oosɔ Okumu ba Ndjambe elengɛ mwana mokɛkɛ, aingietebi ena.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na modiheli</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mal 10, 17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Kumu omɔti ɔ Bayuda ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Molehi mopele, eboani mbai okɔ tina ɛ odiha mohelo ma seko ye?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Tina ndani obeakani mopele? Moto mopele aditi dongedja oko Ndjambe yo buki. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Odjebi mibeko: “Pɛpɛ okwa na bɔɔli, pɛpɛ owa moto; pɛpɛ oiba; pɛpɛ oda na tati ebe, suma sangwao na ngwao.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Moto ona amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Naakokedja mibeko mia misusu donga bwɛngɛ ba mbai.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ɔoka Yesu bea, abala na nde boo: «Otaki modjɔ momɔti: tɛkɛ leka losusu lodii na wɛ ko kaana falanga odii bakwali, ko odalea na madiheli o diko; ngɔngɔ dua ko kimanani.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Endolo ehole ɛoka yo bibaeli bia, aimea na ndjokwa enɛnɛ mɛɛnɛ, tina ɛ boo adaka modiheli monɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Ɔenɛmɛ yo na ndjokwa, Yesu abala boo: «Edii opipo tina ɛ badiheli oingea ta Okumu ba Ndjambe! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Edii opipo tina ɛ kamela oingea ta iposi la tonga endolo enoi na opipo tina ɛ modiheli oingea ta Okumu ba Ndjambe.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Bato ibamookaka babala boo: «Ekada bea, ona ohɔni ohela nda?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Modjɔ modii bato pɛpɛ ohɔnɔ okokedja Ndjambe adii omokokedja.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Bea Piɛlɛ abala boo: «Hokamedja, iso lakina leka la boso losusu tina ɛ okimana wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Nabali na nu sooti: ekada boo moto akini, tina ɛ Okumu ba Ndjambe, ndako ɛ nde, mwali ɔ nde, bananango, baboti ba nde na bana ba nde, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />adihalea obuke onɔ donga hadɛdi, ko ta ngondo ɛduake, adihabi mohelo ma seko.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai mbala ɛ basato ogwa na opusoama ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mal 10, 32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu atomba batingami doomi na babae mbuti na nde ko abala na bu boo: «Hokamedjani, lakɛɛni ta Yelusalema oho midjɔ misusu makoma batɛli ta tina ɛ Mwana ɔ moto mikokedjamalea. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Tina ɛ boo akabamalea ta mabɔ ma bato iba pɛpɛ odjeba Ndjambe, bamosɛkɛlea, bamosingalea ko bamotɔlea masɔi. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bamobomalea pimbo ko bamowalea. Ko ta iswi la basato, apuswualea ta ogwa.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Endolo batingami baisipoa modjɔ mua; tingo ɛ kɔpɛ djia ɛbombama odii bo ko baisipoa eka ndani ɛbalaka Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔ miso mago ta Yeliko</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mal 10, 46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Ena ɔbatama Yesu na Yeliko, moto ɔ miso mago adaka adii ta mokpɛngɔ ma ndjia ko asɛngɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Aoka kilingo ɛ bato bike ibadaka banoe ko ahɔdja bato boo: muu modjɔ nda. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii Yesu ɔ Nasaleta iyona ɔnɔke.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Bea agama boo: «Yesu, Mwana ɔ Davidi, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Bato ibadalaka boso ba Yesu bamopɛlɛ bɛngɛ akine ogama, endolo agama onɔ: «Mwana ɔ Davidi, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu aema ko apa enɔli boo badoe na nde. Ehole ebatama moto ɔ miso mago mbuti na nde, Yesu a mohɔdja boo: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Ɛpalaka wɛ nakɔe tina ɛ wɛ yee?» Asɔmbɛjda boo: «Kumu, kɔɔ boo naenɛ koko.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ko Yesu abala na nde boo: «Enɛ naikina! Edhimeli ɛ wɛ eoheledjai.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Ambuku, aenɛ, ko atingama na Yesu ena akumedjae Ndjambe. Bato basusu ibaenɛ modjɔ mua basakoa Ndjambe.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Djakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Ɔingea Yesu ta Yeliko, ko akatisa ibonga. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Moto omɔti adaka ena ɔ kombe ɛ Djakayo; adaka kumu ɔ baputedjɛli ba puti ko adaka modiheli. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ahombaka aenɛ Yesu, endolo ta tina ɛ bato bike aihɔnɔ omoenɛ, tina ɛ boo adaka mokuhe. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Bea apeta boso ko aihwea ta mole ma kombe ɛ sikomɔlɔ, bɛngɛ boo aenɛ Yesu ona oboanaka onɔ ena. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ehole eimea Yesu ta esika ena, aihwedja miso o diko ko abala na Djakayo boo: «Tita pɛpɛlɛ, Djakayo, tina ɛ boo eboani nahwɛɛ ta ndako ɛ wɛ busabu.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Djakayo atita pɛpɛlɛ ko amosɔ na sepi. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Ɔenɛ bo modjɔ mua, ibo basusu batuka Yesu; babala boo: «Moto hoo akɛi ahwɛɛ odii moto ɔ masumu!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Endolo Djakayo, aema diko boso ba Kumu, abala na nde boo: «Hokamedja, Kumu, napalea ekenge ɛ odiheli ba mbai odii bakwali, ko ekada bo nakatoa eka ndani odii moto, namosɔmbɛdjalea yo mbala inei.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Busabu, mohelo modoi ta ndako hee, tina ɛ boo Djakayo koko adii ɔ mbota ɛ Abalayama! <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Tina ɛ boo Mwana ɔ moto adoa ahomba ko aheledja bia ibabunga.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la pata dja wolo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25, 14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Ehole edaka bato bia bamooka Yesu abala koko ikina indjɛ tina ɛ adaka mbuti na Yelusalema ko bato balɛdjaka boo Okumu ba Ndjambe boenɛmɛlɛa oko ta ehole ena. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Na bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Moto omɔti ɔ ibota la ekumu akɛɛ ta ngando ɛ ohali bɛngɛ bamoimedjae kumu; ngɔngɔ djia ahule. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Boso ba okɛ, abea basali ba nde doomi, apa engi moto ikondja inɛnɛ ko abala na bu boo: “Kɔɔni mombongu na ikondja dii mbunoko ta ihule la mbai.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Endolo bato ba ngando ɛ nde bamokea swɛ; baloma bato bakina ngɔngɔ dja nde tina ɛ obala na nde boo: “Loloni boo adae kumu ɔ booso.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Noko bea bamoimedja kumu ko ahula ta ngando ɛ nde. Na bea abea basali ibapa yo ikondja, tina ɛ odjeba eka ɛbakea boo. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ɔ boso adoa ko abala boo: “Kumu, nabakea doomi diko la ikondja lapani wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Abala na nde boo: “Edii opele, odii mosali mopele; tina ɛ boo odaki na sooti ta midjɔ mikɛkɛ, naomedjalea gupunɛlɛ ɔ mabonga doomi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Mosali ɔ babae adua ko abala boo: “Kumu, nabakea itano diko la ikondja lapani wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Kumu abala na nde boo: “Wɛ, naoimedjalea gupunɛlɛ ɔ mabonga matano.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Okina adoa ko abala boo: “Kumu, hokea ikondja la wɛ; nalibomba ta esendja. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nadaka na bɔɔ ba wɛ, tina ɛ boo odii moto ɔ mongangale: okatombe leka ilodii pɛpɛ oda la wɛ, okabuke ta esika edii wɛ pɛpɛ oona.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Kumu abala na nde boo: “Mosali mobe, mbai naosambedjalea okimana na bibaeli ba wɛ. Ɔdjebaka boo nadii moto ɔ mongangale, nakatombe leka lodii pɛpɛ oda la mbai ko nakabuke ta esika edii mbai pɛpɛ oona. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Bea, tina ɛdaa na wɛ pɛpɛ oisa ikondja la mbai ta ndako ekabombebo makondja nda? Ta ihule la mbai, ikɔki bakeani ikondja ikina diko.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ngɔngɔ djia abala na ibadaka ena boo: “Mokatoani ikondja dia ko lipani odii ona odii na doomi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Babala na nde boo: “Kumu, yo adii na doomi ehele!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />“Nabalaka na nu boo, bapalea onɔ odii ona opeli, endolo ona odii pɛpɛ eka, bamokatoalea noko ena epeli yo. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ta tina ɛ bia ibalona boo nadae kumu ɔ bobo, duani na bu haa ko baowani boso ba mbai.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aingei ta Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Mal 11, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ɔsidja Yesu obala bea, adala boso ba bato tina ɛ okɛ ta Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ehole ɛbatama yo na Betefadje ko na Betania, mbuti na ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive, aloma batingami ba nde babae: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Abala na bu boo: «Kɛɛni oho ta ngando ena edii o boso. Ehole eimealeano ena, otanealeani mwana ɔ punda atingi, ona odii pɛpɛ moto obakama. Motingoani ko doani na nde ha. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ekada moto akaohɔdjani bo: “Tin'ɛmotingoaka na nu nda?”, balani na nde bo: “Kumu akambaka na nde.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bato ibaloma yo bakɛɛ ko batanea midjɔ misusu oko moda mamayo bala. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ta ehole ɛdakabo bamotingoa, baswa nde babala na bu boo: «Otingoakani mwana ɔ punda tina nda?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Babasɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu akambaka na nde.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ngɔngɔ djia, bakɛɛ na nde odii Yesu; bamobakea bisendja ba bobo ko badedja Yesu diko la nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ehole ɛdaka yo adale, bato baondeaka bisendja ba bobo ta ndjia.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Ɔbatama yo na Yelusalema, ta ndjia ena etitaka ta ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive, emumu ɛ batingami ba nde ɛluma na sepi, ɛbanga okumedja Ndjambe na kopɛ epipo tina ɛ midjɔ ma okamwa imaenɛkɛ bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Babalaka boo: «Yɛɛ boo Ndjambe adjongoe kumu ona oodoi ta kombe ɛ nde! Bogoo ta busa ko ekumu odii Ndjambe!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Bakina Bafalusai, ibadaka ta ndanda ɛ bato bia bikɛ, babala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, sia batingami ba wɛ badae ogoo.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu asɔmbɛjda boo: «Nabalaka na nu ohuu boo noko bakadaa ogoo, ndeke djigamalea!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei diko la Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ehole ɛimea Yesu mbuti na ibonga la Yelusalema ko alieni, ayea diko la lu, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />ko abala boo: «Ekadaa boo ɔdjebaki midjɔ mikapɛ ogoo! Endolo hadɛdi, midii mibombamake ta miso ma wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Tina ɛ boo maswi maduake, baloni ba wɛ baohikabi na bitutuku bipipo tina ɛ oona na wɛ bila ko baoswɛtɛmedjabi mɔɔngɔ masusu. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Baobedjabi na osusu, wɛ na bato ba wɛ; baokineetebi noko mondeke momɔti diko la mokina, tina ɛ bo ɔidjeba ehole ɛdoa Ndjambe aokɔmɛdja!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abengani bato ba mimbongu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mal 11, 15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesu aingea ta tepelo ko abanga obengana bato ba mimbongu. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Abala na bu boo: «Ta Makomi Masɛnɔke, Ndjambe abala ohuu boo: “Ndako ɛ mbai edabi esika ɛ miɔngɔɔnɔ.” Ekahia ino, oyeimedjaini esika ɛ baibi!»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu alehaka maswi masusu ta tepelo. Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe, bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na bakumu ba bato ba ngando, bahombaka boo bamowoe. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Endolo baidiha ndjia ɛ omowa, tina ɛ boo bato basusu badaka baoka Yesu na posa enɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kpati ɛ Yesu ɔdonga yo odi nda?</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mal 11, 27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu adaka aleha ta tepelo ko atɔndɔkɔ Mwako Mopele odii bato. Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko badua engbanga na basuku, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />ko bamohɔdja boo: «Lodjebedja kpati ɛkɔkɔ na wɛ midjɔ mia, moto ɔɔpa kpati ena nda?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Mbai ko nadii ohɔdjani. Djebedjanini: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />ona ɔloma Yoani abatisa nda? Edii Ndjambe kaoko bato?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Endolo basabaleana ko badimana boo: «Lokamosɔmbɛdja boo: “Edii Ndjambe moto ɔmoloma”, alohɔdjalea boo: “Ɔidhimeani Yoani tina nda?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Endolo lokabala boo: “Edii nde bato bamoloma”, bato basusu balolalea ndeke boo balowoe, tina ɛ boo bato basusu badjebaka boo Yoani adaka motɛli.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Iso lotadjeba esika ɛhula yo.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Mbai koko, nataodjebedjani na kpati ɛ ndani nakɔkɔ midjɔ mia.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indjɛ la basali babe ba gue ɛ vino</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mal 12, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu abala na bato indjɛ dii: «Moto omɔti aona gue ɛ vino, ayekina ta mabɔ ma basali ko akɛɛ mwɛngɔ ma ehole eyai. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ɔimea ehole ɛ obuka mbuma, aloma mosali odii basali ba gue ɛ vino boo bamopɛ lande ibondo la mbuma. Endolo basali ba gue baboma mosali ona ko bamoyanedja mabɔ ngasa. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Moswa gue aloma koko mosali okina, endolo basali ba gue bamoboma, bamosinga ko bamoyanedja mabɔ ngasa. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Moswa gue aloma mosali ɔ basato; yo koko, bamobenedja ko bamodumba o sokolu ɛ gue. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Moswa gue abali boo: “Nakɔe hadɛdi enao? Nadii oloma mwana ɔ mbai moomi okapale mbai; ehole ekina bamosumalea.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Endolo ehole ɛ moenɛ basali ba gue, basabaleana ibo mɛɛnɛ boo: “Hokeani mosangoli ɔ nde iyona. Lamowoeni, bɛngɛ boo gue ɛ vino ɛdikae ɛ boso.” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Bamodumba o sokolu ɛ gue ɛ vino ko bamowa.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Na bea, Yesu abahɔdja bo, ebakɔlea moswa gue ɛ vino? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Aduabi, aowabi basali bia, ko apabi gue ena ɛ vino odi bato bakina.» Ehole ɛoka bato bibaeli bia, babala bo: «Modjɔ mondumba mua motakɔmɔ nyɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Endolo Yesu abahokea ko abala boo: «Ɛtingodja ebaeli hee ɛ Makomi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Mondeke imadumba bayoli ba ndako</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">maimea ikwee la ndonga”?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Ona okwabi diko la mondeke mua abukeabi ko ekada bo mondeke mua mokwi ta diko la moto, aminianabi mbunoko oimea mbumbu.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Puti ɛ oputa odii Kaisala</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mal 12, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na ba kumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe bahombaka ndjia ɛ opea Yesu oko ta ehole ena, tina ɛ badjebaka bo abalaka indjɛ dia tina ɛ bobo; endolo badaka na bɔɔ ba bato. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Donga ehole ena babanga okeba na Yesu. Na tina hee, bamolomea banɔngi ibaenɛmɛkɛ elengɛ bato ibaboani bo osuma, bɛngɛ boo bamodihe na ibunga okimana na mibalo ma nde mɛɛnɛ boo bamokabe ta kpati na okumu ba gupunɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bamohɔdja ihɔdja dii: «Molehi, lodjebi boo midjɔ mikabale wɛ na mikalehe wɛ midii mipele; tohokee mbanda dja bato, endolo okalehe midjɔ ma sooti imikasepedjae Ndjambe. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Na bea, lodjebedja: eboani na su kaoko pɛpɛ oputa puti odii Kaisala?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Endolo Yesu ɔsipoa yo owɛi bobe ba bobo, abala nabu boo: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Inedjanini falanga emɔti. Mbanda kaoko kombe ikomami diko dja falanga djidi dja nda?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Dja Kaisala!» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Na bea Yesu abala boo: «Ekada bea putani odii Kaisala mua imahodjaka yo, ko odii Ndjambe moda momɔti.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Baihɔnɔ omodiha na ibunga ta bibaeli bande. Endolo, baluma na okamoa na esɔmbɛdjeli ɛ nde ko bada ogoo.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdja diko la opusoama</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mal 12, 18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Ekenge ɛ Basadukai badua mbuti na Yesu. – Ibo tebadhime opusoama ba bato bago. – Bamohɔdja <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />moda muu boo: «Molehi, Mose alokinea mobeko mua imakomama boo: “Ekada momi ona oobali mwali agwi pɛpɛ obota, eboani boo mwanango abale mwali okini yo bɛngɛ boo amodihee mbota.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Na bea ɛdaka na bana bami saambo ba ibota imɔti. Ɔboso aosɔ mwali ko agwa pɛpɛ obota na nde. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Ɔbabae aosɔ mwali ona ɔɔgwa na moomi ko agwa pɛpɛ mwana, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />ɔbasato moda momɔti. Ibo basusu saambo, bagwa pɛpɛ okina bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ta suka, mwali agwa koko. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Ekada bea, ta iswi la opusoama la bago, mwali ona adabi ɔ nda? Tina ɛ bo ibo basusu saambo badaka baami ba nde!» <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Haa ta ngondo hee bali na baami badii oosɔnɔ; <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />endolo bato ba odjoo ibaeni Ndjambe boo babɔngi opusoama ta ndanda ɛ bago ko ohela ta ngondo ena eduake tebaosɔne. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bahɔniti naikina ogwa, badii elengɛ babwɛndi. Badii bana ba Ndjambe, tina ɛ boo baapusoama. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Mose ainedja ohuu boo bago bapusoabi, ta isolo la mole imadaka mayoa, abea Kumu “Ndjambe ɔ Abalayama, Ndjambe ɔ Isaka ko Ndjambe ɔ Yakobo.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yesu abakea boo: Ndjambe adi Ndjambe ɔ bato ba mohelo, titi ɔ bago, tina ɛ bo odii yo bato basusu badii na mohelo.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko babala nande boo: «Molehi, obali opele.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ko baiwa hɔnɔ omohɔdja koko mahɔdja makina.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya na Davidi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mal 12, 35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu abala nabu boo: «Moda ndani baboani obala boo Masiya adi moto ɔ mbota ɛ Davidi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Tina ɛ boo Davidi abala yo mɛɛnɛ ta buku ɛ Biembo boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Ndjambe abala na Kumu ɔ mbai boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Daa ta ebɔ ɛ mbai ɛ baami,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mbunoko ehole elongealea mbai baloni ba wɛ boo badae ebakeli ɛ wɛ ɛ mako.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Na bea Davidi abea Masiya “Kumu” : Moda ndani Masiya ahɔni koko oda ta mbota ɛ Davidi?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akebedjai bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mal 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ehole ɛdaka bato basusu bamohokamedja, Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Kebani na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko ibakasepe odala na mikoto miyai ma motwuia ko ibakapale ndese dja ekumu ta bisika biboli bato; bakahombe bidie ba boso ta ndako dja miongɔnɔ ma Bayuda ko bisika ba ekumu ta tɛkɛ inɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bakakatoe bali ibagwa na baami leka la bobo losusu ko, oko ta ehole ena, bakaongɔɔne miɔngɔɔnɔ miyai bɛngɛ babale boo bakadjebe Ndjambe. Basambedjamabi na opipo mɛɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Epeeli ɛ mwali ɔgwa na momi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mal 12, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Ta tepelo, Yesu ahokeaka na okeba bosusu dɔngɔ na dɔngɔ la nde ko aenɛ badiheli ibadaka baisa bipeeli ta esika eboanedjamaka tina ɛ bu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Aenɛ koko mwali ɔgwa na momi ona ɔdaka mokwali aiisa falanga ibae dja pɛpɛ motwuia monɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Na bea Yesu abala boo: «Nabalaka na nu sooti: mwali ho mokwali ɔɔgwa na moomi api onɔdja bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Tina ɛ boo bato basusu bapi falanga idaki na bu pɛpɛ oda na tina na dju, endolo ta okwali ba nde, api falanga dja nde isusu ibɔngɔki na nde ohela.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai obeedjama ba tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mal 13, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bato bakina babalaka tina ɛ tepelo na moda mayepika bo na ndeke dja omwenga ko na bipeeli ibapama odii Ndjambe. Endolo Yesu abala na bu boo: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Maswi maduake pɛpɛ noko mondeke momɔti modikabi mobaki diko la mokina moda maenɛkɛ no; esusu ebukeanabi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Midjɔ imienɛmɛbi boso ba suka ɛ ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mal 13, 3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Na bea bamohɔdja boo: «Molehi, lodjebedja ehole ndani ekokedjamabi mo? Embete ndani eloinedjabi midjɔ mia?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Kebani, pɛpɛ odimani bo ɔkoseameni. Tina ɛ boo bato bike baduabi na kombe ɛ mbai ko babalabi boo: “Iso Masiya!” ko: “Ehole eimei!” Pɛpɛ obakimanani. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Ehole eokabi no ngilimo dja bila na dja bato otɔmbɔ, pɛpɛ obangani; eboani boso bo midjɔ mia makokedjame, endolo ena editi bo suka eimei ta mbuku.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu abakea boo: «Mbota emɔti eonedjabi mbota ekina, ko ekumu emɔti eonedjabi ekumu ekina; <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />mikumano mipipo ma kpɔtɔ ko, ta bikenge ba ngondo otikoana, makeli manɛnɛ ko na bigo ba moyao; edabi koko na midjɔ ma bɔɔ ko bimbete ba okamoa bidongabi ta busa.»<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inyɔkɔli, embete ɛ motwuia</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 10:17-22">Mat 10, 17-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:9-12">Mal 13, 9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />«Endolo boso ba mia misusu, baopeabini, baonɔngedjabini, baokababini tina ɛ osambedjama ta ndako dja miongɔnɔ ma Bayuda ko baomabini ta bɔlɔkɔ; baosambedjabini boso ba bakumu na ba gupunɛlɛ ta tina ɛ kombe ɛ mbai. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Edalea odii no ehole ɛ obala sooti diko la mbai. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Pɛpɛ osatungeani ta moda moboani no osamba. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Tina ɛ boo mbai mɛnɛ naopabini bibaeli ko na owɛi ba boo pɛpɛ omɔti ɔ baloni ba boono oboani ohɔnɔ oema kaoko ohekodja bibaeli ba boono. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Okabamabini noko na baboti ba boono, basangwanu, bangwanu, banangwanu, mbota ko na badjebaneli ba boono; bamaabi bike ta bɔlɔkɔ mbunoko ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Olonamabini na bato basusu tina ɛ mbai. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Endolo obungedjaetebini noko moswee momɔti ma molo ma boono. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Dani na ingbangba: na moda mua oheledjabini miembo ma boono.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai obedjama ba Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24, 15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mal 13, 14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Na bea Yesu abali boo: «Ehole enɛbi no Yelusalema ehikami na bibole ba basoda, djebani boo, obeha ba yu boimei mbuti. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Na bea, bia ibadabi ta Yuda batiabi dɔngɔ la ngomba; bia ibadabi otei ba Yelusalema basasuabi, ko bia ibadabi ta gue basɔmbetebi ta ibonga. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Tina ɛ boo edabi maswi ma esambi, tina ɛ okokedja mia misusu imabalaka Makomi ohuu. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Ndjokwa ndani edabi ta maswi mia, tina ɛ bali ba meemi ko tina ɛ bia ibanungeabi bana! Tina ɛ boo saya enɛnɛ edabi ta ngando ko kɛlɛ ɛ Ndjambe enɛmɛbi odii bato bia. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Baowamabi na mopata, bakebi ibuli ta mabota masusu ma ngondo ko bapagano baminakakabi Yelusalema na mako mbunoko ta onɔ ba ehole ɛpama na bu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Odua ba Mwana ɔ moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mal 13, 24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Bea Yesu abala boo: «Bimbete bienɛmɛbi ta diso la busa, ta songe na ta ndjɔtɔ. Ta kpɔtɔ, mabota makɛsɛlɛbi obuke, masatungeabi tina ɛ kilingo epipo mɛnɛ ɛ ibeke ilinɔi na onɛnɛ ko na dja mula. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bato bagwabi na bɔɔ bakalɛdjana midjɔ mikɔmɔbi ta ngondo esusu, tina ɛ boo ngulu dja busa ikumanabi.<verse eid="LUK 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Bea baenɛbi Mwana ɔ moto odua diko la itute, na ngulu enɛnɛ ko na ekumu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ehole ebangabi midjɔ mia okɔmɔ, emani odjoo ko ngangodjani melo ma bono, tina ɛ boo ehole ɛ isiko la boono edabi mbuti.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obatama ba okumu ba Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mal 13, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu abala na bu indjɛ dii boo: «Hokeani mole ma figi ko mele mikina misusu: <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />ehole eeni no kasa dja tɛtɛli oimana ta bitape ba mele, odjebeni boo edidi epele ebatami. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Oko moda mua, ehole eenɛbi no midjɔ mia mikokedjami, djebani boo okumu ba Ndjambe bobatami. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Nabali na nu sooti: bato ba yangola hee bagwɛtebi ibo basusu boso ba okokedjama ba midjɔ mia misusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Busa na kpɔtɔ idimoabi, endolo bibaeli ba mbai bitadimoa noko osinɛɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɛto ɛ okeba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Bea Yesu abala boo: «Kebani! Pɛpɛ onodjani ehole ɛ boono esusu ta tɛkɛ, ta ilangwa la mana, ta matungea ma mohelo muu, esaka daa boo iswi la esambi lokundumodjeni, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />elengɛ nduka; tina ɛ boo esambi edabi tina ɛ bato ba ngondo esusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Pɛpɛ ohwɛni hio, ongɔɔnɔni ehole esusu; bea odihaleani ngulu ɛ olonga midjɔ misusu mibwani otaneani ko ohɔnini oema boso ba Mwana ɔ moto.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maswi ma suka ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Na busa, Yesu alehaka ta tepelo; endolo, mɔkɔmɔkɔ, akɛkɛ ahwɛ diko la ikoli ilikabee bo ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Ko bato basusu baduaka odii yo sɔɔ mɛɛnɛ ta tepelo tina ɛ omohokamedja.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Kuta diko la Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mal 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Tɛkɛ ɛ mapa ima pɛpɛ nɛngɛ mu, ɛbiamaka Pasika, tɛkɛ oimana ba bana ba Isalaele ta Edjipito, ɛimeaka mbuti. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko bahombaka ndjia ɛ owa Yesu, endolo badaka na bɔɔ ba bato.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi ahombi moda ma okaba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mal 14, 10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Bea Satana aingea ta molema ma Yudasi, ɔɔbeaka bo Isikaliote, ona ɔdaka omɔti ɔ batingami doomi na babae. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yudasi akɛɛ odii bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na bakumu ibabaneaka tepelo bɛngɛ aokane na bu ta moda ma okaba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Basepa obuke ko baokana boo bamope makondja. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudasi adhima ko abanga ohomba enɔli ɛ obakabea Yesu pɛpɛ bato odjeba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aloma batingami tina ɛ obongedja Pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mat 26, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Mal 14, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Iswi la tɛkɛ ɛ mapa imataki nɛngɛ mu laimea. Ta iswi dia la Pasika, Bayuda baowaka bana ba bhata tina ɛ olɛdja oimana ba bobo ta Edjipito. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Bea Yesu aloma Piɛlɛ nɔbɔ Yoani obala na bu boo: «Kɛɛ abɔngɛdjaeni mia ma Pasika.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bamohɔdja boo: «Okɛlea so ayebɔngɛdja hɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Abasɔmbedja boo: «Ehole eingealea no ta ibonga, osakaleani na moto omɔti alwali kulutu ɛ madiba. Mokimanani ta ndako eingealea yo <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />ko balani na moswa ndako bo: “Molehi aohɔdjaka bo: Esika eyakalea mbai Pasika na batingami ba mbai odii yo hɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Bea aoinedjaleani ekenge ɛ ndako enɛnɛ odiko, edii na midjɔ misusu mikokake. Edii esika ebɔngɛdjalea no mia.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Na bea bakɛɛ, batanea misusu oko moda mabala Yesu na bu ko babɔngɛdja mia ma Pasika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa ɛ Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mal 14, 22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ɔimea ehole ɛ oyaka, Yesu adaa ta mesa engbanga na ba apotele. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Abala na bu: «Nadaka na posa enɛnɛ ɛ oyaka na nu Pasika hee boso ba onɔngɔmɔ!<verse eid="LUK 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Tina ɛ boo, nabali na nu ohuu, nayaketebi koko na nu mia ma Pasika mbunoko okokedjama ba tingo ɛ yu ɛsusu ta Okumu ba Ndjambe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Bea Yesu atomba kɔbɔ ɛ vino, asakoa Ndjambe ko abala boo: «Tombani kɔbɔ hee ɛ vino, ko ye mwani ino basusu; <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />tina ɛ boo, nabali na nu ohuu, donga hadɛdi namwɛtebi koko vino mbunoko odoa ba Okumu ba Ndjambe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Bea atombi ipa, ko ngɔngɔ dja osakoa Ndjambe, alibuki ko abapi lo aiko bala boo: «Hee edii mokuku ma mbai imokabami tina ɛ boono. Kɔɔni bea ta olɛdjani.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ngɔngɔ dja oyaka, Yesu atombi koko kɔbɔ ɛ vino aiko bala boo: «Kɔbɔ hee edii edimaneli ɛ yanie odii Ndjambe tina ɛ makia ma mbai imasopei tina ɛ boono. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Endolo hokeani: mokabi ɔ mbai adii haa ta mesa engbanga na mbai! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Sooti, Mwana ɔ moto akabamalea okimana na ebɔngɛdjɛli ɛ Ndjambe; endolo ndjokwa odii mokabi ɔ nde!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Bea batingami babanga osahɔdjana ta odjeba ndani ta ndanda ɛ bobo oboanaka okɔ bea.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Motingami onoi bamina nde nda?</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 20:24-28">Mat 20, 24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:41-45">Mal 10, 41-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Na bea batingami basabaleana na ngulu mɛɛnɛ tina ɛ odjeba ndani ta ndanda ɛ bobo oonɔi baminande. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Bakumu ba mabota bakanɔngedjae bato, endolo oko ibo bakapale boo babaenɛ: “bato ba mikɔ mipele.” <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Endolo etaboana okɔɔmɔ bea ta ndanda ɛ boono. Ona onɔi ta ndanda ɛ boono aboani boo adae elengɛ yɛngɛ mokɛkɛ, ko ona ɔkondjaka baminande aboani adae elengɛ mokɔmɛdjɛli ɔ bato. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Na bea onɔi ta ndanda ɛ boono, edii ona odii ta mesa kaoko ona odii mokɔmɛdjeli ɔ bato? Edii ona odii ta mesa, editi bea? Na bea, mbai nadii ta ndanda ɛ boono elengɛ mokɔmɛdjɛli! <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Ɔyeyoani na mbai ta mameko ma mbai. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Elɛngɛ Tata opani yo Okumu edii oko moda mua mbai koko na opini: <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />oyakabini ko omwabini ta mesa ɛ mbai ta Okumu ba mbai, ko odabini ta ngbɛndɛ tina ɛ osambɛdja mabota doomi na mabae ma Isalɛlɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai boo Piɛlɛ amoinganalea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mal 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />«Simo, Simo! Hokamedja: Satana ahɔdjai ndjia bɛngɛ boo aopupoleni ino basusu elengɛ okapupole bo mbuma tina ɛ ohɔ idjipele. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Endolo naongɔɔni tina ɛ wɛ, boo osaka taka edhimeli. Ko ehole esɔmbɔbi wɛ odii mbai, tomapingedja bana ba ngwao baami.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Kumu, nadii mbuti okɛ na wɛ ta bɔlɔkɔ ko noko ogwa na wɛ esika emɔti.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Naobaleaka ohuu, Piɛlɛ, boso ba eyɛ ɛ busa, kɔkɔ pɛpɛ opeta kɔkɔlɔ, oinganaleani mbala isato boo todjebeni.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Falanga, tɔmbi na mopata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Ehole ɛolomani mbai ta elomu ɔidakani na ikondja, pɛpɛ tɔmbi, pɛpɛ sapato, eka ɛtaka no nda?» Bamosɔmbɛdja bo: «Pɛpɛ eka» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Bea abala na bu bo: «Endolo hadɛdi, ona odi na ikondja alitombe, moda momɔti na ona odi na tɔmbi; ko ona odii pɛpɛ mopata atɛkɛ esendja ɛ nde bɛngɛ bo asombe mopata. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Tin'ɛ bo, nabali na nu ohuu, eboani bo ebaeli edii ta tei ɛ Makomi ɛkokedjame tina ɛ mbai: “Alangama ta motwuia ma bato babe.” Na bea, modjɔ modi tina ɛ mbai modoi akokedjama.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Batingami babala boo: «Kumu, hokea, mipata mibae.» Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ekoki bea!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aongɔni ta ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mal 14, 32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu aimana ta ibonga ko akɛɛ ta ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive, okimana na moda ma nde. Batingami ba nde bamokimana. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ehole eimia yo ta esika ena, abala na bu boo: «Ongɔnɔni bɛngɛ boo osakakwani ta omekama.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ngɔngɔ djia asasua na bu maa ohali, adaa magunda ko aongɔnɔ na bibaeli bi: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Tata, okapala, dongedja ohali na mbai kɔbɔ hee ɛ saya. Noko bea, etadaa opala ba mbai, endolo ba wɛ.» [<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Bea obwɛndi ɔlomama na Ndjambe adoa tina ɛ omopingedja. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ɔmopea okɛsɛli, Yesu aongɔɔnɔ koko na opipo onɔ. Ipetola la nde laimea elengɛ matangaka ma makia imakwaka ta kpɔtɔ.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ɔsidja Yesu oongɔnɔ, aema, asɔmbɔ odii batingami ko abatanea bahwɛli, badaka baembɛkɛ tina ɛ na ndjokwa ɛ bobo. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Abala na bu boo: «Ohwɛlini tina nda? Emani ko ongɔnɔni, bɛngɛ boo osakakwani ta omekama.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opeama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mal 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoa 18, 3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Oko ena Yesu apeli abala bea bato bike bamoimanea. Yudasi, omɔti ɔ batingami doomi na babae, alɔndɔkɔ bato bia; abatama mbuti na Yesu tina ɛ omoisea ɛ ekɔpi. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Yudasi, odoi akaba Mwana ɔ moto na ndjia ɛ omodinga ekɔpi?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ehole ɛnɛ bato ibadalaka na Yesu mua imahombaka makɔme, bamohɔdja boo: «Kumu, loboani oona na mipata ma boso?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ko omɔti ɔ bobo aboma mosali ɔ nganga monɛnɛ ko amokɛsɛ itoi la ebɔ ɛ bami. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Endolo Yesu abala boo: «Kinani, ekoki bea!» Abinga itoi la moto ona ko amoheledja.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu abala na bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe, bakumu ba babaneli ba tepelo ko na basuku ibaduaka amopea bo: «Odoini odii mbai na mipata ko na bikenge ba mele elengɛ nadi moibi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Nadaka na nu maswi masusu ta tepelo ko oihɔnɔni opeani. Endolo hadedi edi ehole ɛ boono ko na ngulu ɛ modidi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26, 57-58</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mal 14, 53-54</ref>.<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoa 18, 12-18</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ngɔngɔ dja opea Yesu, bakɛɛ na nde ko bamoingedja ta ndako ɛ nganga monɛnɛ. Piɛlɛ amokimanaka ohali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Bayodja mosa ta ndanda ɛ tiangando ko Piɛlɛ akɛɛ ada engbanga emɔti na bato ibadaka baoka mosa. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mosali mwali omɔti amoenɛ adi mbuti na mosa; amotingea miso ko abala na nde boo: «Moto ho koko adaka na nde!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Endolo Piɛlɛ amoinganea abala na nde ohuu bo: «Mawɛ na mbai nda! Natamodjebaka.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ngɔngɔ dja ma ehole mokɛkɛ, okina moto amoenɛ ko abala boo: «Wɛ koko, odii omɔti ɔ bato ba nde!» Endolo Piɛlɛ abala na moto ona boo: «Pɛpɛ, editi sooti.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Mbuti na ngonga emɔti, moto okina koko abala na opipo boo: «Soti mɛnɛ moto hoo adaka na nde, tina ɛ boo adii moto ɔ Galilai.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Endolo Piɛlɛ asɔmbɛjda boo: «Odeino na mbai enao! Nitadjebaka mua mapalaka wɛ ɔbale!» Oko ta ehole ena ɛbalaka yo, kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Yesu ahombana ko atingea Piɛlɛ miso. Bea Piɛlɛ alɛdja moda imabala yo na nde boo: «Oinganaleani ta eyɛ busa boso ba bo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle, mbala isato obalalea bo otadjebakani.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Piɛlɛ aimana osokolu ko ayea obuke.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basingi Yesu ko bamobomi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26, 67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mal 14, 65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Bato ibabaneaka Yesu bamosɛkɛkɛ ko bamobomaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bahua mbanda ɛ nde ko bamohɔdjaka boo: «Obomi nda? Lodjebedja!» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Ko bamosingaka na mida misusu.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso ba esambedjɛli enɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26, 59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mal 14, 55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoa 18, 19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ehole eya busa, basuku ba ngando, bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe ko bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko babolama esika emɔti. Badoa na Yesu ta esambedjɛli enɛnɛ ɛ Bayuda <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />ko bamohɔdja bo: «Lotɔndo, odii Masiya?» Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Odimeteleanini nakaotɔndɔni, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />ko naka ohɔdjani ihɔdja, osɔmbɛdjɛteleanini. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Endolo donga hadɛdi Mwana ɔ moto adalea ta ebɔ ɛbami ɛ Ndjambe ɔ ngulu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bagama ibo basusu na ngulu: «Wɛ odii Mwana ɔ Ndjambe?» Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Obalini bea ino mɛnɛ: nadii.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Na bea babakea boo: «Loditi koko na tina ɛ tati! Iso mɛɛnɛ looki bibaeli ba nde mɛɛnɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso ba Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mal 15, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Bato ba ibolea basusu baema ko bakɛɛ na Yesu boso ba Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Eho, babanga omopunda boo: «Iso lotanei moto hoo apeli aomodja bato ba booso: Abala na bu bo bataputa puti ɛ kumu Kaisala ko asakumedja boo adii Masiya, Kumu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Wɛ, odii kumu ɔ Bayuda?» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii wɛ, obali bea.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato abala na bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe ko na bato bike ibadaka ena boo: «Naeniti modjɔ mobe moboani odumba moto hoo na ikambo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Endolo ibo babala ohuu na ngulu boo: «Yo aomodjaka bato na bileho ba nde. Abanga ta Galilai, anɔɔ ta Yuda esusu ko, hadɛdi, adoi kokoko ha.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso ba Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Ehole ɛoka Pilato bibaeli bia, ahɔdja boo: «Moto hoo edii yo ɔ Galilai?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ɔoka yo boo Yesu adaka moto ɔ ekenge ɛ ngando ɛdaka Elode kumu, amoloma odii Elode tina ɛ boo Elode adaka ta Yelusalema ta maswi mia. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Elode asepa oenɛ Yesu, tina ɛ boo, ehole eyai aoka gala ɛ nde ko adaka na posa ɛ osaka na nde; aisaka molema boo Yesu amoinedjae embete emɔti ɛ okamoa. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Amohɔdja mahɔdja mike, endolo Yesu aimosɔmbɛdja noko modjɔ momɔti. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe ko bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko badaka ena ko bamopunda na kɛlɛ enɛnɛ mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Elode na basoda ba nde bamosɛkɛkɛ ko bamotiola. Bamolwɛdja esendja ɛ ikulaka ko bamosɔmbɛdja odii Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Elode na Pilato baiokanaka boso; ta iswi dia, baimea na bwela bopele.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adihi etumbu ɛ ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mal 15, 6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoa 18, 39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato aputoanedja bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe, bakumu ba ngando ko na bato, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ko abala na bu boo: «Ino odoini odii mbai na moto hoo boo yo apaka bato molo mopipo. Na bea, mbai namohɔdjai ta boso ba boono ko namodihiti na modjɔ momɔti mobe ta mia misusu imi mopundi na nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Elode koko amodihiti na modjɔ mobe, tina ɛ boo amosɔmbɛdjai ono odi so. Na bea, moto hoo akɔiti modjɔ mobe momɔti imoboani na nde ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Namobomedjae pimbo, ngɔngɔ djia namokinalea.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Ta masaka masusu ma tɛkɛ ɛ Pasika, Pilato adaka na elomu ɛ obatingoa moto omɔti ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Endolo ibo basusu bagama engbanga emɔti boo: «Owa moto ona! Lokinea Balaba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balaba apeamaka ta bɔlɔkɔ tina ɛ otɔmbɔ ibakɔmɔ ta ibonga ko na tina ɛ oowa moto. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato adaka na posa ɛ okina Yesu, abala koko na bu mbala ekina. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Endolo bato bagama boo: «Mobaka ta ekulusu! Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato asɔmbɔ koko obala na bu mbala ɛ basato boo: «Obe bokɔi yo nda? Mbai naeniti modjɔ mobe momɔti mokoki na nde ogwa. Namobomedjae oko pimbo ngɔngɔ djia namokinalea!» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Endolo bangaledja oko ogama na ngulu boo Yesu abakame ta ekulusu. Bea migamo ma bobo malonga. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilato apa enɔli boo bakokedjae modjɔ imahɔdjaka bo. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Pilato atingoa Balaba oko moda mapalaka bo, ona oingea ta bɔlɔkɔ tina ɛ opa bato molo mopipo ko na oowa, ko abapa Yesu bɛngɛ boo bakɔe na nde moda mapalaka bo.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mal 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Ena ɔdaka bo bakɛɛ na Yesu, basaka na Simo, moto ɔ Kulene, ona ɔhulaka ta gue. Basoda bamopea ko bamotombedja ekulusu ɛ Yesu boo adale na yu ayelwali ngɔngɔ dja nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Bato bike ba ngando badaka bakimane Yesu, na bali bike ibayeaka ko ibabakeaka mabɔ ta melo ta tina ɛ nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu ahombana odi bali bia ko abala boo: «Bali ba Yelusalema, pɛpɛ oyeani ta diko la mbai! Endolo yeani tina ɛ boono na tina ɛ bana ba boono! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Tina ɛ boo maswi maduake imabalabi bo boo: “Sepi odii bali batete, ibadii oko pɛpɛ obota ko ibadii oko pɛpɛ onungea!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Bea bato babalabi na ngomba boo: “Kwani diko la booso!” ko na makoli boo: “Lobombani!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Tina ɛ boo bakakɔɔ na mole mobesu bea, ekɔmɔlea moda ndani na mole mokakanu?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Bakɛɛ koko na bato babae, bato ba mikɔ mibe, tina ɛ obaowa engbanga emɔti na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ehole ɛimea bo ta esika ɛbeaka bo «Engbongolo ɛ molo», basoda babaka Yesu ta ekulusu ko na bato babae ba mikɔ mibe, omɔti ta ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ baami, okina ta ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ bali. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Bea Yesu abala boo: «Tata, bayɛɛ tina ɛ boo batadjebaka modjɔ makɔkɔ bo.» Basoda baboma djonga tina ɛ okaana bisendja ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Bato badaka baemi ena ko bahokeaka. Bakumu ba bayuda bamosɛkɛkɛ ena babala boo: «Aheledja bato bakina; amekesaheledja yo mɛnɛ, ekada boo adii Masiya, ona ɔhɔmɔ na Ndjambe!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Basoda koko bamosɛkɛ; basabatea mbuti na nde, bamopa mana ma ngai <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />ko babala na nde boo: «Okadaa kumu ɔ Bayuda, saheledja wɛ mɛɛnɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Diko la molo ma nde, bakoma boo: «Moto hoo adii kumu ɔ Bayuda.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Omɔti ɔ bato ba mikɔ mibe ona ɔbakama na Yesu ta ekulusu amosingaka ena abala boo: «Oditi Masiya? Saheledja wɛ mɛɛnɛ, ko loheledja koko iso!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Endolo okina amopɛlɛ ko abala na nde boo: «Wɛ tobange Ndjambe, wɛ ona odihi etumbu moda momɔti na nde? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Tina ɛ booso etumbu eboani, loputami oboana na mikɔ ma booso; endolo yo aikɔ noko modjɔ mobe momɔti!» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Bea abala na Yesu boo: «Yesu, tolɛdjani ta ehole eduabi wɛ ta okumu ba wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabalaka na wɛ sooti: busabu odalea na mbai ta paladiso.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogwa ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mal 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Edaka mbuti na ndanda ɛ busa; diso la busa lakina opa ohuu. Modidi madipa ngondo esusu mbunoko ngonga ɛ basato ngɔngɔ dja ndanda ɛ busa. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Esendja enɛnɛ ɛdaka esɛpi ta ndanda ɛ tepelo eolea biale bibae.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lido ena ɛdaka si ɛ esika esɛnokɛ na esika enoi na osɛnɔ. Ndjambe ayeola tina ɛ oenedja bo hadedi moto na moto aboani osabatea na nde, etada koko mandi ma nganga o monɛnɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu agama na ngulu boo: «Tata, nasɔmbɛdjai molimo ma mbai ta mabɔ ma wɛ!» Ɔsidja yo obala bibaeli bia, agwi. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ehole ɛɛnɛ kumu ɔ basoda modjɔ mua; akumedja Ndjambe ko abala boo: «Sooti mɛɛnɛ, moto hoo adakiti na ibunga!» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Bato bike ibadaka ena, baenɛ midjɔ mia misusu imanɔkɔ. Bea basɔmbɔ ta madie ma bobo mabo mabaki ta bupa na ndjokwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Bato basusu ibamodjebaka, na bali bia ibamokimanaka donga Galilai, baema ohali bɛngɛ bahokee mia imanɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapusei Yesu ta ikila</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mal 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Edaka na moto omɔti ena kombe ɛ nde Yosepu, ɔ ibonga la yuda la Alimate. Moto ona adaka mopele ko na odjoo, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />alɛndɛkɛ odua ba Okumu ba Ndjambe. Adaka omɔti ɔ Ikita ilinɛnɛ, endolo aidhima mia imasukedja bo ko imakɔɔ bia bakina. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Akɛɛ odii Pilato ko amosɛngɛ ndjemba ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ngɔngɔ atitedja ndjemba ɛ Yesu ta ekulusu, ayedinga na molekani ko ayesambea ta ikila ilalongama ta mondeke, iladaa bo pɛpɛ opusea moto omɔti ena. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ɛdaka iswi la batano, iladaka mbuti na ibange la sabata ɛ bobo. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bali ibadaka na Yesu engbanga donga Galilai, bakɛɛ na Yosepu, ko bahokea ikila ko baenɛ moda masambeabo ndjemba ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ngɔngɔ djia basɔmbɔ ta ibonga ko babɔngɛdja minɛ ma so epele na malasi. Bahema busa ba sabata, okimana na mobeko.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Opusoama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mal 16, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-13">Yoa 20, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ta eyɛ ɛ busa ta busa ba eyenga, bali bakɛɛ ta ikila, na minɛ ma so epele imabɔngɛdja bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Batanea boo mondeke monɛnɛ imadipaka monɔkɔ ma ikila modii mohilingoanake o yɛɛlɛ; <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />baingia otei, endolo baitanea ndjemba ɛ Kumu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Baidjeba eka ɛ okɔ, oko ta ehole ena baami babae baimea ibadaka balwali bisendja baongɛngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Babanga ko basunea mbanda dja bobo nase, baami bia babala boo: «Ohombakani ona odii na mohelo ta ndanda ɛ bago tina nda? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Aditi haa, apusoi. Lɛdjani moda mabala yo na nu ehole ɛdaka yo ta Galilai boo: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />“Eboani boo Mwana ɔ moto akabame ta mabɔ ma bato ba masumu, abakame ta ekulusu ko ngɔngɔ dja maswi masato apusoe ta ogwa.”» <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Bea bali balɛdjana bibaeli ba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Badonga ta ikila ko bakɛɛ atɔndɔɔ midjɔ mia misusu odii batingami doomi na omɔti ko na batingami bakina. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Ɛdaka Malia ɔ Magadala, Yoana na Malia nɛngɛ ɛ Djake. Bali bakina ibadaka na bu engbanga batɔndɔɔ koko gala ena odii ba apotele. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Endolo batingami balɛdjaka boo edii midjɔ ma pɛpɛ tina ko baibadhimea. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Na bea Piɛlɛ aema ko apeta ta ikila; asunama ko aenɛ oko biale ba molekani. Bea asɔmbɔ odii yo, na okamoa bonɛnɛ ta mua imakɔɔmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ta ndjia ɛ Emausu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mal 16, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Oko ta iswi dia, batingami babae bakɛkɛ ta ngando ɛbeaka bo Emausu, ɛdaka na Yelusalema ohali ba ngonga ibae dja mɔndɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Ena ɔdaka bo badale basoolaka diko la midjɔ misusu mia imanɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ehole ɛdaka bo babale ko babome kite, Yesu yo mɛɛnɛ abatama ko adala na bu engbanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bamoenɛkɛ, endolo modjɔ momɔti mabasiaka boo batamodjeba. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Modjɔ mabomaka no kitɛ nda?» Ko baema, na ndjokwa esusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Omɔti ta ndanda ɛ bobo, obeaka bo Keleopa, abala na nde boo: «Edii oko wɛ haa ta Yelusalema, odii pɛpɛ odjeba muu mahulake anɔɔ ta maswi mii?» – <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yo abahɔdja boo: «Mua modjɔ nda?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Modjɔ mokɔɔmi na Yesu ɔ Nasaleta! Adaka motɛli ɔ ngulu; asainedja na mikɔ ko bibaeli ba nde boso ba Ndjambe ko boso ba bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe ba booso na bakumu ba booso bamokabi mbunoko etumbu ɛ ogwa ko bamobaki ta ekulusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Iso labakeaka milema diko la nde boo adalea ona oboanaki boo asikoe Isalaele. Endolo diko la midjɔ mia misusu, busabu edii iswi la basato donga okɔɔmi midjɔ mia. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Bea, bali bakina ba engbanga ɛ booso balokamodjai. Bakɛki sɔɔ hee ta ɛyɛ busa ta ikila <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />endolo bataneiti ndjemba ɛ nde. Bahuli alotɔndɔ boo baeni babwɛndi ko babadjebedjai boo adii ta mohelo. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bakina baminasu bakɛi ta ikila ko batanei misusu oko moda mabala bali bia, endolo yo, bamoeniti.» <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Bea Yesu abali na bu boo: «Tina ndani otakini esipoli, odini na motɛnɔ ta odhima midjɔ misusu imadjebedja batɛli! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ɛiboanaka boo Masiya anɔngɔme boso ba oingea ta ekumu ɛ nde?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Na bea abatingodja mia imabalama tina ɛ nde otei ba Makomi, banga mikanda ma Mose mbunoko mikanda misusu ma batɛli.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ehole ɛimea bo mbuti na ngando ena ekɛkɛ bo, Yesu akɔɔ elengɛ boo apalaka anɔe. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Endolo ibo bamosia ko babala na nde boo: «Dikama na su; busa botiti ko bulu bobatami.» Aingea ta ndako tina ɛ oda na bu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Adaa na bu ta mesa engbanga emɔti, atomba mapa ko asakoa Ndjambe; na bea abuki mapa ko abapi mo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Bea, miso mabobo madipoa, ko bamodjeba, endolo alɛmɔɔ ta boso ba bobo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Basabaleana boo: «Molema ma boso modakiti na sepi ehole elotingodjaki yo Makomi?»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Baema pɛpɛlɛ ko basɔmbɔ ta Yelusalema. Batanea batingami doomi na omɔti ibadaka esika emɔti na baminabu, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />ibabalaka boo: «Sooti mɛɛnɛ Kumu apusoi! Simo amoeni!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Batingami bia babae babatɔndɔɔ mua imakɔɔmɔ na bu na ndjia ko moda madjeba bo Yesu ta ehole ɛbuka yo ipa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asaenɛmɛdjai odii batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mal 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mis 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Oko ta ehole ɛdaka batingami babala midjɔ mia, Yesu yo mɛɛnɛ asaenɛmɛdja ta ndanda ɛ bobo ko abala na bu boo: «Bogoo badae na nu!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Batingami baluma na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ, tina ɛ balɛdjaka boo baeni mongɔli. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Endolo Yesu abala na bu boo: «Oyeketanini tina nda? Tina ndani odini na kitɛ otei ba milema ma boono? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Hokeani mabɔ na bigbota ba mbai: edii oko mbai! Mɔmɔnini ko hokeani, tina ɛ boo mongɔli aditi na muni ko na kua, endolo mbai nadii na muni na kua.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ena ɔbalaka yo bea abainedja mabɔ na bigbota ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Batingami baluma na sepi ko na okamoa. Ena odaka bo oko pɛpɛ opeta dhima, mbunoko Yesu abahɔdja boo: «Odini na mɛɛka ɔ oyaka haa?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bamopa ekenge ɛ moswi ekalangamake. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Ayetomba ko ayeyaka boso ba bobo. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Bea abala na bu boo: «Ehole ɛdaka mbai na nu hokeani midjɔ mabalaka mbai na nu ohuu: mua imakomama tina ɛ mbai ta mobeko ma Mose, ta mikanda ma batɛli ko ta mikanda ma Biembo, midjɔ mia misusu mabuanaka boo makɔɔme.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Bea adipoa owɛi ba bobo bɛngɛ boo basipoe Makomi, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />ko abala na bu boo: «Hokeani mua imakomama: Masiya aboani onɔngɔmɔ, bea apusolea ta tei ɛ bago ngɔngɔ la iswi la basato, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />ko eboani bo balehe diko la kombe ɛ nde ta mabota masusu, obanga ta Yelusalema; ta obea bato boo basɔmbɔtɔne mida ma bobo ko bayɛɛme ta masumu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Ino odini batemo ba midjɔ mia misusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ko naolomalea diko la boono mua imabunedjani Tata. Ta tina ɛ boono, dikamani ta ibonga mbunoko okalumaleani na ngulu ɛ diko.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aihwei o diko</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mal 16, 19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mis 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Bea Yesu akɛɛ na batingami ba nde sokolu ɛ ibonga, mbuti na Betania, ko oho, angangodja mabɔ ko abadjongoa. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ehole ɛdaka yo abadjongoa, abɔtɔɔ na bu ko aihwea o diko. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ta tina ɛ bobo, bakwa magunda boso ba Yesu ko basɔmbɔ ta Yelusalema, na sepi enɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Bihole bisusu bakumedjaka Ndjambe ta tepelo.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>